window.STUDY_GUIDE = {"id":"ccaf-guide","title":"Claude Certified Architect — Foundations 認證讀書指南","title_html":"Claude Certified Architect — Foundations 認證讀書指南","source":{"label":"paullarionov/claude-certified-architect — guide_en.md","url":"https://github.com/paullarionov/claude-certified-architect/blob/main/guide_en.md"},"generated_from":"guide_ccaf_zh.md","preamble":[{"type":"quote","html":"出處：本頁內容翻譯整理自 Paul Larionov 的開源讀書指南 <a href=\"https://github.com/paullarionov/claude-certified-architect/blob/main/guide_en.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">claude-certified-architect / guide_en.md</a>（依官方 Exam Guide 撰寫）。中文翻譯僅供學習參考，專有名詞一律保留英文；若與原文有出入，以原文為準。"}],"parts":[{"title":"考試總覽","title_html":"考試總覽","pages":["part0-1","part0-2","part0-3","part0-4"]},{"title":"第一部：理論基礎","title_html":"第一部：理論基礎","pages":["ch-1","ch-2","ch-3","ch-4","ch-5","ch-6","ch-7","ch-8","ch-9","ch-10","ch-11","ch-12","ch-13"]},{"title":"第二部：考試 Domain 筆記","title_html":"第二部：考試 Domain 筆記","pages":["domain-1","domain-2","domain-3","domain-4","domain-5"]},{"title":"試題","title_html":"試題","pages":["quiz-1","quiz-2"]},{"title":"練習與附錄","title_html":"練習與附錄","pages":["part4-1","part4-2","part4-3","part4-4"]}],"pages":[{"slug":"part0-1","title":"考試簡介與應試者輪廓","title_html":"考試簡介與應試者輪廓","part":0,"kind":"text","read_minutes":2,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"這張證照在驗證什麼","slug":"這張證照在驗證什麼"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Claude Certified Architect — Foundations</strong> 認證確認一位專業人士在實作真實世界的 Claude 解決方案時，能做出合理的取捨（trade-off）決策。考試評量的是四項核心技術的基礎知識：<strong>Claude Code</strong>、<strong>Claude Agent SDK</strong>、<strong>Claude API</strong>，以及 <strong>Model Context Protocol（MCP）</strong>——這些是用 Claude 打造 production 應用的核心技術。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"考題都建立在真實的產業情境上：為客服建立 agentic 系統、設計多 agent 的研究 pipeline、把 Claude Code 整合進 CI/CD、打造開發者生產力工具，以及從非結構化文件中抽取結構化資料。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"目標應試者","slug":"目標應試者"},{"type":"p","html":"理想的應試者是一位 <strong>solution architect</strong>，負責設計並交付以 Claude 為基礎的 production 應用。你應該有至少 6 個月以下項目的實作經驗：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<strong>Claude Agent SDK</strong>：多 agent 編排（orchestration）、委派給 subagent、tool 整合、lifecycle hooks","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Claude Code</strong>：CLAUDE.md、MCP servers、Agent Skills、planning mode","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Model Context Protocol（MCP）</strong>：用 tools 與 resources 整合後端系統","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Prompt engineering</strong>：JSON schema、few-shot 範例、資料抽取模板","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Context window</strong>：處理長文件、多 agent 之間傳遞 context","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>CI/CD pipeline</strong>：自動化 code review、測試產生","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Escalation 與可靠性</strong>：錯誤處理、human-in-the-loop","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"考試形式","slug":"考試形式"},{"type":"table","headers":["項目","內容"],"rows":[["題型","單選題（4 選 1）"],["計分","100–1000 分制，及格分數 <strong>720</strong>"],["猜錯扣分","沒有（每一題都要作答！）"],["情境","8 個可能情境中隨機抽 4 個"]]}],"headings":[{"slug":"這張證照在驗證什麼","title":"這張證照在驗證什麼"},{"slug":"目標應試者","title":"目標應試者"},{"slug":"考試形式","title":"考試形式"}]},{"slug":"part0-2","title":"五大考試領域（Domains）","title_html":"五大考試領域（Domains）","part":0,"kind":"text","read_minutes":1,"blocks":[{"type":"table","headers":["Domain","權重"],"rows":[["1. Agent 架構與編排（Agent architecture and orchestration）","<strong>27%</strong>"],["2. Tool 設計與 MCP 整合（Tool design and MCP integration）","<strong>18%</strong>"],["3. Claude Code 設定與工作流程（Claude Code configuration and workflows）","<strong>20%</strong>"],["4. Prompt engineering 與結構化輸出（Prompt engineering and structured output）","<strong>20%</strong>"],["5. Context 管理與可靠性（Context management and reliability）","<strong>15%</strong>"]]}],"headings":[]},{"slug":"part0-3","title":"八個考試情境（Scenarios）","title_html":"八個考試情境（Scenarios）","part":0,"kind":"text","read_minutes":3,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"情境 1：Customer Support Agent（客服 agent）","slug":"情境-1-customer-support-agent-客服-agent"},{"type":"p","html":"你用 Claude Agent SDK 建立一個處理退貨、帳單爭議與帳號問題的 agent。Agent 使用 MCP tools（<code>get_customer</code>、<code>lookup_order</code>、<code>process_refund</code>、<code>escalate_to_human</code>）。目標是 80% 以上的首次接觸解決率（first-contact resolution），並在適當時機 escalate 給人類。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"情境 2：Code Generation with Claude Code（用 Claude Code 產生程式碼）","slug":"情境-2-code-generation-with-claude-code-用-claude-code-產生程式碼"},{"type":"p","html":"你用 Claude Code 加速開發：產生程式碼、重構、除錯、撰寫文件。你需要整合自訂 slash commands 與 CLAUDE.md 設定，並知道何時該用 planning mode。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"情境 3：Multi-Agent Research System（多 agent 研究系統）","slug":"情境-3-multi-agent-research-system-多-agent-研究系統"},{"type":"p","html":"一個 coordinator agent 把任務委派給專門的 subagents：web research、document analysis、synthesis、report generation。系統必須產出附帶引用來源（citations）的完整報告。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"情境 4：Developer Productivity Tools（開發者生產力工具）","slug":"情境-4-developer-productivity-tools-開發者生產力工具"},{"type":"p","html":"Agent 協助工程師探索不熟悉的 codebase、產生 boilerplate 程式碼、自動化例行工作。會用到內建 tools（Read、Write、Bash、Grep、Glob）與 MCP servers。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"情境 5：Claude Code for Continuous Integration（CI 中的 Claude Code）","slug":"情境-5-claude-code-for-continuous-integration-ci-中的-claude-cod"},{"type":"p","html":"把 Claude Code 整合進 CI/CD pipeline，做自動化 code review、測試產生與 pull request 回饋。Prompt 設計必須盡量減少 false positive（誤報）。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"情境 6：Structured Data Extraction（結構化資料抽取）","slug":"情境-6-structured-data-extraction-結構化資料抽取"},{"type":"p","html":"系統從非結構化文件中抽取資訊、用 JSON schema 驗證輸出，並維持高準確率。必須正確處理邊界案例（edge cases）。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"情境 7：Conversational AI Architecture Patterns（對話式 AI 架構模式）","slug":"情境-7-conversational-ai-architecture-patterns-對話式-ai-架構模式"},{"type":"p","html":"你設計多輪對話系統，涵蓋 context window 管理、跨回合的指令持續性（instruction persistence）、記憶策略、安全執行的 tool 設計，以及處理模糊或彼此矛盾的使用者輸入。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"情境 8：Agentic AI Tools（內容待補）","slug":"情境-8-agentic-ai-tools-內容待補"},{"type":"p","html":"原作者註：這個情境有考生回報在正式考試中出現，但本指南尚未涵蓋。若你在考試中遇到此情境的題目，原作者邀請你到 <a href=\"https://github.com/paullarionov/claude-certified-architect/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub Issues</a> 分享，讓指南更完整。","callout":false}],"headings":[{"slug":"情境-1-customer-support-agent-客服-agent","title":"情境 1：Customer Support Agent（客服 agent）"},{"slug":"情境-2-code-generation-with-claude-code-用-claude-code-產生程式碼","title":"情境 2：Code Generation with Claude Code（用 Claude Code 產生程式碼）"},{"slug":"情境-3-multi-agent-research-system-多-agent-研究系統","title":"情境 3：Multi-Agent Research System（多 agent 研究系統）"},{"slug":"情境-4-developer-productivity-tools-開發者生產力工具","title":"情境 4：Developer Productivity Tools（開發者生產力工具）"},{"slug":"情境-5-claude-code-for-continuous-integration-ci-中的-claude-cod","title":"情境 5：Claude Code for Continuous Integration（CI 中的 Claude Code）"},{"slug":"情境-6-structured-data-extraction-結構化資料抽取","title":"情境 6：Structured Data Extraction（結構化資料抽取）"},{"slug":"情境-7-conversational-ai-architecture-patterns-對話式-ai-架構模式","title":"情境 7：Conversational AI Architecture Patterns（對話式 AI 架構模式）"},{"slug":"情境-8-agentic-ai-tools-內容待補","title":"情境 8：Agentic AI Tools（內容待補）"}]},{"slug":"part0-4","title":"官方文件索引","title_html":"官方文件索引","part":0,"kind":"text","read_minutes":4,"blocks":[{"type":"table","headers":["資源","URL"],"rows":[["<strong>Claude API — Messages</strong>","<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/messages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/messages</a>"],["<strong>Claude API — Tool Use</strong>","<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/tool-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/tool-use</a>"],["<strong>Claude API — Message Batches</strong>","<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/message-batches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/message-batches</a>"],["<strong>Claude Agent SDK — Overview</strong>","<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/overview</a>"],["<strong>Claude Agent SDK — Hooks</strong>","<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/hooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/hooks</a>"],["<strong>Claude Agent SDK — Subagents</strong>","<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/subagents\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/subagents</a>"],["<strong>Claude Agent SDK — Sessions</strong>","<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/sessions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/sessions</a>"],["<strong>Model Context Protocol（MCP）</strong>","<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://modelcontextprotocol.io/</a>"],["<strong>MCP — Tools</strong>","<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/concepts/tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/concepts/tools</a>"],["<strong>MCP — Resources</strong>","<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/concepts/resources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/concepts/resources</a>"],["<strong>MCP — Servers</strong>","<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/concepts/servers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/concepts/servers</a>"],["<strong>Claude Code — Documentation</strong>","<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://code.claude.com/docs/en/overview</a>"],["<strong>Claude Code — CLAUDE.md 與 Memory</strong>","<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory</a>"],["<strong>Claude Code — Skills（含 slash commands）</strong>","<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills</a>"],["<strong>Claude Code — Hooks</strong>","<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks</a>"],["<strong>Claude Code — Sub-agents</strong>","<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/sub-agents\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://code.claude.com/docs/en/sub-agents</a>"],["<strong>Claude Code — MCP 整合</strong>","<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/mcp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://code.claude.com/docs/en/mcp</a>"],["<strong>Claude Code — GitHub Actions CI/CD</strong>","<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/github-actions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://code.claude.com/docs/en/github-actions</a>"],["<strong>Claude Code — GitLab CI/CD</strong>","<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/gitlab-ci-cd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://code.claude.com/docs/en/gitlab-ci-cd</a>"],["<strong>Claude Code — Headless（非互動模式）</strong>","<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/headless\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://code.claude.com/docs/en/headless</a>"],["<strong>Prompt Engineering Guide</strong>","<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/overview</a>"],["<strong>Extended Thinking</strong>","<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/extended-thinking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/extended-thinking</a>"],["<strong>Anthropic Cookbook（程式範例）</strong>","<a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-cookbook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-cookbook</a>"]]}],"headings":[]},{"slug":"ch-1","title":"第 1 章：Claude API — 與模型互動的基礎","title_html":"第 1 章：Claude API — 與模型互動的基礎","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":6,"blocks":[{"type":"quote","html":"文件：<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/messages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Messages API</a> | <a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Prompt Engineering</a>"},{"type":"p","html":"這一部涵蓋通過考試所需的全部理論。內容依技術與概念組織，而不是依考試 domain，這樣比較容易對每個主題建立深入理解。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.1 API 請求結構","slug":"1-1-api-請求結構"},{"type":"p","html":"Claude API 採 request–response 模型。每一次對 Claude Messages API 的請求包含：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 1024,\n  \"system\": \"You are a helpful assistant.\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hi!\"},\n    {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Hello!\"},\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"How are you?\"}\n  ],\n  \"tools\": [...],\n  \"tool_choice\": {\"type\": \"auto\"}\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>重要欄位：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<code>model</code>：模型選擇（<code>claude-opus-4-6</code>、<code>claude-sonnet-4-6</code>、<code>claude-haiku-4-5</code>）","callout":false},{"html":"<code>max_tokens</code>：回應的最大 token 數","callout":false},{"html":"<code>system</code>：system prompt（定義模型行為）","callout":false},{"html":"<code>messages</code>：對話歷史（<strong>必須送出完整歷史</strong>才能維持連貫）","callout":false},{"html":"<code>tools</code>：可用 tool 的定義","callout":false},{"html":"<code>tool_choice</code>：tool 選擇策略","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.2 訊息角色（Message Roles）","slug":"1-2-訊息角色-message-roles"},{"type":"p","html":"<code>messages</code> 陣列使用兩個對話角色，加上一個指令角色：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<code>user</code>：使用者訊息，<strong>包含 tool 結果</strong>（tool 結果是以 <code>user</code> 角色訊息中的 <code>tool_result</code> content block 送出，不是獨立的 <code>tool</code> 角色）","callout":false},{"html":"<code>assistant</code>：模型回應（送歷史時要包含），包含 tool 呼叫請求（<code>tool_use</code> content block）","callout":false},{"html":"<code>system</code>：可透過頂層的 <code>system</code> 欄位設定（從第一回合就生效），也可以在 <code>messages</code> 中以 <code>{\"role\": \"system\", ...}</code> 內嵌（從該位置起生效，需遵守放置規則，見下方）","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"Tool 結果<strong>不是</strong>用 <code>role: \"tool\"</code> 的訊息送出。它是放在 <code>user</code> 角色訊息裡、內容包含 <code>tool_result</code> content block：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"role\": \"user\",\n  \"content\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"tool_result\",\n      \"tool_use_id\": \"toolu_01...\",\n      \"content\": \"...\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"<code>system</code> 也可以直接作為 <code>messages</code> 陣列裡的 role 出現，不只限於頂層的 <code>system</code> 參數。這是為了在對話中途加入指令，又不讓頂層 <code>system</code> 欄位的 cached prefix 失效。它有特定的放置規則：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"必須緊接在 <code>user</code> 回合（包含含有 <code>tool_result</code> block 的回合）之後，或在以 server tool use 結尾的 <code>assistant</code> 回合之後。","callout":false},{"html":"必須在某個 <code>assistant</code> 回合之前，或位於陣列結尾。","callout":false},{"html":"不能夾在 <code>tool_use</code> block 與它對應的 <code>tool_result</code> 之間，否則回傳 400 錯誤。","callout":false},{"html":"較後面的 <code>system</code> 訊息（包含對話中途的）對其後的回合具有優先權，會覆蓋較早的訊息與頂層 <code>system</code> 欄位。","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>極為重要：</strong> 每次 API 請求都必須送出<strong>完整的對話歷史</strong>。模型不會在請求之間保存狀態，每次呼叫都是獨立的。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.3 回應中的 <code>stop_reason</code> 欄位","slug":"1-3-回應中的-stop_reason-欄位"},{"type":"p","html":"Claude API 的回應包含 <code>stop_reason</code>，說明模型為什麼停止生成：","callout":false},{"type":"table","headers":["值","說明","你該做的事"],"rows":[["<code>\"end_turn\"</code>","模型完成回應","把結果呈現給使用者"],["<code>\"tool_use\"</code>","模型想呼叫 tool","執行 tool 並回傳結果"],["<code>\"max_tokens\"</code>","達到 token 上限","回應被截斷，可能需要提高上限"],["<code>\"stop_sequence\"</code>","遇到 stop sequence","依你的應用邏輯處理"]]},{"type":"p","html":"對 agentic 系統而言，<code>\"tool_use\"</code> 與 <code>\"end_turn\"</code> 最重要，它們控制整個 agent loop。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.4 System Prompt","slug":"1-4-system-prompt"},{"type":"p","html":"System prompt 是一段特殊指令，定義 context 與行為規則。它：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"不屬於 <code>messages</code> 陣列，而是另外放在 <code>system</code> 欄位","callout":false},{"html":"優先權高於使用者訊息","callout":false},{"html":"載入一次，整段對話都適用","callout":false},{"html":"用來定義角色、限制與輸出格式","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>考試重點：</strong> system prompt 的措辭可能造成非預期的 tool 關聯。例如「always verify the customer（一律先驗證客戶）」這類指令，會讓模型過度使用 <code>get_customer</code>，即使根本不需要。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.5 Context Window","slug":"1-5-context-window"},{"type":"p","html":"Context window 是模型一次能處理的文字總量（以 token 計）。它包含：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"System prompt","callout":false},{"html":"完整的訊息歷史","callout":false},{"html":"Tool 定義","callout":false},{"html":"Tool 結果","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Context window 的關鍵問題：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"<strong>Lost-in-the-middle 效應：</strong> 模型能可靠處理長輸入的開頭與結尾，但可能漏掉中間的細節。緩解方式：把關鍵資訊放在開頭或結尾附近。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Tool 結果的累積：</strong> 每一次 tool 呼叫都會把輸出加進 context。若一個 tool 回傳 40 多個欄位、但只有 5 個有用，大部分 context 就被浪費了。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>漸進式摘要（progressive summarization）：</strong> 壓縮歷史時，數值、百分比與日期常會遺失，變成模糊的說法（「大約」、「差不多」、「幾個」）。","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"1-1-api-請求結構","title":"1.1 API 請求結構"},{"slug":"1-2-訊息角色-message-roles","title":"1.2 訊息角色（Message Roles）"},{"slug":"1-3-回應中的-stop_reason-欄位","title":"1.3 回應中的 stop_reason 欄位"},{"slug":"1-4-system-prompt","title":"1.4 System Prompt"},{"slug":"1-5-context-window","title":"1.5 Context Window"}]},{"slug":"ch-2","title":"第 2 章：Tools 與 tool_use","title_html":"第 2 章：Tools 與 <code>tool_use</code>","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":6,"blocks":[{"type":"quote","html":"文件：<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/tool-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tool Use</a>"},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"2.1 什麼是 <code>tool_use</code>","slug":"2-1-什麼是-tool_use"},{"type":"p","html":"<code>tool_use</code> 是讓 Claude 呼叫外部函式的機制。模型並不直接執行程式碼，而是產生一個結構化的 tool 呼叫請求；由你的程式執行並回傳結果。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"2.2 Tool 定義","slug":"2-2-tool-定義"},{"type":"p","html":"每個 tool 都用 JSON schema 定義：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"get_customer\",\n  \"description\": \"Finds a customer by email or ID. Returns the customer profile, including name, email, order history, and account status. Use this tool BEFORE lookup_order to verify the customer's identity. Accepts an email (format: user@domain.com) or a numeric customer_id.\",\n  \"input_schema\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"email\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Customer email\"},\n      \"customer_id\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"description\": \"Numeric customer ID\"}\n    },\n    \"required\": []\n  }\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Tool description 的關鍵要點：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"<strong>Description 是 tool 選擇的主要機制。</strong> LLM 依據 description 選擇 tool。過於精簡的描述（例如「Retrieves customer information」）在多個 tool 功能重疊時會導致選錯。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Description 應包含：</strong>","callout":false,"children":[{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"Tool 做什麼、回傳什麼","callout":false},{"html":"輸入格式與範例值","callout":false},{"html":"邊界案例與限制","callout":false},{"html":"何時該用這個 tool、何時該用相似的替代 tool","callout":false}]}]},{"html":"<strong>避免</strong>多個 tool 的描述相同或重疊。如果 <code>analyze_content</code> 與 <code>analyze_document</code> 的描述幾乎一樣，模型會搞混。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>內建 tools 與 MCP tools：</strong> agent 可能偏好內建 tools（Read、Grep）而非功能相似的 MCP tools。要避免這點，就強化 MCP tool 的 description：突顯具體優勢、獨有資料，或內建 tool 提供不了的 context。","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"2.3 <code>tool_choice</code> 參數","slug":"2-3-tool_choice-參數"},{"type":"p","html":"<code>tool_choice</code> 控制模型如何選擇 tool：","callout":false},{"type":"table","headers":["值","行為","使用時機"],"rows":[["<code>{\"type\": \"auto\"}</code>","模型自行決定要呼叫 tool 還是以文字回答","大多數情況的預設"],["<code>{\"type\": \"any\"}</code>","模型<strong>必須</strong>呼叫某個 tool","需要保證結構化輸出時"],["<code>{\"type\": \"tool\", \"name\": \"extract_metadata\"}</code>","模型<strong>必須</strong>呼叫指定的 tool","需要強制第一步 / 執行順序時"]]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>重要情境：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<code>tool_choice: \"any\"</code> + 多個抽取用 tool → 模型挑最合適的一個，但你仍然一定會拿到結構化輸出","callout":false},{"html":"強制指定 → 必須保證特定的第一個動作時（例如先 <code>extract_metadata</code> 再做 enrichment）","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"2.4 用 JSON Schema 做結構化輸出","slug":"2-4-用-json-schema-做結構化輸出"},{"type":"p","html":"搭配 JSON schema 使用 <code>tool_use</code>，是從 Claude 取得結構化輸出<strong>最可靠</strong>的方式。它：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"保證語法正確的 JSON（不會少括號、不會有多餘逗號）","callout":false},{"html":"強制要求的結構（required 欄位一定存在）","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>不</strong>保證語意正確（值仍然可能是錯的）","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Schema 設計的關鍵原則：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"category\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"bug\", \"feature\", \"docs\", \"unclear\", \"other\"]\n    },\n    \"category_detail\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n      \"description\": \"Details if category = 'other' or 'unclear'\"\n    },\n    \"severity\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"critical\", \"high\", \"medium\", \"low\"]\n    },\n    \"confidence\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"minimum\": 0,\n      \"maximum\": 1\n    },\n    \"optional_field\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n      \"description\": \"Null if the information was not found in the source\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"category\", \"severity\"]\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Schema 設計規則：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"<strong>Required 與 optional：</strong> 只有資訊一定存在時才標為 required。Required 欄位會逼模型在資料缺失時捏造（fabricate）值。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Nullable 欄位：</strong> 對可能不存在的資訊使用 <code>\"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]</code>，模型可以回傳 <code>null</code> 而不是幻覺（hallucinate）。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Enum 加上 <code>\"other\"</code>：</strong> 加入 <code>\"other\"</code> 與一個 detail 字串，避免預設分類之外的資料流失。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Enum 加上 <code>\"unclear\"</code>：</strong> 模型無法有信心地選出分類時，誠實的 <code>\"unclear\"</code> 比錯誤的分類好。","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"2.5 語法錯誤與語意錯誤","slug":"2-5-語法錯誤與語意錯誤"},{"type":"table","headers":["錯誤類型","例子","緩解方式"],"rows":[["<strong>語法（syntax）</strong>","不合法的 JSON、欄位型別錯","帶 JSON schema 的 <code>tool_use</code>（可完全消除）"],["<strong>語意（semantic）</strong>","總額加不起來、值放錯欄位、幻覺","驗證檢查、帶回饋的 retry、self-correction"]]}],"headings":[{"slug":"2-1-什麼是-tool_use","title":"2.1 什麼是 tool_use"},{"slug":"2-2-tool-定義","title":"2.2 Tool 定義"},{"slug":"2-3-tool_choice-參數","title":"2.3 tool_choice 參數"},{"slug":"2-4-用-json-schema-做結構化輸出","title":"2.4 用 JSON Schema 做結構化輸出"},{"slug":"2-5-語法錯誤與語意錯誤","title":"2.5 語法錯誤與語意錯誤"}]},{"slug":"ch-3","title":"第 3 章：Claude Agent SDK — 打造 Agentic 系統","title_html":"第 3 章：Claude Agent SDK — 打造 Agentic 系統","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":7,"blocks":[{"type":"quote","html":"文件：<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Agent SDK</a> | <a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/hooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hooks</a> | <a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/subagents\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Subagents</a> | <a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/sessions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sessions</a>"},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"3.1 什麼是 Agentic Loop","slug":"3-1-什麼是-agentic-loop"},{"type":"p","html":"Agentic loop 是自主執行任務的核心模式。模型不只是回答，而是執行一連串動作：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"1. 帶著 tools 向 Claude 送出請求\n2. 收到回應\n3. 檢查 stop_reason：\n   - \"tool_use\" -> 執行 tool，把結果加進歷史，回到步驟 1\n   - \"end_turn\" -> 任務完成，把結果呈現給使用者\n4. 重複直到完成"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>這是 model-driven（由模型驅動）的做法：</strong> Claude 根據 context 與先前的 tool 結果，決定下一個要呼叫的 tool。這和寫死的決策樹（hard-coded decision tree）不同，後者的動作順序是固定的。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>反模式（要避免）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"解析 assistant 的文字來判斷是否完成（例如找「Task completed」）","callout":false},{"html":"用任意的迭代上限（例如 <code>max_iterations=5</code>）作為主要的停止條件","callout":false},{"html":"用「assistant 是否輸出了文字內容」作為完成訊號","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>正確做法：</strong> 唯一可靠的完成訊號是 <code>stop_reason == \"end_turn\"</code>。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"3.2 <code>AgentDefinition</code> 設定","slug":"3-2-agentdefinition-設定"},{"type":"p","html":"<code>AgentDefinition</code> 是 Claude Agent SDK 中的 agent 設定物件：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"python","text":"agent = AgentDefinition(\n    name=\"customer_support\",\n    description=\"Handles customer requests for returns and order issues\",\n    system_prompt=\"You are a customer support agent...\",\n    allowed_tools=[\"get_customer\", \"lookup_order\", \"process_refund\", \"escalate_to_human\"],\n    # For a coordinator:\n    # allowed_tools=[\"Task\", \"get_customer\", ...]\n)"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>關鍵參數：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<code>name</code> / <code>description</code>：agent 的識別與描述","callout":false},{"html":"<code>system_prompt</code>：含指令的 system prompt","callout":false},{"html":"<code>allowed_tools</code>：允許使用的 tool 清單（最小權限原則，principle of least privilege）","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"3.3 Hub-and-Spoke：Coordinator 與 Subagents","slug":"3-3-hub-and-spoke-coordinator-與-subagents"},{"type":"p","html":"多 agent 架構通常採 hub-and-spoke（軸輻式）拓樸：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"         Coordinator\n        /     |      \\\n   Subagent1  Subagent2  Subagent3\n    (search)   (analysis)   (synthesis)"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Coordinator 負責：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"把任務分解（decompose）成子任務","callout":false},{"html":"決定需要哪些 subagents（動態選擇）","callout":false},{"html":"把工作委派給 subagents","callout":false},{"html":"彙整並驗證結果","callout":false},{"html":"處理錯誤與 retry","callout":false},{"html":"把結果回報給使用者","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>關鍵原則：subagents 的 context 是隔離的。</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"Subagents <strong>不會</strong>自動繼承 coordinator 的對話歷史","callout":false},{"html":"所有需要的 context 都必須在 subagent 的 prompt 裡<strong>明確傳入</strong>","callout":false},{"html":"Subagents 在不同呼叫之間不共享記憶","callout":false},{"html":"所有溝通都經過 coordinator（為了可觀測性與錯誤控制）","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"3.4 用 <code>Task</code> Tool 產生 Subagents","slug":"3-4-用-task-tool-產生-subagents"},{"type":"p","html":"Subagents 透過 <code>Task</code> tool 產生（spawn）：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"python","text":"# The coordinator's allowedTools must include \"Task\"\ncoordinator_agent = AgentDefinition(\n    allowed_tools=[\"Task\", \"get_customer\"]\n)"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>必須明確傳遞 context：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"# 不好：subagent 沒有任何 context\nTask: \"Analyze the document\"\n\n# 好：prompt 裡有完整 context\nTask: \"Analyze the following document.\nDocument: [full document text]\nPrior search results: [web search results]\nOutput format requirements: [schema]\""},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>平行產生：</strong> coordinator 可以在一次回應中呼叫多個 <code>Task</code>，subagents 會平行執行：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"# 一次 coordinator 回應裡包含：\nTask 1: \"Search for articles about X\"\nTask 2: \"Analyze document Y\"\nTask 3: \"Search for articles about Z\"\n# 三個同時執行"},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"3.5 Agent SDK 的 Hooks","slug":"3-5-agent-sdk-的-hooks"},{"type":"p","html":"Hooks 讓你能在 agent 生命週期的特定時點攔截與轉換。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>PostToolUse</strong> 在 tool 結果送給模型之前攔截：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"python","text":"# Example: normalize date formats from different MCP tools\n@hook(\"PostToolUse\")\ndef normalize_dates(tool_result):\n    # Convert Unix timestamp -> ISO 8601\n    # Convert \"Mar 5, 2025\" -> \"2025-03-05\"\n    return normalized_result"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>攔截外送呼叫的 hook</strong> 可以阻擋違反政策的動作：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"python","text":"# Example: block refunds above $500\n@hook(\"PreToolUse\")\ndef enforce_refund_limit(tool_call):\n    if tool_call.name == \"process_refund\" and tool_call.args.amount > 500:\n        return redirect_to_escalation(tool_call)"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>關鍵差異：hooks 與 prompt 指令</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"table","headers":["屬性","Hooks","Prompt 指令"],"rows":[["保證程度","<strong>確定性（deterministic）</strong>（100%）","<strong>機率性（probabilistic）</strong>（&gt;90%，但不是 100%）"],["使用時機","關鍵商業規則、金融操作、法遵","一般偏好、建議、格式"],["例子","阻擋 &gt; $500 的退款","「先嘗試解決再 escalate」"]]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>規則：</strong> 當失敗會帶來財務、法律或安全後果時，用 hooks，不要靠 prompt。","callout":false}],"headings":[{"slug":"3-1-什麼是-agentic-loop","title":"3.1 什麼是 Agentic Loop"},{"slug":"3-2-agentdefinition-設定","title":"3.2 AgentDefinition 設定"},{"slug":"3-3-hub-and-spoke-coordinator-與-subagents","title":"3.3 Hub-and-Spoke：Coordinator 與 Subagents"},{"slug":"3-4-用-task-tool-產生-subagents","title":"3.4 用 Task Tool 產生 Subagents"},{"slug":"3-5-agent-sdk-的-hooks","title":"3.5 Agent SDK 的 Hooks"}]},{"slug":"ch-4","title":"第 4 章：Model Context Protocol（MCP）","title_html":"第 4 章：Model Context Protocol（MCP）","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":4,"blocks":[{"type":"quote","html":"文件：<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MCP</a> | <a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/concepts/tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tools</a> | <a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/concepts/resources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Resources</a> | <a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/concepts/servers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Servers</a>"},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"4.1 什麼是 MCP","slug":"4-1-什麼是-mcp"},{"type":"p","html":"Model Context Protocol（MCP）是把外部系統接上 Claude 的開放協定。MCP 定義三種主要的資源型別：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"<strong>Tools</strong>：agent 可呼叫來執行動作的函式（CRUD 操作、API 呼叫、執行命令）","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Resources</strong>：agent 可讀取作為 context 的資料（文件、資料庫 schema、內容目錄）","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Prompts</strong>：常見任務的預定義 prompt 模板","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"4.2 MCP Servers","slug":"4-2-mcp-servers"},{"type":"p","html":"MCP server 是實作 MCP 協定、提供 tools/resources 的 process。連上一個 MCP server 時：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"所有 tools 會被自動探索（discover）","callout":false},{"html":"所有已連線 server 的 tools 同時可用","callout":false},{"html":"Tool description 決定模型會怎麼使用它們","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"4.3 設定 MCP Servers","slug":"4-3-設定-mcp-servers"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>專案設定（<code>.mcp.json</code>）</strong>：供團隊共用：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"github\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@modelcontextprotocol/server-github\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"GITHUB_TOKEN\": \"${GITHUB_TOKEN}\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"jira\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"mcp-server-jira\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"JIRA_TOKEN\": \"${JIRA_TOKEN}\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>重點：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<code>.mcp.json</code> 放在專案根目錄，納入版本控制","callout":false},{"html":"密鑰用環境變數（<code>${GITHUB_TOKEN}</code>），token 本身不會被 commit","callout":false},{"html":"所有專案貢獻者都能使用","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>使用者設定（<code>~/.claude.json</code>）</strong>：供個人 / 實驗性質的 server：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"存在使用者的 home 目錄","callout":false},{"html":"不透過版本控制分享","callout":false},{"html":"適合個人實驗與測試","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>選擇 server：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"標準整合（Jira、GitHub、Slack）優先用現有的社群 MCP servers","callout":false},{"html":"只有團隊獨有的工作流程才自建 server","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"4.4 MCP 的 <code>isError</code> 旗標","slug":"4-4-mcp-的-iserror-旗標"},{"type":"p","html":"MCP tool 遇到錯誤時，回應中用 <code>isError: true</code>，告知 agent 這次呼叫失敗了。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>結構化錯誤（好）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"isError\": true,\n  \"content\": {\n    \"errorCategory\": \"transient\",\n    \"isRetryable\": true,\n    \"message\": \"The service is temporarily unavailable. Timeout while calling the orders API.\",\n    \"attempted_query\": \"order_id=12345\",\n    \"partial_results\": null\n  }\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>籠統的錯誤（反模式）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"isError\": true,\n  \"content\": \"Operation failed\"\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"籠統的錯誤讓 agent 無從決策：該 retry、換個查詢，還是 escalate？","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"4.5 MCP Resources","slug":"4-5-mcp-resources"},{"type":"p","html":"Resources 是 agent 不需要採取動作就能請求、用來取得 context 的資料：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"內容目錄（例如所有專案任務的清單、階層式導覽）","callout":false},{"html":"資料庫 schema（理解資料結構）","callout":false},{"html":"文件（API reference、內部指南）","callout":false},{"html":"Issue / 任務摘要","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Resource 的優勢：</strong> agent 不需要先做探索性的 tool 呼叫來了解有哪些資料。Resource 直接提供一張「地圖」。","callout":false}],"headings":[{"slug":"4-1-什麼是-mcp","title":"4.1 什麼是 MCP"},{"slug":"4-2-mcp-servers","title":"4.2 MCP Servers"},{"slug":"4-3-設定-mcp-servers","title":"4.3 設定 MCP Servers"},{"slug":"4-4-mcp-的-iserror-旗標","title":"4.4 MCP 的 isError 旗標"},{"slug":"4-5-mcp-resources","title":"4.5 MCP Resources"}]},{"slug":"ch-5","title":"第 5 章：Claude Code — 設定與工作流程","title_html":"第 5 章：Claude Code — 設定與工作流程","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":12,"blocks":[{"type":"quote","html":"文件：<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Code</a> | <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Memory / CLAUDE.md</a> | <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Skills</a> | <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/mcp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MCP</a> | <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hooks</a> | <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/sub-agents\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sub-agents</a> | <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/github-actions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub Actions</a> | <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/headless\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Headless</a>"},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.1 CLAUDE.md 的層級","slug":"5-1-claude-md-的層級"},{"type":"p","html":"CLAUDE.md 是 Claude Code 的指令檔。有三個層級：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"1. User-level：~/.claude/CLAUDE.md\n   - 只適用於該使用者\n   - 不透過 VCS 分享\n   - 個人偏好與工作習慣\n\n2. Project-level：.claude/CLAUDE.md 或根目錄的 CLAUDE.md\n   - 適用於所有專案貢獻者\n   - 透過 VCS 管理\n   - Coding standards、測試標準、架構決策\n\n3. Directory-level：子目錄中的 CLAUDE.md\n   - 處理該目錄下的檔案時才適用\n   - 該部分 codebase 特有的慣例"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>常見錯誤：</strong> 新進成員收不到專案指令，因為指令被放在 <code>~/.claude/CLAUDE.md</code>（user-level）而不是 <code>.claude/CLAUDE.md</code>（project-level）。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.2 <code>@path</code> 語法（檔案匯入）","slug":"5-2-path-語法-檔案匯入"},{"type":"p","html":"CLAUDE.md 可以用 <code>@path</code> 引用外部檔案，讓設定模組化：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"markdown","text":"# Project CLAUDE.md\n\nCoding standards are described in @./standards/coding-style.md\nTest requirements are in @./standards/testing-requirements.md\nProject overview is in @README.md and dependencies are in @package.json"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong><code>@path</code> 的規則：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<code>@</code> 緊接在檔案路徑前（中間不能有空格）","callout":false},{"html":"支援相對與絕對路徑","callout":false},{"html":"相對路徑以包含該 import 的檔案為基準解析","callout":false},{"html":"最多巢狀 5 層","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"這樣可以避免重複，讓每個 package 只引入相關的標準。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.3 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 目錄","slug":"5-3-claude-rules-目錄"},{"type":"p","html":"<code>.claude/rules/</code> 是單一巨大 CLAUDE.md 的替代方案，用來依主題組織規則：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":".claude/rules/\n  testing.md          -- 測試慣例\n  api-conventions.md  -- API 慣例\n  deployment.md       -- 部署規則\n  react-patterns.md   -- React 模式"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>關鍵功能：用 YAML frontmatter 的 <code>paths</code> 做條件式載入：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"yaml","text":"---\npaths: [\"src/api/**/*\"]\n---\n\nFor API files, use async/await with explicit error handling.\nEach endpoint must return a standard response wrapper."},{"type":"code","lang":"yaml","text":"---\npaths: [\"**/*.test.tsx\", \"**/*.test.ts\"]\n---\n\nTests must use describe/it blocks.\nUse data factories instead of hardcoding.\nDo not mock the database—use a test database."},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>運作方式：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"規則<strong>只在</strong> Claude Code 編輯符合 <code>paths</code> pattern 的檔案時才載入","callout":false},{"html":"節省 context 與 token，不相關的規則不會被載入","callout":false},{"html":"Glob pattern 讓你可以依檔案類型套用慣例，不受所在位置限制（很適合散落各處的測試檔）","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>何時用帶 <code>paths</code> 的 <code>.claude/rules/</code>，何時用 directory-level CLAUDE.md：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"帶 <code>paths</code> 的 <code>.claude/rules/</code>：慣例適用於分散在多個目錄的檔案（測試、migration）","callout":false},{"html":"Directory-level CLAUDE.md：慣例綁定特定目錄、其他地方不需要","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.4 自訂 Slash Commands 與 Skills","slug":"5-4-自訂-slash-commands-與-skills"},{"type":"quote","html":"<strong>注意：</strong> 目前版本的 Claude Code 已把自訂 commands（<code>.claude/commands/</code>）與 skills（<code>.claude/skills/</code>）統一。兩種格式都會建立 <code>/name</code> 命令。Exam guide 提到的是 <code>.claude/commands/</code>，該格式仍受支援。"},{"type":"p","html":"Slash commands 是用 <code>/name</code> 呼叫的可重用 prompt 模板：","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong><code>.claude/commands/</code> 格式（舊格式，仍支援）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":".claude/commands/\n  review.md        -- /review -- 標準 code review\n  test-gen.md      -- /test-gen -- 產生測試"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong><code>.claude/skills/</code> 格式（目前格式）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":".claude/skills/\n  review/SKILL.md  -- /review -- 帶 frontmatter 設定\n  test-gen/SKILL.md"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>專案 commands</strong>（<code>.claude/commands/</code> 或 <code>.claude/skills/</code>）：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"納入 VCS，clone repo 的人都能用","callout":false},{"html":"確保團隊工作流程一致","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>使用者 commands</strong>（<code>~/.claude/commands/</code> 或 <code>~/.claude/skills/</code>）：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"個人命令，不透過 VCS 分享","callout":false},{"html":"用於個人工作流程","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.5 Skills — <code>.claude/skills/</code>","slug":"5-5-skills-claude-skills"},{"type":"p","html":"Skills 是透過 SKILL.md frontmatter 設定的進階命令：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"yaml","text":"---\ncontext: fork\nallowed-tools: [\"Read\", \"Grep\", \"Glob\"]\nargument-hint: \"Path to the directory to analyze\"\n---\n\nAnalyze the code structure in the specified directory.\nOutput a report on dependencies and architectural patterns."},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Frontmatter 參數：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"table","headers":["參數","說明"],"rows":[["<code>context: fork</code>","在隔離的 subagent 中執行 skill。冗長的輸出不會污染主 session"],["<code>allowed-tools</code>","限制可用的 tools（安全考量，例如未允許時 skill 就不能刪檔）"],["<code>argument-hint</code>","不帶參數呼叫時提示需要輸入參數"]]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>何時用 skill、何時用 CLAUDE.md：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<strong>Skill</strong>：針對特定任務按需（on-demand）呼叫（review、分析、產生）","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>CLAUDE.md</strong>：一律載入的一般標準與慣例","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>個人 skills（<code>~/.claude/skills/</code>）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"用不同名稱建立個人版本，才不會影響隊友","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.6 Planning Mode 與直接執行","slug":"5-6-planning-mode-與直接執行"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Planning mode：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"模型只做調查與規劃，不做修改","callout":false},{"html":"用 Read、Grep、Glob 探索 codebase","callout":false},{"html":"產出一份實作計畫供使用者核准","callout":false},{"html":"沒有副作用的安全探索","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>何時用 planning mode：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"大規模變更（幾十個檔案）","callout":false},{"html":"有多種合理做法（microservices：服務邊界怎麼切？）","callout":false},{"html":"架構決策（用哪個框架？什麼結構？）","callout":false},{"html":"不熟悉的 codebase（必須先理解才能改）","callout":false},{"html":"影響 45+ 個檔案的 library migration","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>何時直接執行：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"有明確 stack trace 的單檔修正","callout":false},{"html":"加一個驗證檢查","callout":false},{"html":"已充分理解、沒有歧義的變更","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>組合做法：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"用 planning mode 調查與設計","callout":false},{"html":"使用者核准計畫","callout":false},{"html":"直接執行已核准的計畫","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Explore subagent</strong>：專門用來探索 codebase 的 subagent：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"把冗長的輸出隔離在主 context 之外","callout":false},{"html":"只回傳摘要","callout":false},{"html":"避免多階段任務把 context window 耗盡","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.7 <code>/compact</code> 命令","slug":"5-7-compact-命令"},{"type":"p","html":"<code>/compact</code> 是內建的 context 壓縮命令：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"把先前的歷史摘要化，釋放 context window","callout":false},{"html":"用於長時間調查、context 被冗長 tool 輸出填滿的 session","callout":false},{"html":"風險：摘要過程中精確的數值、日期與具體細節可能遺失","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.8 <code>/memory</code> 命令","slug":"5-8-memory-命令"},{"type":"p","html":"<code>/memory</code> 是內建的跨 session 記憶管理命令：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"開啟 <code>CLAUDE.md</code> 檔案供編輯，讓你保存筆記、偏好與 context","callout":false},{"html":"資訊跨 session 保留，啟動時自動載入","callout":false},{"html":"適合存放專案慣例、使用者偏好、常用命令與目前工作的 context","callout":false},{"html":"不必每個 session 都重新解釋同樣的指令","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.9 Claude Code CLI 用於 CI/CD","slug":"5-9-claude-code-cli-用於-ci-cd"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong><code>-p</code>（或 <code>--print</code>）旗標：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","text":"claude -p \"Analyze this pull request for security issues\""},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"非互動模式：處理 prompt、輸出到 stdout、結束","callout":false},{"html":"不會等待使用者輸入","callout":false},{"html":"在 CI/CD pipeline 中執行 Claude 的唯一正確方式","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>CI 用的結構化輸出：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","text":"claude -p \"Review this PR\" --output-format json --json-schema '{\"type\":\"object\",...}'"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<code>--output-format json</code>：以 JSON 輸出","callout":false},{"html":"<code>--json-schema</code>：依 schema 驗證輸出","callout":false},{"html":"結果可被解析，自動貼成 PR 的 inline comment","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Session context 隔離：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"同一個產生程式碼的 Claude session 往往不擅長 review 自己的產出（模型保有自己的推理 context，比較不會質疑自己的決定）。Review 要用獨立的 instance。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>避免重複留言：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"新 commit 之後重新 review 時，把先前的 review 結果放進 context，並指示 Claude 只回報新的或尚未解決的問題。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.10 <code>fork_session</code> 與 Session 管理","slug":"5-10-fork_session-與-session-管理"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong><code>--resume &lt;session-name&gt;</code></strong> 恢復一個具名 session：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","text":"claude --resume investigation-auth-bug"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"延續先前的對話與保存的 context","callout":false},{"html":"適合跨多個 session 的長期調查","callout":false},{"html":"風險：若檔案在上一個 session 之後有變動，tool 結果可能已過時（stale）","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong><code>fork_session</code></strong> 從共同的 context 建立獨立分支：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Codebase investigation\n         |\n    fork_session\n    /           \\\nApproach A:      Approach B:\nRedux            Context API"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"兩個分支都繼承分歧點之前的 context","callout":false},{"html":"之後各自獨立發展","callout":false},{"html":"適合比較不同做法或測試策略","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>何時開新 session 而非 resume：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"Tool 結果已過時（檔案變了）","callout":false},{"html":"時間過了很久、context 已退化","callout":false},{"html":"用「以下是我們先前發現的簡短摘要：…」重新開始，比帶著舊 tool 資料 resume 更好","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"5-1-claude-md-的層級","title":"5.1 CLAUDE.md 的層級"},{"slug":"5-2-path-語法-檔案匯入","title":"5.2 @path 語法（檔案匯入）"},{"slug":"5-3-claude-rules-目錄","title":"5.3 .claude/rules/ 目錄"},{"slug":"5-4-自訂-slash-commands-與-skills","title":"5.4 自訂 Slash Commands 與 Skills"},{"slug":"5-5-skills-claude-skills","title":"5.5 Skills — .claude/skills/"},{"slug":"5-6-planning-mode-與直接執行","title":"5.6 Planning Mode 與直接執行"},{"slug":"5-7-compact-命令","title":"5.7 /compact 命令"},{"slug":"5-8-memory-命令","title":"5.8 /memory 命令"},{"slug":"5-9-claude-code-cli-用於-ci-cd","title":"5.9 Claude Code CLI 用於 CI/CD"},{"slug":"5-10-fork_session-與-session-管理","title":"5.10 fork_session 與 Session 管理"}]},{"slug":"ch-6","title":"第 6 章：Prompt Engineering — 進階技巧","title_html":"第 6 章：Prompt Engineering — 進階技巧","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":11,"blocks":[{"type":"quote","html":"文件：<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Prompt Engineering</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-cookbook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthropic Cookbook</a>"},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"6.1 Few-shot Prompting","slug":"6-1-few-shot-prompting"},{"type":"p","html":"Few-shot prompting 是在 prompt 裡放 2–4 組輸入 / 輸出範例，示範預期的行為。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>為什麼 few-shot 比文字描述更有效：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"「be more precise（更精確一點）」這種模糊指令可以有很多種解讀","callout":false},{"html":"範例能毫無歧義地展示預期格式與決策邏輯","callout":false},{"html":"模型會把模式泛化到新案例（不只是重複範例）","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Few-shot 範例的類型與使用時機：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":3,"html":"1. 針對模糊情境的範例","slug":"1-針對模糊情境的範例"},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Request: \"My order is broken\"\nAction: Call get_customer -> lookup_order -> check status.\nRationale: \"broken\" may mean a damaged item; you need order details.\n\nRequest: \"Get me a manager\"\nAction: Immediately call escalate_to_human.\nRationale: The customer explicitly requests a human. Do not attempt to solve autonomously."},{"type":"h","level":3,"html":"2. 針對輸出格式的範例","slug":"2-針對輸出格式的範例"},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Finding example:\n{\n  \"location\": \"src/auth/login.ts:42\",\n  \"issue\": \"SQL injection in the username parameter\",\n  \"severity\": \"critical\",\n  \"suggested_fix\": \"Use a parameterized query\"\n}"},{"type":"h","level":3,"html":"3. 區分可接受與有問題程式碼的範例","slug":"3-區分可接受與有問題程式碼的範例"},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"// Acceptable (do not flag):\nconst items = data.filter(x => x.active);\n\n// Problem (flag):\nconst items = data.filter(x => x.active == true); // Use strict equality ==="},{"type":"h","level":3,"html":"4. 從不同文件格式抽取的範例","slug":"4-從不同文件格式抽取的範例"},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Document with inline citations:\n\"As shown in the study (Smith, 2023), the rate is 42%.\"\n-> {\"value\": \"42%\", \"source\": \"Smith, 2023\", \"type\": \"inline_citation\"}\n\nDocument with bibliography references:\n\"The rate is 42%. [1]\"\n-> {\"value\": \"42%\", \"source\": \"reference_1\", \"type\": \"bibliography\"}"},{"type":"h","level":3,"html":"5. 非正式度量單位的範例","slug":"5-非正式度量單位的範例"},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Text: \"about two handfuls of rice\"\n-> {\"amount\": \"~100g\", \"original_text\": \"two handfuls\", \"precision\": \"approximate\"}\n\nText: \"a pinch of salt\"\n-> {\"amount\": \"~1g\", \"original_text\": \"a pinch\", \"precision\": \"approximate\"}"},{"type":"p","html":"Few-shot 對抽取非正式、非標準的度量單位特別有效，因為這些單位種類太多，純規則式指令涵蓋不了。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Prompt 裡的格式正規化（normalization）規則：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"用嚴格 JSON schema 做結構化輸出時，在 prompt 中加上正規化規則：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Normalization:\n- Dates: always ISO 8601 (YYYY-MM-DD); \"yesterday\" -> compute an absolute date\n- Currency: numeric amount + currency code; \"five bucks\" -> {\"amount\": 5, \"currency\": \"USD\"}\n- Percentages: decimal fraction; \"half\" -> 0.5"},{"type":"p","html":"這可以避免 JSON 語法正確、但值不一致的語意錯誤。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"6.2 明確標準 vs 模糊指令","slug":"6-2-明確標準-vs-模糊指令"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>不好（模糊）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Check code comments for accuracy.\nBe conservative—report only high-confidence findings."},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>好（明確標準）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Flag a comment as problematic ONLY if:\n1. The comment describes behavior that CONTRADICTS the actual code behavior\n2. The comment references a non-existent function or variable\n3. A TODO/FIXME comment refers to a bug that has already been fixed in code\n\nDo NOT flag:\n- Comments that are merely stylistically outdated\n- Comments with minor wording inaccuracies\n- Missing comments (that is a separate category)"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>用範例定義嚴重度（severity）標準：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"CRITICAL: Runtime failure for users\n  Example: NullPointerException while processing a payment\n\nHIGH: Security vulnerability\n  Example: SQL injection, XSS, missing authorization checks\n\nMEDIUM: Logic bug without immediate impact\n  Example: Wrong sorting, off-by-one error\n\nLOW: Code quality\n  Example: Duplication, suboptimal algorithm for small data"},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"6.3 Prompt Chaining","slug":"6-3-prompt-chaining"},{"type":"p","html":"Prompt chaining 把複雜任務拆成一連串聚焦的步驟：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Step 1: 分析 auth.ts（只看局部問題）\n       -> 輸出：auth.ts 的問題清單\n\nStep 2: 分析 database.ts（只看局部問題）\n       -> 輸出：database.ts 的問題清單\n\nStep 3: 整合檢查（跨檔案的依賴）\n       -> 輸出：模組邊界上的問題"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>為什麼重要：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"避免<strong>注意力稀釋（attention dilution）</strong>：模型一次收到太多檔案時，可能漏掉某些檔案的 bug，同時對其他檔案給出浮淺的評論","callout":false},{"html":"確保每個檔案都有一致的分析品質","callout":false},{"html":"讓跨檔案的互動可以被單獨分析","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>何時用 prompt chaining、何時用動態分解（dynamic decomposition）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<strong>Prompt chaining</strong>：可預測、可重複的任務（code review、檔案 migration）","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>動態分解</strong>：開放式調查，子任務要在執行過程中才會浮現","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"6.4 「訪談（Interview）」模式","slug":"6-4-訪談-interview-模式"},{"type":"p","html":"在實作方案之前，Claude 先問澄清問題：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Claude: \"Before implementing caching for the API, a few questions:\n1. Which cache invalidation strategy do you prefer—TTL or event-based?\n2. Is stale data acceptable when the cache is unavailable?\n3. Should caching be per-user or global?\n4. What is the expected data volume to cache?\""},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>適用時機：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"不熟悉的領域（fintech、醫療、法律系統）","callout":false},{"html":"有非顯而易見影響的任務（快取策略、失敗模式）","callout":false},{"html":"有多種可行做法，最佳選擇取決於 context","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"6.5 驗證與帶回饋的 Retry（Retry-with-Feedback）","slug":"6-5-驗證與帶回饋的-retry-retry-with-feedback"},{"type":"p","html":"當抽取出的資料沒通過驗證：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Step 1: 從文件抽取資料\nStep 2: 驗證（Pydantic、JSON Schema、商業規則）\nStep 3: 若有錯，帶著 context 重試：\n  - 原始文件\n  - 前一次（錯誤的）抽取結果\n  - 具體錯誤：\"Field 'total' = 150, but sum(line_items) = 145. Re-check values.\""},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Retry 會有效的情況：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"格式錯誤（日期格式錯）","callout":false},{"html":"結構錯誤（欄位放錯位置）","callout":false},{"html":"算術不一致（模型可以重新檢查）","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Retry 沒用的情況：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"資訊根本不在來源文件裡","callout":false},{"html":"需要的 context 在外部（資料在另一份沒提供的文件中）","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Pydantic 作為驗證工具：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"Pydantic 是 Python 的 schema 資料驗證 library。考試重點：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<strong>結構驗證：</strong> 拿到 Claude 的 JSON 後在程式中檢查型別、必填、enum 限制","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>語意驗證：</strong> 自訂 validator 強制商業邏輯（明細加總等於總額；start_date &lt; end_date）","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>驗證–重試迴圈：</strong> Pydantic 驗證失敗時，組出錯誤訊息並帶著錯誤 context 重新 prompt Claude","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>產生 JSON Schema：</strong> Pydantic model 可以產生給 <code>tool_use</code> 用的 JSON Schema，成為單一真實來源（single source of truth）","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"6.6 Self-correction（自我修正）","slug":"6-6-self-correction-自我修正"},{"type":"p","html":"偵測內部矛盾的模式：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"stated_total\": \"$150.00\",\n  \"calculated_total\": \"$145.00\",\n  \"conflict_detected\": true,\n  \"line_items\": [\n    {\"name\": \"Widget A\", \"price\": 75.00},\n    {\"name\": \"Widget B\", \"price\": 70.00}\n  ]\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"模型同時抽出「文件寫的值」與「計算出來的值」，兩者不同時 <code>conflict_detected</code> 讓你可以處理這個差異。","callout":false}],"headings":[{"slug":"6-1-few-shot-prompting","title":"6.1 Few-shot Prompting"},{"slug":"6-2-明確標準-vs-模糊指令","title":"6.2 明確標準 vs 模糊指令"},{"slug":"6-3-prompt-chaining","title":"6.3 Prompt Chaining"},{"slug":"6-4-訪談-interview-模式","title":"6.4 「訪談（Interview）」模式"},{"slug":"6-5-驗證與帶回饋的-retry-retry-with-feedback","title":"6.5 驗證與帶回饋的 Retry（Retry-with-Feedback）"},{"slug":"6-6-self-correction-自我修正","title":"6.6 Self-correction（自我修正）"}]},{"slug":"ch-7","title":"第 7 章：Message Batches API","title_html":"第 7 章：Message Batches API","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":2,"blocks":[{"type":"quote","html":"文件：<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/message-batches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Message Batches</a>"},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"7.1 概觀","slug":"7-1-概觀"},{"type":"p","html":"Message Batches API 讓你一次送出一批請求做非同步處理：","callout":false},{"type":"table","headers":["屬性","值"],"rows":[["省下的費用","比同步呼叫便宜 <strong>50%</strong>"],["處理時間窗","最長 <strong>24 小時</strong>（沒有延遲 SLA 保證）"],["多回合 tool calling","<strong>不支援</strong>（一個請求 = 一個回應）"],["對應方式","用 <code>custom_id</code> 欄位對應請求與回應"]]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"7.2 何時用 Batch API、何時用同步 API","slug":"7-2-何時用-batch-api-何時用同步-api"},{"type":"table","headers":["任務","API","原因"],"rows":[["Pre-merge 的 PR 檢查","<strong>同步</strong>","開發者在等；24 小時不可接受"],["隔夜的技術債報告","<strong>Batch</strong>","早上要結果就好；省 50%"],["每週安全稽核","<strong>Batch</strong>","不急；省 50%"],["互動式 code review","<strong>同步</strong>","需要即時回應"],["處理 10,000 份文件","<strong>Batch</strong>","大量處理；省很多"]]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"7.3 使用 <code>custom_id</code>","slug":"7-3-使用-custom_id"},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"custom_id\": \"doc-invoice-2024-001\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n    \"max_tokens\": 1024,\n    \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Extract data from: ...\"}]\n  }\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"<code>custom_id</code> 讓你可以：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"把結果對應回原始文件","callout":false},{"html":"失敗時只重送失敗的文件","callout":false},{"html":"避免重複處理已成功的文件","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"7.4 處理 Batch 中的失敗","slug":"7-4-處理-batch-中的失敗"},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"送出一批 100 份文件","callout":false},{"html":"95 份成功；5 份失敗（超過 context 上限）","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>custom_id</code> 找出失敗的","callout":false},{"html":"調整策略（例如把長文件切成 chunk）","callout":false},{"html":"只重送那 5 份失敗的文件","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"7.5 SLA 規劃","slug":"7-5-sla-規劃"},{"type":"p","html":"若你需要在 30 小時內拿到結果，而 Batch API 最長要 24 小時：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"送出時間窗：30 - 24 = <strong>6 小時</strong>","callout":false},{"html":"批次最遲要在期限前 24 小時送出","callout":false},{"html":"若頻繁送出，切成 4 小時一個窗口","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"7-1-概觀","title":"7.1 概觀"},{"slug":"7-2-何時用-batch-api-何時用同步-api","title":"7.2 何時用 Batch API、何時用同步 API"},{"slug":"7-3-使用-custom_id","title":"7.3 使用 custom_id"},{"slug":"7-4-處理-batch-中的失敗","title":"7.4 處理 Batch 中的失敗"},{"slug":"7-5-sla-規劃","title":"7.5 SLA 規劃"}]},{"slug":"ch-8","title":"第 8 章：任務分解策略","title_html":"第 8 章：任務分解策略","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":2,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"8.1 固定 Pipeline（Prompt Chaining）","slug":"8-1-固定-pipeline-prompt-chaining"},{"type":"p","html":"每個步驟事先定義好：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Document -> Metadata extraction -> Data extraction -> Validation -> Enrichment -> Final output"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>適用時機：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"任務結構可預測（review 永遠照同一個模板）","callout":false},{"html":"所有步驟事先已知","callout":false},{"html":"需要穩定性與可重現性","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"8.2 動態自適應分解（Dynamic Adaptive Decomposition）","slug":"8-2-動態自適應分解-dynamic-adaptive-decomposition"},{"type":"p","html":"子任務依中間結果產生：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"1. 「為 legacy codebase 加測試」\n2. -> 先：描繪結構（Glob、Grep）\n3. -> 發現：3 個模組沒有測試、2 個部分覆蓋\n4. -> 排優先：先做 payments 模組（高風險）\n5. -> 過程中：發現依賴一個外部 API\n6. -> 調整：寫測試前先為外部 API 加 mock"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>適用時機：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"開放式的調查任務","callout":false},{"html":"事先不知道完整範圍","callout":false},{"html":"每一步都依賴前一步的結果","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"8.3 多輪（Multi-pass）Code Review","slug":"8-3-多輪-multi-pass-code-review"},{"type":"p","html":"針對 10+ 個檔案的 pull request：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Pass 1（逐檔）：分析 auth.ts -> 列出局部問題\nPass 1（逐檔）：分析 database.ts -> 列出局部問題\nPass 1（逐檔）：分析 routes.ts -> 列出局部問題\n...\nPass 2（整合）：分析檔案之間的關係\n  -> 跨檔案問題：型別不一致、循環依賴"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>為什麼一次看完 14 個檔案不好：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"注意力稀釋：某些檔案分析得深、某些淺","callout":false},{"html":"評論不一致：同一個模式在一個檔案被標記、在另一個被放行","callout":false},{"html":"漏掉 bug：認知過載導致明顯錯誤被跳過","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"8-1-固定-pipeline-prompt-chaining","title":"8.1 固定 Pipeline（Prompt Chaining）"},{"slug":"8-2-動態自適應分解-dynamic-adaptive-decomposition","title":"8.2 動態自適應分解（Dynamic Adaptive Decomposition）"},{"slug":"8-3-多輪-multi-pass-code-review","title":"8.3 多輪（Multi-pass）Code Review"}]},{"slug":"ch-9","title":"第 9 章：Escalation 與 Human-in-the-Loop","title_html":"第 9 章：Escalation 與 Human-in-the-Loop","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":4,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"9.1 何時該 Escalate 給人類","slug":"9-1-何時該-escalate-給人類"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Escalation 觸發條件（明確規則）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"table","headers":["情況","動作"],"rows":[["客戶明確要求「找主管來」","立即 escalate；不要嘗試自己解決"],["政策沒涵蓋這個請求","Escalate（例如政策沒提到的競品價格比對）"],["Agent 無法取得進展","合理次數的嘗試後 escalate"],["金額超過門檻的財務操作","Escalate（最好用 hook 強制，不要靠 prompt）"],["查客戶時出現多筆符合","要求額外識別資訊；不要猜"]]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>不可靠的觸發條件：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"table","headers":["不可靠的方法","為什麼會失敗"],"rows":[["情緒分析（sentiment analysis）","客戶情緒與案件複雜度無關"],["模型自評信心（1–10 分）","模型可能「很有信心地錯」；校準（calibration）差"],["自動分類器","過度工程；可能需要你沒有的訓練資料"]]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"9.2 Escalation 模式","slug":"9-2-escalation-模式"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>立即 escalate：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Customer: \"I want to speak to a manager\"\nAgent: [立即呼叫 escalate_to_human]\n不要： \"I can help with your issue, let me...\""},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>先嘗試解決再 escalate：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Customer: \"My refrigerator broke two days after purchase\"\nAgent: [查訂單，提供保固換貨]\n若客戶不滿意 -> escalate"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>細膩的 escalate（先同理 → 解決 → 客戶再次要求時 escalate）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Customer: \"This is outrageous, I'm very unhappy with the quality!\"\nAgent: [同理情緒] \"I understand your frustration.\"\n       [提出解法] \"I can offer a replacement or a refund.\"\nCustomer: \"No, I want to talk to someone!\"\nAgent: [客戶再次堅持 -> 立即 escalate]"},{"type":"p","html":"關鍵原則：先承接情緒，再提出具體解法，只有客戶再次表達想找真人時才 escalate。不要在客戶第一次表達不滿時就 escalate（不滿並不等於要求找主管）。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>因政策空缺而 escalate：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Customer: \"Competitor X has this item 30% cheaper—give me a discount\"\nPolicy: 只涵蓋自家網站的價格調整\nAgent: [escalate — 政策沒涵蓋競品價格比對]"},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"9.3 結構化的交接（Handoff）協定","slug":"9-3-結構化的交接-handoff-協定"},{"type":"p","html":"Escalate 時，agent 應把結構化摘要交給人類：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"customer_id\": \"CUST-12345\",\n  \"customer_name\": \"Ivan Petrov\",\n  \"issue_summary\": \"Refund request for a damaged item\",\n  \"order_id\": \"ORD-67890\",\n  \"root_cause\": \"Item arrived damaged; photos attached\",\n  \"actions_taken\": [\n    \"Verified customer via get_customer\",\n    \"Confirmed order via lookup_order\",\n    \"Offered a standard replacement — customer insists on a refund\"\n  ],\n  \"refund_amount\": \"$89.99\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"Approve a full refund\",\n  \"escalation_reason\": \"Customer requested to speak with a manager\"\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"人工客服看不到完整的對話紀錄，只看得到這份摘要。因此它必須完整、可獨立理解。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"9.4 信心校準（Confidence Calibration）與人工監督","slug":"9-4-信心校準-confidence-calibration-與人工監督"},{"type":"p","html":"針對資料抽取系統：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"<strong>欄位層級的信心分數：</strong> 模型對每個抽出的欄位輸出信心分數","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>校準：</strong> 用有標註的驗證集調整門檻","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>路由：</strong>","callout":false,"children":[{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"高信心 + 穩定準確率 -&gt; 自動處理","callout":false},{"html":"低信心或來源模糊 -&gt; 人工審查","callout":false}]}]}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>分層隨機抽樣（stratified random sampling）：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"即使是高信心的抽取結果，也要定期稽核樣本","callout":false},{"html":"整體 97% 的準確率可能掩蓋了某類文件 40% 的錯誤率","callout":false},{"html":"要依文件類型、依欄位分析準確率，不能只看整體","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"9-1-何時該-escalate-給人類","title":"9.1 何時該 Escalate 給人類"},{"slug":"9-2-escalation-模式","title":"9.2 Escalation 模式"},{"slug":"9-3-結構化的交接-handoff-協定","title":"9.3 結構化的交接（Handoff）協定"},{"slug":"9-4-信心校準-confidence-calibration-與人工監督","title":"9.4 信心校準（Confidence Calibration）與人工監督"}]},{"slug":"ch-10","title":"第 10 章：多 Agent 系統的錯誤處理","title_html":"第 10 章：多 Agent 系統的錯誤處理","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":3,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"10.1 錯誤分類","slug":"10-1-錯誤分類"},{"type":"table","headers":["類別","例子","可 retry","Agent 動作"],"rows":[["<strong>Transient（暫時性）</strong>","Timeout、503、網路故障","是","用 exponential backoff retry"],["<strong>Validation（驗證）</strong>","輸入格式錯、缺必填欄位","否（要修輸入）","修改請求後重試"],["<strong>Business（商業）</strong>","違反政策、超過門檻","否","向使用者說明；提出替代方案"],["<strong>Permission（權限）</strong>","存取被拒","否","Escalate"]]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"10.2 錯誤處理的反模式","slug":"10-2-錯誤處理的反模式"},{"type":"table","headers":["反模式","問題","正確做法"],"rows":[["籠統狀態「search unavailable」","Coordinator 無法決定如何復原","回傳錯誤類型、查詢內容、部分結果、替代方案"],["靜默吞掉（空結果 = 成功）","Coordinator 以為沒有符合的結果，其實是失敗","區分「沒有結果」與「搜尋失敗」"],["一個失敗就中止整個 workflow","所有部分結果都丟了","帶著部分結果繼續；標註缺口"],["Subagent 內無限 retry","延遲與資源浪費","本地復原（1–2 次 retry），然後往上傳給 coordinator"]]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"10.3 結構化的 Subagent 錯誤","slug":"10-3-結構化的-subagent-錯誤"},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"partial_failure\",\n  \"failure_type\": \"timeout\",\n  \"attempted_query\": \"AI impact on music industry 2024\",\n  \"partial_results\": [\n    {\"title\": \"AI Music Generation Report\", \"url\": \"...\", \"relevance\": 0.8}\n  ],\n  \"alternative_approaches\": [\n    \"Try a narrower query: 'AI music composition tools'\",\n    \"Use an alternative data source\"\n  ],\n  \"coverage_impact\": \"Not covered: AI impact on music production\"\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"這給了 coordinator 決策所需的資訊：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"用修改後的查詢 retry？","callout":false},{"html":"使用部分結果？","callout":false},{"html":"委派給另一個 subagent？","callout":false},{"html":"略過這一節並標註缺口？","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"10.4 最終 Synthesis 中的覆蓋範圍標註","slug":"10-4-最終-synthesis-中的覆蓋範圍標註"},{"type":"code","lang":"markdown","text":"## Report: AI Impact on Creative Industries\n\n### Visual Art (FULL COVERAGE)\n[research results]\n\n### Music (PARTIAL COVERAGE — search agent timeout)\n[partial results]\n⚠️ Note: coverage for this section is limited due to a timeout in the search agent.\n\n### Literature (FULL COVERAGE)\n[research results]"}],"headings":[{"slug":"10-1-錯誤分類","title":"10.1 錯誤分類"},{"slug":"10-2-錯誤處理的反模式","title":"10.2 錯誤處理的反模式"},{"slug":"10-3-結構化的-subagent-錯誤","title":"10.3 結構化的 Subagent 錯誤"},{"slug":"10-4-最終-synthesis-中的覆蓋範圍標註","title":"10.4 最終 Synthesis 中的覆蓋範圍標註"}]},{"slug":"ch-11","title":"第 11 章：Production 系統的 Context 管理","title_html":"第 11 章：Production 系統的 Context 管理","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":6,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"11.1 把事實抽到獨立區塊","slug":"11-1-把事實抽到獨立區塊"},{"type":"p","html":"不要依賴對話歷史（摘要時會退化），把關鍵事實抽到一個結構化區塊：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"=== CASE FACTS（每出現新事實就更新）===\nCustomer ID: CUST-12345\nOrder ID: ORD-67890\nOrder Date: 2025-01-15\nOrder Amount: $89.99\nIssue: Damaged item on delivery\nCustomer Request: Full refund\nStatus: Pending manager approval\n==="},{"type":"p","html":"不論歷史如何被摘要，每個 prompt 都帶上這個區塊。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"11.2 裁剪 Tool 結果","slug":"11-2-裁剪-tool-結果"},{"type":"p","html":"若 <code>lookup_order</code> 回傳 40+ 個欄位，但目前任務只需要 5 個：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"python","text":"# PostToolUse hook: keep only relevant fields\n@hook(\"PostToolUse\", tool=\"lookup_order\")\ndef trim_order_fields(result):\n    return {\n        \"order_id\": result[\"order_id\"],\n        \"status\": result[\"status\"],\n        \"total\": result[\"total\"],\n        \"items\": result[\"items\"],\n        \"return_eligible\": result[\"return_eligible\"]\n    }"},{"type":"p","html":"這能節省 context、減少雜訊。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"11.3 考慮位置的輸入（Position-aware Input）","slug":"11-3-考慮位置的輸入-position-aware-input"},{"type":"p","html":"把關鍵資訊的擺放納入 lost-in-the-middle 效應的考量：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"[KEY FINDINGS — 放最上面]\nFound 3 critical vulnerabilities...\n\n[DETAILED RESULTS — 中間]\n=== File auth.ts ===\n...\n=== File database.ts ===\n...\n\n[ACTION ITEMS — 放最後]\nPriority: fix auth.ts vulnerabilities before merge."},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"11.4 Scratchpad 檔案","slug":"11-4-scratchpad-檔案"},{"type":"p","html":"長時間調查時，agent 可以把關鍵發現寫進 scratchpad 檔案：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"# investigation-scratchpad.md\n## Key findings\n- PaymentProcessor in src/payments/processor.ts inherits from BaseProcessor\n- refund() is called from 3 places: OrderController, AdminPanel, CronJob\n- External PaymentGateway API has a rate limit of 100 req/min\n- Migration #47 added refund_reason (NOT NULL) — 2024-12-01"},{"type":"p","html":"當 context 退化時（或在新 session 裡），agent 可以查 scratchpad，不必重新探索。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"11.5 委派給 Subagents 以保護 Context","slug":"11-5-委派給-subagents-以保護-context"},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"Main agent: \"Investigate dependencies of the payments module\"\n  -> Subagent (Explore): 讀 15 個檔案、追蹤 imports\n  -> 回傳: \"Payments depends on AuthService, OrderModel, and the external PaymentGateway API\"\n\nMain agent: context 裡只留一行，而不是 15 個檔案"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>獨立的 context 層：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"在多 agent 系統中，每個 subagent 都在有限的 context 預算內運作，只收到它任務所需的資訊。Coordinator 扮演獨立的 context 層：彙整 subagent 的輸出、保存全域狀態、分配 context。這避免了「context 洩漏（context leakage）」，也就是某個 agent 用其他 agent 不需要的資訊把 window 吃掉。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>Subagent 的受限 context 預算：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"只送最少的 context：具體任務 + 必要資料","callout":false},{"html":"指示 subagent 回傳結構化結果，而不是原始資料傾倒","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>allowedTools</code> 限制 subagent 的 tool 集合：tool 越少，干擾越少、context 成本越低","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"11.6 結構化的狀態持久化（用於 crash 復原）","slug":"11-6-結構化的狀態持久化-用於-crash-復原"},{"type":"p","html":"每個 agent 把狀態輸出到已知位置：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"// agent-state/web-search-agent.json\n{\n  \"status\": \"completed\",\n  \"queries_executed\": [\"AI music 2024\", \"AI music composition\"],\n  \"results_count\": 12,\n  \"key_findings\": [...],\n  \"coverage\": [\"music composition\", \"music production\"],\n  \"gaps\": [\"music distribution\", \"music licensing\"]\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"Coordinator 在 resume 時載入一份 manifest：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"// agent-state/manifest.json\n{\n  \"web-search\": \"completed\",\n  \"doc-analysis\": \"in_progress\",\n  \"synthesis\": \"not_started\"\n}"}],"headings":[{"slug":"11-1-把事實抽到獨立區塊","title":"11.1 把事實抽到獨立區塊"},{"slug":"11-2-裁剪-tool-結果","title":"11.2 裁剪 Tool 結果"},{"slug":"11-3-考慮位置的輸入-position-aware-input","title":"11.3 考慮位置的輸入（Position-aware Input）"},{"slug":"11-4-scratchpad-檔案","title":"11.4 Scratchpad 檔案"},{"slug":"11-5-委派給-subagents-以保護-context","title":"11.5 委派給 Subagents 以保護 Context"},{"slug":"11-6-結構化的狀態持久化-用於-crash-復原","title":"11.6 結構化的狀態持久化（用於 crash 復原）"}]},{"slug":"ch-12","title":"第 12 章：保存來源（Provenance）","title_html":"第 12 章：保存來源（Provenance）","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":2,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"12.1 歸屬（Attribution）流失的問題","slug":"12-1-歸屬-attribution-流失的問題"},{"type":"p","html":"摘要多個來源的結果時，「主張 → 來源」的連結可能會斷掉：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"不好：\"The AI music market is estimated at $3.2B.\"（沒有來源、沒有年份）\n\n好：\n{\n  \"claim\": \"The AI music market is estimated at $3.2B.\",\n  \"source_url\": \"https://example.com/report\",\n  \"source_name\": \"Global AI Music Report 2024\",\n  \"publication_date\": \"2024-06-15\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.9\n}"},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"12.2 處理互相矛盾的資料","slug":"12-2-處理互相矛盾的資料"},{"type":"p","html":"當兩個來源給出不同的值：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"json","text":"{\n  \"claim\": \"Share of AI-generated music on streaming platforms\",\n  \"values\": [\n    {\n      \"value\": \"12%\",\n      \"source\": \"Spotify Annual Report 2024\",\n      \"date\": \"2024-03\",\n      \"methodology\": \"Automated classification\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"value\": \"8%\",\n      \"source\": \"Music Industry Association Survey\",\n      \"date\": \"2024-07\",\n      \"methodology\": \"Survey of 500 labels\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"conflict_detected\": true,\n  \"possible_explanation\": \"Difference in methodology and time period\"\n}"},{"type":"p","html":"不要任意挑一個值。兩個都保留並附上歸屬，讓 coordinator 決定。","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"12.3 附上日期以正確解讀","slug":"12-3-附上日期以正確解讀"},{"type":"p","html":"沒有日期，時間差異可能被誤判為矛盾：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"不好：\"Source A says 10%, source B says 15%. Contradiction.\"\n好：\"Source A (2023) says 10%, source B (2024) says 15%. Likely +5% growth over a year.\""},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"12.4 依內容類型呈現","slug":"12-4-依內容類型呈現"},{"type":"p","html":"不要把所有東西硬塞進同一種格式：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"財務資料 -&gt; 表格","callout":false},{"html":"新聞與分析 -&gt; 散文","callout":false},{"html":"技術發現 -&gt; 結構化清單","callout":false},{"html":"時間序列 -&gt; 依時間排序","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"12-1-歸屬-attribution-流失的問題","title":"12.1 歸屬（Attribution）流失的問題"},{"slug":"12-2-處理互相矛盾的資料","title":"12.2 處理互相矛盾的資料"},{"slug":"12-3-附上日期以正確解讀","title":"12.3 附上日期以正確解讀"},{"slug":"12-4-依內容類型呈現","title":"12.4 依內容類型呈現"}]},{"slug":"ch-13","title":"第 13 章：Claude Code 內建 Tools","title_html":"第 13 章：Claude Code 內建 Tools","part":1,"kind":"text","read_minutes":1,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"13.1 Tool 選擇速查","slug":"13-1-tool-選擇速查"},{"type":"table","headers":["任務","Tool","例子"],"rows":[["依名稱 / pattern 找檔案","<strong>Glob</strong>","<code>**/*.test.tsx</code>、<code>src/components/**/*.ts</code>"],["在檔案內容中搜尋","<strong>Grep</strong>","函式名稱、錯誤訊息、import"],["讀取整個檔案","<strong>Read</strong>","載入檔案做分析"],["寫新檔案","<strong>Write</strong>","從零建立檔案"],["精確編輯既有檔案","<strong>Edit</strong>","透過唯一的文字比對替換特定片段"],["執行 shell 命令","<strong>Bash</strong>","git、npm、跑測試、build"]]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"13.2 漸進式調查策略","slug":"13-2-漸進式調查策略"},{"type":"p","html":"不要一次讀完所有檔案。逐步建立理解：","callout":false},{"type":"code","lang":"","text":"1. Grep：找進入點（函式定義、export）\n2. Read：讀找到的檔案\n3. Grep：找使用處（import、呼叫）\n4. Read：讀使用方的檔案\n5. 重複直到掌握全貌"},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"13.3 備援：用 Read + Write 取代 Edit","slug":"13-3-備援-用-read-write-取代-edit"},{"type":"p","html":"當 Edit 因為文字比對不唯一而失敗：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"Read：載入完整檔案內容","callout":false},{"html":"用程式修改內容","callout":false},{"html":"Write：寫回更新後的版本","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"13-1-tool-選擇速查","title":"13.1 Tool 選擇速查"},{"slug":"13-2-漸進式調查策略","title":"13.2 漸進式調查策略"},{"slug":"13-3-備援-用-read-write-取代-edit","title":"13.3 備援：用 Read + Write 取代 Edit"}]},{"slug":"domain-1","title":"Domain 1：Agent 架構與編排（27%）","title_html":"Domain 1：Agent 架構與編排（27%）","part":2,"kind":"text","read_minutes":5,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.1 設計自主執行任務的 Agentic Loop","slug":"1-1-設計自主執行任務的-agentic-loop"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"Agent loop 的生命週期：送出 Claude 請求、檢查 <code>stop_reason</code>（<code>\"tool_use\"</code> vs <code>\"end_turn\"</code>）、執行 tools、把結果回傳給下一次迭代","callout":false},{"html":"Tool 結果要附加到對話歷史，模型才能決定下一步","callout":false},{"html":"Model-driven 決策（Claude 選下一個 tool）vs 寫死的決策樹","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"流程控制：<code>stop_reason = \"tool_use\"</code> 時繼續迴圈，<code>\"end_turn\"</code> 時停止","callout":false},{"html":"在迭代之間把 tool 結果附加進 context","callout":false},{"html":"要避免的反模式：解析 assistant 文字判斷完成、用任意的迭代上限作為主要停止機制","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.2 編排多 Agent 系統（Coordinator–Subagent）","slug":"1-2-編排多-agent-系統-coordinator-subagent"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"Hub-and-spoke 架構：coordinator 掌握所有 agent 之間的溝通、錯誤處理與路由","callout":false},{"html":"Subagents 在隔離的 context 中運作，不會自動繼承 coordinator 的歷史","callout":false},{"html":"Coordinator 的職責：任務分解、委派、結果彙整、動態選擇 subagents","callout":false},{"html":"Coordinator 分解得太窄的風險","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"把研究範圍切分給不同 subagents 以減少重複","callout":false},{"html":"實作迭代精煉迴圈（coordinator 評估 synthesis 後重新指派任務）","callout":false},{"html":"讓所有溝通經過 coordinator 以確保可觀測性","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.3 設定 Subagent 呼叫、Context 傳遞與產生","slug":"1-3-設定-subagent-呼叫-context-傳遞與產生"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<code>Task</code> tool 產生 subagents；coordinator 的 <code>allowedTools</code> 必須包含 <code>\"Task\"</code>","callout":false},{"html":"Subagent 的 context 必須明確寫進 prompt；subagents 不繼承父層 context","callout":false},{"html":"<code>AgentDefinition</code> 設定：description、system prompt、tool 限制","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>fork_session</code> 做 session 管理以探索不同方案","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"把先前 agent 的完整輸出放進 subagent 的 prompt","callout":false},{"html":"傳遞 context 時用結構化格式把資料與 metadata 分開","callout":false},{"html":"在一次 coordinator 回合中用多個 <code>Task</code> 呼叫平行產生 subagents","callout":false},{"html":"Coordinator 的 prompt 以目標與品質標準來寫，而非逐步指令","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.4 實作帶強制執行與交接模式的多步驟 Workflow","slug":"1-4-實作帶強制執行與交接模式的多步驟-workflow"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<strong>程式化強制（programmatic enforcement）</strong>（hooks、前置條件）與 <strong>prompt 引導</strong>在 workflow 排序上的差別","callout":false},{"html":"需要確定性保證時（例如財務操作前必須驗證身分），只靠 prompt 不夠","callout":false},{"html":"Escalation 時的結構化交接協定（customer ID、原因、建議動作）","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"程式化的前置條件，在前一步完成前封鎖後續呼叫（例如 <code>get_customer</code> 回傳已驗證 ID 前封鎖 <code>process_refund</code>）","callout":false},{"html":"把多面向的客戶請求分解成獨立項目","callout":false},{"html":"Escalate 給人類時產出結構化摘要","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.5 用 Agent SDK Hooks 攔截 Tool 呼叫與正規化資料","slug":"1-5-用-agent-sdk-hooks-攔截-tool-呼叫與正規化資料"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"Hook 模式（例如 <code>PostToolUse</code>）在模型消費 tool 結果前攔截","callout":false},{"html":"攔截外送呼叫的 hooks 用來強制法遵規則（例如阻擋超過門檻的退款）","callout":false},{"html":"Hooks 提供<strong>確定性保證</strong>，prompt 指令只提供<strong>機率性遵循</strong>","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"用 <code>PostToolUse</code> hooks 正規化資料格式（Unix timestamp、ISO 8601、數字狀態碼）","callout":false},{"html":"用攔截 hooks 阻擋違反政策的動作並轉向 escalation","callout":false},{"html":"商業規則要求保證遵循時，選 hooks 而不是 prompt","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.6 複雜 Workflow 的任務分解策略","slug":"1-6-複雜-workflow-的任務分解策略"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<strong>固定 pipeline</strong>（prompt chaining）vs 依中間結果的<strong>動態自適應分解</strong>","callout":false},{"html":"Prompt chaining：順序步驟（先逐檔分析，再做整合檢查）","callout":false},{"html":"依發現內容產生子任務的自適應調查計畫","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"可預測的多面向 review 用 prompt chaining；開放式調查用動態分解","callout":false},{"html":"把大型 code review 切成逐檔分析加獨立的跨檔整合檢查","callout":false},{"html":"分解開放式任務：先描繪結構，再建立有優先順序的計畫","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"1.7 Session 狀態、Resume 與 Fork","slug":"1-7-session-狀態-resume-與-fork"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<code>--resume &lt;session-name&gt;</code> 延續具名 session","callout":false},{"html":"<code>fork_session</code> 從共同 context 建立獨立的調查分支","callout":false},{"html":"Resume session 時告知 agent 檔案已變動的重要性","callout":false},{"html":"帶結構化摘要的新 session 可能比帶著過時結果 resume 更可靠","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"用 <code>--resume</code> 延續具名的調查 session","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>fork_session</code> 平行比較不同做法","callout":false},{"html":"在 resume（context 仍有效）與開新 session（結果已過時）之間做選擇","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"1-1-設計自主執行任務的-agentic-loop","title":"1.1 設計自主執行任務的 Agentic Loop"},{"slug":"1-2-編排多-agent-系統-coordinator-subagent","title":"1.2 編排多 Agent 系統（Coordinator–Subagent）"},{"slug":"1-3-設定-subagent-呼叫-context-傳遞與產生","title":"1.3 設定 Subagent 呼叫、Context 傳遞與產生"},{"slug":"1-4-實作帶強制執行與交接模式的多步驟-workflow","title":"1.4 實作帶強制執行與交接模式的多步驟 Workflow"},{"slug":"1-5-用-agent-sdk-hooks-攔截-tool-呼叫與正規化資料","title":"1.5 用 Agent SDK Hooks 攔截 Tool 呼叫與正規化資料"},{"slug":"1-6-複雜-workflow-的任務分解策略","title":"1.6 複雜 Workflow 的任務分解策略"},{"slug":"1-7-session-狀態-resume-與-fork","title":"1.7 Session 狀態、Resume 與 Fork"}]},{"slug":"domain-2","title":"Domain 2：Tool 設計與 MCP 整合（18%）","title_html":"Domain 2：Tool 設計與 MCP 整合（18%）","part":2,"kind":"text","read_minutes":4,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"2.1 設計描述清楚的 Tool 介面","slug":"2-1-設計描述清楚的-tool-介面"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"Tool description 是 LLM 選擇 tool 的<strong>主要機制</strong>；描述太少會導致選擇不可靠","callout":false},{"html":"包含輸入格式、範例查詢、邊界案例與適用範圍的重要性","callout":false},{"html":"模糊或重疊的描述會造成錯誤路由","callout":false},{"html":"System prompt 的措辭可能造成與 tool 的非預期關聯","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"撰寫能清楚區分每個 tool 與相似替代品的描述","callout":false},{"html":"重新命名 tools 以消除功能重疊（例如 <code>analyze_content</code> -&gt; <code>extract_web_results</code>）","callout":false},{"html":"把通用 tools 拆成有明確輸入 / 輸出契約的專用 tools","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"2.2 為 MCP Tools 實作結構化錯誤回應","slug":"2-2-為-mcp-tools-實作結構化錯誤回應"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"MCP tool 回應中的 <code>isError</code> 旗標","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Transient 錯誤</strong>（timeout）、<strong>validation 錯誤</strong>（輸入錯）、<strong>business 錯誤</strong>（違反政策）與 <strong>access/permission 錯誤</strong>的差別","callout":false},{"html":"籠統的錯誤（「Operation failed」）讓正確的復原決策變得不可能","callout":false},{"html":"可 retry 與不可 retry 錯誤的差別","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"回傳結構化 metadata，例如 <code>errorCategory</code>（transient/validation/permission）、<code>isRetryable</code> 與人類可讀的訊息","callout":false},{"html":"商業規則違反用 <code>retryable: false</code>，並給使用者清楚的說明","callout":false},{"html":"Transient 失敗在 subagent 內做本地復原；只把解決不了的錯誤往上傳","callout":false},{"html":"區分存取失敗（要做 retry 決策）與有效的空結果（沒有符合）","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"2.3 在 Agents 間分配 Tools 與設定 <code>tool_choice</code>","slug":"2-3-在-agents-間分配-tools-與設定-tool_choice"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"每個 agent 的 tools 太多（例如 18 個而非 4–5 個）會<strong>降低</strong> tool 選擇的可靠性","callout":false},{"html":"擁有超出其專業範圍 tools 的 agent 容易誤用它們","callout":false},{"html":"限縮的 tool 存取：只給角色相關的 tools，加上少量跨角色的共用工具","callout":false},{"html":"<code>tool_choice</code>：<code>\"auto\"</code>、<code>\"any\"</code>，以及強制指定 tool（<code>{\"type\": \"tool\", \"name\": \"...\"}</code>）","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"把每個 subagent 的 tool 集合限制在其角色相關範圍","callout":false},{"html":"用受限的替代品取代通用 tools（例如 <code>fetch_url</code> -&gt; <code>load_document</code>）","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>tool_choice: \"any\"</code> 保證呼叫 tool 而不是文字回答","callout":false},{"html":"強制指定 tool 以確保執行順序","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"2.4 把 MCP Servers 整合進 Claude Code 與 Agent Workflows","slug":"2-4-把-mcp-servers-整合進-claude-code-與-agent-workflows"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"MCP server 的範圍：專案（<code>.mcp.json</code>）給團隊 vs 使用者（<code>~/.claude.json</code>）給實驗","callout":false},{"html":"<code>.mcp.json</code> 中的環境變數替換（例如 <code>${GITHUB_TOKEN}</code>）用來管理密鑰","callout":false},{"html":"所有已連線 MCP servers 的 tools 在連線時被探索並同時可用","callout":false},{"html":"MCP resources 作為「內容目錄」（任務摘要、資料庫 schema）以減少探索性 tool 呼叫","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"在專案 <code>.mcp.json</code> 中設定共用 MCP servers，token 用環境變數","callout":false},{"html":"個人 / 實驗性 servers 放在 <code>~/.claude.json</code>","callout":false},{"html":"標準整合優先用社群 MCP servers 而非自建","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"2.5 選擇並運用內建 Tools（Read、Write、Edit、Bash、Grep、Glob）","slug":"2-5-選擇並運用內建-tools-read-write-edit-bash-grep-glob"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<strong>Grep</strong>：在檔案內容中搜尋（函式名稱、錯誤訊息、import）","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Glob</strong>：依名稱 / 副檔名 pattern 找檔案","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Read/Write</strong>：整檔操作；<strong>Edit</strong>：透過唯一文字比對做精確修改","callout":false},{"html":"Edit 因比對不唯一而失敗時，改用 Read + Write","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"內容搜尋用 Grep、依 pattern 找檔案用 Glob","callout":false},{"html":"漸進式建立理解：先 Grep 找進入點，再 Read 追流程","callout":false},{"html":"穿過 wrapper 模組追蹤函式的使用","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"2-1-設計描述清楚的-tool-介面","title":"2.1 設計描述清楚的 Tool 介面"},{"slug":"2-2-為-mcp-tools-實作結構化錯誤回應","title":"2.2 為 MCP Tools 實作結構化錯誤回應"},{"slug":"2-3-在-agents-間分配-tools-與設定-tool_choice","title":"2.3 在 Agents 間分配 Tools 與設定 tool_choice"},{"slug":"2-4-把-mcp-servers-整合進-claude-code-與-agent-workflows","title":"2.4 把 MCP Servers 整合進 Claude Code 與 Agent Workflows"},{"slug":"2-5-選擇並運用內建-tools-read-write-edit-bash-grep-glob","title":"2.5 選擇並運用內建 Tools（Read、Write、Edit、Bash、Grep、Glob）"}]},{"slug":"domain-3","title":"Domain 3：Claude Code 設定與工作流程（20%）","title_html":"Domain 3：Claude Code 設定與工作流程（20%）","part":2,"kind":"text","read_minutes":5,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"3.1 設定 CLAUDE.md 的層級、範圍與模組化組織","slug":"3-1-設定-claude-md-的層級-範圍與模組化組織"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"CLAUDE.md 層級：user（<code>~/.claude/CLAUDE.md</code>）、project（<code>.claude/CLAUDE.md</code> 或根目錄 <code>CLAUDE.md</code>）與 directory-level（子目錄的 CLAUDE.md）","callout":false},{"html":"User-level 設定只適用於一位使用者，不透過 VCS 分享","callout":false},{"html":"<code>@path</code> 語法引用外部檔案（例如 <code>@./standards/coding-style.md</code>）讓 CLAUDE.md 模組化","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 目錄放主題式規則檔，取代單一巨大的 CLAUDE.md","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"診斷層級問題（新成員收不到指令，因為指令在 user-level 而非 project-level）","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>@path</code>（例如 <code>@./standards/testing.md</code>）在每個 package 的 CLAUDE.md 中選擇性引入標準","callout":false},{"html":"把大型 CLAUDE.md 拆成多個 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 檔案（testing.md、api-conventions.md、deployment.md）","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"3.2 建立與設定自訂 Slash Commands 與 Skills","slug":"3-2-建立與設定自訂-slash-commands-與-skills"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<strong>專案 commands</strong> 在 <code>.claude/commands/</code>（透過 VCS 分享）vs <strong>使用者 commands</strong> 在 <code>~/.claude/commands/</code>","callout":false},{"html":"<code>.claude/skills/</code> 中的 skills 用 <code>SKILL.md</code> frontmatter：<code>context: fork</code>、<code>allowed-tools</code>、<code>argument-hint</code>","callout":false},{"html":"<code>context: fork</code> 在隔離的 subagent context 中執行 skill，不污染主 session","callout":false},{"html":"個人 skill 變體可放在 <code>~/.claude/skills/</code>，用不同名稱","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"專案 slash commands 放 <code>.claude/commands/</code>，整個團隊都拿得到","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>context: fork</code> 隔離輸出冗長的 skills","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>allowed-tools</code> 限制 skill 可用的 tools","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>argument-hint</code> 提示開發者輸入必要參數","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"3.3 用路徑專屬規則做條件式慣例載入","slug":"3-3-用路徑專屬規則做條件式慣例載入"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<code>.claude/rules/</code> 檔案可以用 YAML frontmatter 的 <code>paths</code>，依 glob pattern 啟用規則","callout":false},{"html":"路徑範圍的規則<strong>只在</strong>編輯符合的檔案時載入，節省 context 與 token","callout":false},{"html":"當慣例橫跨多個目錄（例如測試）時，glob 路徑規則比 directory-level CLAUDE.md 更合適","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"建立帶 <code>paths: [\"terraform/**/*\"]</code> 的 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 檔案，只在處理符合檔案時載入","callout":false},{"html":"用 glob pattern（<code>**/*.test.tsx</code>）依檔案類型套用慣例，不受位置限制","callout":false},{"html":"慣例橫跨 codebase 時，優先用路徑專屬規則而非 directory-level CLAUDE.md","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"3.4 決定何時用 Planning Mode、何時直接執行","slug":"3-4-決定何時用-planning-mode-何時直接執行"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"<strong>Planning mode</strong>：用於大規模變更、多種可行做法與架構決策的複雜任務","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>直接執行</strong>：用於簡單、已充分理解的變更（例如加一個驗證）","callout":false},{"html":"Planning mode 讓你在修改前安全地探索 codebase","callout":false},{"html":"Explore subagent 隔離冗長的探索輸出","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"有架構影響的任務用 planning mode（microservices、影響 45+ 檔案的 migration）","callout":false},{"html":"有明確 stack trace、單一檔案的修正直接執行","callout":false},{"html":"用 Explore subagent 避免多階段任務耗盡 context window","callout":false},{"html":"組合使用：先 plan 做探索，再 execute 做實作","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"3.5 漸進式改善的迭代精煉","slug":"3-5-漸進式改善的迭代精煉"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"具體的輸入 / 輸出範例是傳達期望最有效的方式","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>測試驅動迭代</strong>：先寫測試，再依失敗迭代","callout":false},{"html":"「訪談」模式：Claude 提問以揭露非顯而易見的設計考量","callout":false},{"html":"何時把所有問題放在一則訊息（互相依賴）vs 分批（彼此獨立）","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"提供 2–3 個具體的輸入 / 輸出範例以釐清轉換需求","callout":false},{"html":"實作前先建立含預期行為、邊界案例與效能需求的測試集","callout":false},{"html":"用訪談模式揭露設計面向（cache invalidation、失敗模式）","callout":false},{"html":"為邊界案例提供含範例輸入與預期輸出的具體測試案例","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"3.6 把 Claude Code 整合進 CI/CD Pipeline","slug":"3-6-把-claude-code-整合進-ci-cd-pipeline"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"在自動化 pipeline 中用 <code>-p</code>（或 <code>--print</code>）旗標進入非互動模式","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>--output-format json</code> 與 <code>--json-schema</code> 取得 CI 用的結構化輸出","callout":false},{"html":"CLAUDE.md 為 CI 觸發的 Claude Code 提供專案 context（測試標準、review 標準）","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>Session context 隔離</strong>：產生程式碼的同一個 session，review 起來比獨立 instance 差","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"在 CI 中用 <code>-p</code> 執行 Claude Code，避免卡在互動輸入","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>--output-format json</code> + <code>--json-schema</code> 取得結構化結果（例如 inline PR comment）","callout":false},{"html":"新 commit 後重新執行時，把先前的 review 結果納入（只回報新的 / 未修的問題）","callout":false},{"html":"在 CLAUDE.md 中記錄測試標準與可用的 fixtures，提升測試產生品質","callout":false},{"html":"產生新測試時把既有測試檔納入 context，避免重複並保持風格一致","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"3-1-設定-claude-md-的層級-範圍與模組化組織","title":"3.1 設定 CLAUDE.md 的層級、範圍與模組化組織"},{"slug":"3-2-建立與設定自訂-slash-commands-與-skills","title":"3.2 建立與設定自訂 Slash Commands 與 Skills"},{"slug":"3-3-用路徑專屬規則做條件式慣例載入","title":"3.3 用路徑專屬規則做條件式慣例載入"},{"slug":"3-4-決定何時用-planning-mode-何時直接執行","title":"3.4 決定何時用 Planning Mode、何時直接執行"},{"slug":"3-5-漸進式改善的迭代精煉","title":"3.5 漸進式改善的迭代精煉"},{"slug":"3-6-把-claude-code-整合進-ci-cd-pipeline","title":"3.6 把 Claude Code 整合進 CI/CD Pipeline"}]},{"slug":"domain-4","title":"Domain 4：Prompt Engineering 與結構化輸出（20%）","title_html":"Domain 4：Prompt Engineering 與結構化輸出（20%）","part":2,"kind":"text","read_minutes":5,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"4.1 用明確標準設計 Prompt 以提升準確率","slug":"4-1-用明確標準設計-prompt-以提升準確率"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"明確標準比模糊指令有效（例如「只在註解與程式碼矛盾時標記」vs「檢查註解的準確性」）","callout":false},{"html":"「be more conservative」這類籠統指引，效果比具體的分類標準差","callout":false},{"html":"False positive 對開發者信任的影響：某些分類的高誤報率會侵蝕對準確分類的信任","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"定義 review 標準：該回報什麼（bug、安全）vs 該忽略什麼（次要風格）","callout":false},{"html":"暫時停用誤報率高的分類","callout":false},{"html":"用每個等級的程式碼範例定義明確的嚴重度標準","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"4.2 用 Few-shot Prompting 提升輸出一致性","slug":"4-2-用-few-shot-prompting-提升輸出一致性"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"Few-shot 範例是產出格式一致、可執行輸出最有效的方法","callout":false},{"html":"Few-shot 可以示範模糊案例的處理（tool 選擇、測試覆蓋的缺口）","callout":false},{"html":"Few-shot 幫助模型泛化到新模式，而非只重複預設","callout":false},{"html":"Few-shot 可以減少抽取任務中的幻覺","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"針對模糊情境提供 2–4 個附理由的範例","callout":false},{"html":"用 few-shot 範例展示輸出格式（位置、問題、嚴重度、建議修法）","callout":false},{"html":"提供區分可接受的程式碼模式與真正問題的範例","callout":false},{"html":"提供從不同結構文件正確抽取的範例","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"4.3 用 <code>tool_use</code> 與 JSON Schema 強制結構化輸出","slug":"4-3-用-tool_use-與-json-schema-強制結構化輸出"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"帶 JSON Schema 的 <code>tool_use</code> 是保證輸出符合 schema、消除 JSON 語法錯誤最可靠的方式","callout":false},{"html":"<code>tool_choice: \"auto\"</code> 時模型可回文字；<code>\"any\"</code> 時必須呼叫 tool；強制指定則選特定 tool","callout":false},{"html":"嚴格的 JSON Schema 消除語法錯誤，但無法防止語意錯誤（總額加不起來；值放錯欄位）","callout":false},{"html":"Schema 設計：required vs optional 欄位；enum 加「other」與 detail 字串以利擴充","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"用 JSON Schema 定義抽取 tools，從 <code>tool_use</code> 結果解析資料","callout":false},{"html":"有多個 schema 時用 <code>tool_choice: \"any\"</code> 保證結構化輸出","callout":false},{"html":"強制呼叫特定 tool：<code>tool_choice: {\"type\": \"tool\", \"name\": \"extract_metadata\"}</code>","callout":false},{"html":"來源可能沒有該資訊時，把欄位設為 optional/nullable 以避免捏造值","callout":false},{"html":"用 <code>\"unclear\"</code>、<code>\"other\"</code> 等 enum 值加 detail 欄位做可擴充的分類","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"4.4 為抽取品質實作驗證、Retry 與回饋迴圈","slug":"4-4-為抽取品質實作驗證-retry-與回饋迴圈"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"Retry-with-error-feedback：在 retry prompt 中放入具體的驗證錯誤以引導修正","callout":false},{"html":"資訊根本不在來源中時，retry 無效","callout":false},{"html":"回饋迴圈設計：追蹤觸發 finding 的模式（<code>detected_pattern</code>）","callout":false},{"html":"語意錯誤（總額不符）vs 語法錯誤（由 <code>tool_use</code> 解決）","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"後續 prompt 帶上原始文件、錯誤的抽取結果與具體的驗證錯誤","callout":false},{"html":"辨識 retry 何時無效（所需資訊只在外部文件中）","callout":false},{"html":"在 findings 中加入 <code>detected_pattern</code> 欄位以分析 false positive","callout":false},{"html":"同時抽取 <code>calculated_total</code> 與 <code>stated_total</code> 以偵測差異，設計 self-correction","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"4.5 設計高效的批次處理策略","slug":"4-5-設計高效的批次處理策略"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"Message Batches API：省 50%、最長 24 小時處理時間窗、沒有延遲 SLA 保證","callout":false},{"html":"批次處理適合非阻塞任務（隔夜報告、稽核），不適合阻塞任務（pre-merge 檢查）","callout":false},{"html":"Batch API 不支援單一請求內的多回合 tool calling","callout":false},{"html":"<code>custom_id</code> 欄位對應批次中的請求 / 回應","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"阻塞式檢查用同步 API；隔夜 / 每週的工作用 Batch API","callout":false},{"html":"依 SLA 需求規劃批次送出節奏（例如處理需 24 小時、保證 30 小時時用 4 小時窗口）","callout":false},{"html":"只重送失敗的文件（用 <code>custom_id</code> 辨識）","callout":false},{"html":"大規模處理前先用樣本迭代 prompt","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"4.6 設計多 Instance 與多輪 Review 架構","slug":"4-6-設計多-instance-與多輪-review-架構"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"自我 review 的限制：模型保有自己的推理 context，比較不會質疑自己的決定","callout":false},{"html":"獨立的 review instance（沒有產生時的 context）更能找出細微問題","callout":false},{"html":"多輪 review：逐檔的局部分析加跨檔整合檢查，避免注意力稀釋","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"用第二個獨立的 Claude instance review 變更，不帶產生時的 context","callout":false},{"html":"把多檔 review 拆成逐檔的 pass 加整合 pass 以分析跨檔資料流","callout":false},{"html":"用帶自評信心的驗證 pass 做校準過的 review 路由","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"4-1-用明確標準設計-prompt-以提升準確率","title":"4.1 用明確標準設計 Prompt 以提升準確率"},{"slug":"4-2-用-few-shot-prompting-提升輸出一致性","title":"4.2 用 Few-shot Prompting 提升輸出一致性"},{"slug":"4-3-用-tool_use-與-json-schema-強制結構化輸出","title":"4.3 用 tool_use 與 JSON Schema 強制結構化輸出"},{"slug":"4-4-為抽取品質實作驗證-retry-與回饋迴圈","title":"4.4 為抽取品質實作驗證、Retry 與回饋迴圈"},{"slug":"4-5-設計高效的批次處理策略","title":"4.5 設計高效的批次處理策略"},{"slug":"4-6-設計多-instance-與多輪-review-架構","title":"4.6 設計多 Instance 與多輪 Review 架構"}]},{"slug":"domain-5","title":"Domain 5：Context 管理與可靠性（15%）","title_html":"Domain 5：Context 管理與可靠性（15%）","part":2,"kind":"text","read_minutes":4,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.1 管理對話 Context 以保留關鍵資訊","slug":"5-1-管理對話-context-以保留關鍵資訊"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"漸進式摘要的風險：數值、百分比與日期被濃縮成模糊的摘要","callout":false},{"html":"Lost-in-the-middle 效應：模型能可靠處理長輸入的開頭與結尾，但可能漏掉中間的發現","callout":false},{"html":"Tool 輸出在 context 中的累積可能與其相關性不成比例（需要 5 個欄位卻有 40+ 個）","callout":false},{"html":"後續 API 請求要送出完整對話歷史的重要性","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"把交易事實抽到摘要歷史之外的持久「case facts」區塊","callout":false},{"html":"把冗長的 tool 輸出裁剪到相關欄位","callout":false},{"html":"把關鍵發現放在彙整資料的開頭，並加明確的章節標題","callout":false},{"html":"要求 subagents 在結構化輸出中包含 metadata（日期、來源）","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.2 設計有效的 Escalation 模式與解決歧義","slug":"5-2-設計有效的-escalation-模式與解決歧義"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"合適的 escalation 觸發條件：明確要求找真人、政策空缺 / 例外、無法取得進展","callout":false},{"html":"立即 escalate（明確要求）vs 先嘗試解決（在 agent 範圍內）","callout":false},{"html":"情緒分析與模型自評信心都不是案件複雜度的可靠代理指標","callout":false},{"html":"客戶多筆符合時要求額外識別資訊，而不是用啟發式猜測","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"在 system prompt 中用 few-shot 範例寫明確的 escalation 標準","callout":false},{"html":"對明確要求找真人的請求立即執行，不做額外調查","callout":false},{"html":"政策對特定請求模糊或未提及時 escalate","callout":false},{"html":"Tool 結果有多筆符合時要求額外識別資訊","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.3 在多 Agent 系統中實作錯誤傳播策略","slug":"5-3-在多-agent-系統中實作錯誤傳播策略"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"結構化的錯誤 context（失敗類型、查詢、部分結果、替代方案）讓 coordinator 能更聰明地復原","callout":false},{"html":"區分存取失敗（timeout 需要 retry 決策）與有效的空結果（沒有符合）","callout":false},{"html":"籠統的錯誤狀態（「search unavailable」）向 coordinator 隱藏了寶貴的 context","callout":false},{"html":"靜默吞掉錯誤或因單一失敗中止整個 workflow 都是反模式","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"回傳結構化的錯誤 context：失敗類型、嘗試了什麼、部分結果、可能的替代方案","callout":false},{"html":"區分存取失敗與有效的空結果","callout":false},{"html":"Transient 失敗在 subagent 內本地復原；只把不可復原的錯誤帶著部分結果往上傳","callout":false},{"html":"在 synthesis 中標註覆蓋範圍：哪些有充分支持、哪些仍有缺口","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.4 調查大型 Codebase 時高效管理 Context","slug":"5-4-調查大型-codebase-時高效管理-context"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"長 session 中的 context 退化：模型開始給出不穩定的答案，用「典型模式」代替具體的 class","callout":false},{"html":"Scratchpad 檔案跨 context 邊界保存關鍵發現","callout":false},{"html":"委派給 subagents 隔離冗長的探索輸出","callout":false},{"html":"結構化的狀態持久化支援 crash 復原","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"針對具體問題產生 subagents，主 agent 只保留高層協調","callout":false},{"html":"用 scratchpad 檔案存關鍵發現並稍後引用","callout":false},{"html":"產生下一階段 subagents 前先摘要關鍵發現","callout":false},{"html":"長時間調查中用 <code>/compact</code> 降低 context 用量","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.5 設計帶人工監督與信心校準的 Workflow","slug":"5-5-設計帶人工監督與信心校準的-workflow"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"整體指標（例如 97% 總準確率）可能掩蓋特定文件類型或欄位的差表現","callout":false},{"html":"分層隨機抽樣量測高信心抽取結果中的錯誤率","callout":false},{"html":"用有標註的驗證集做欄位層級的信心校準","callout":false},{"html":"自動化之前先依文件類型與欄位區段驗證準確率","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"實作分層隨機抽樣以偵測新的錯誤模式","callout":false},{"html":"依文件類型與欄位分析準確率以驗證穩定表現","callout":false},{"html":"輸出欄位層級的信心分數，並用標註資料校準 review 門檻","callout":false},{"html":"把低信心或來源模糊的抽取結果路由給人工審查","callout":false}]},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"5.6 多來源 Synthesis 中保存來源與處理不確定性","slug":"5-6-多來源-synthesis-中保存來源與處理不確定性"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心知識：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"沒有保存「主張 → 來源」對應的話，摘要時歸屬會流失","callout":false},{"html":"彙整時必須保存結構化的對應","callout":false},{"html":"互相矛盾的統計數字要附歸屬標註衝突，而不是任意挑一個","callout":false},{"html":"附上發表 / 收集日期，避免把時間差異誤讀為矛盾","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>核心技能：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"要求 subagents 輸出「主張 → 來源」對應（URL、文件名稱、引文）","callout":false},{"html":"把報告結構化，區分穩定的發現與有爭議的發現","callout":false},{"html":"保留互相矛盾的值並加註，交給 coordinator 調解","callout":false},{"html":"附上發表日期以正確解讀時間脈絡","callout":false},{"html":"依內容類型呈現：財務資料用表格、新聞用散文、技術發現用結構化清單","callout":false}]}],"headings":[{"slug":"5-1-管理對話-context-以保留關鍵資訊","title":"5.1 管理對話 Context 以保留關鍵資訊"},{"slug":"5-2-設計有效的-escalation-模式與解決歧義","title":"5.2 設計有效的 Escalation 模式與解決歧義"},{"slug":"5-3-在多-agent-系統中實作錯誤傳播策略","title":"5.3 在多 Agent 系統中實作錯誤傳播策略"},{"slug":"5-4-調查大型-codebase-時高效管理-context","title":"5.4 調查大型 Codebase 時高效管理 Context"},{"slug":"5-5-設計帶人工監督與信心校準的-workflow","title":"5.5 設計帶人工監督與信心校準的 Workflow"},{"slug":"5-6-多來源-synthesis-中保存來源與處理不確定性","title":"5.6 多來源 Synthesis 中保存來源與處理不確定性"}]},{"slug":"quiz-1","title":"範例試題與解析","title_html":"範例試題與解析","part":3,"kind":"quiz","read_minutes":10,"blocks":[],"questions":[{"n":1,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"資料顯示有 12% 的案例中，agent 跳過 <code>get_customer</code>，只用客戶名字就呼叫 <code>lookup_order</code>，導致錯誤的退款。","stem":"哪個改法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"加一個程式化的前置條件，在 <code>get_customer</code> 取得 ID 之前封鎖 <code>lookup_order</code> 與 <code>process_refund</code>","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"改善 system prompt","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"加 few-shot 範例","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"實作一個路由分類器","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"當關鍵商業邏輯需要特定的 tool 順序時，程式碼提供的是<strong>確定性保證</strong>，這是以 prompt 為基礎的做法（B、C）做不到的。D 解決的是可用性問題，不是 tool 順序。"},{"n":2,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"Agent 對訂單相關的問題常常呼叫 <code>get_customer</code> 而不是 <code>lookup_order</code>。Tool descriptions 很精簡且相似。","stem":"第一步該做什麼？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"加 few-shot 範例","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"擴充每個 tool 的 description，加入輸入格式、範例與適用邊界","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"加一層路由層","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"合併這兩個 tools","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"Tool description 是模型選擇 tool 的主要機制。這是成本最低、影響最大的修法。A 增加 token 卻沒處理根本原因。C 是過度工程。D 的工程量超過需要。"},{"n":3,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"Agent 只解決了 55% 的問題，目標是 80%。它會 escalate 簡單案件，卻試圖自主處理需要政策例外的複雜情況。","stem":"如何改善校準？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"加入明確的 escalation 標準與 few-shot 範例","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"自評信心（1–10）並自動 escalate","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"用歷史資料訓練一個獨立的分類器","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"情緒分析","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"它直接處理根本原因：決策邊界不清楚。B 不可靠（模型可能很有信心地錯）。C 是過度工程。D 解決的是另一個問題（情緒 ≠ 複雜度）。"},{"n":4,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"你需要一個做標準 code review 的自訂 <code>/review</code> command，整個團隊 clone repo 時就能使用。","stem":"Command 檔案該建在哪裡？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"專案 repo 裡的 <code>.claude/commands/</code>","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"<code>~/.claude/commands/</code>","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"根目錄的 <code>CLAUDE.md</code>","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"<code>.claude/config.json</code>","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"放在 <code>.claude/commands/</code> 的專案 commands 受版本控制，所有人自動可用。B 是個人 commands。C 是放指令的，不是 command 定義。D 不存在。"},{"n":5,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"你需要把 monolith 重構成 microservices（幾十個檔案、服務邊界的決策）。","stem":"該用什麼做法？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"Planning mode：探索 codebase、理解依賴、設計做法","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"直接執行，漸進式修改","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"直接執行，事先給詳細指令","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"直接執行，遇到困難再切到 planning","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"Planning mode 就是為大規模變更、多種可能做法與架構決策設計的。B 有昂貴重工的風險。C 假設你已經知道結構。D 是被動反應。"},{"n":6,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"Codebase 不同區域有不同慣例（React、API、資料庫）。測試檔與程式碼放在一起。你希望慣例能自動套用。","stem":"該用什麼做法？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"帶 YAML frontmatter 與 glob pattern 的 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 檔案","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"全部放進根目錄 CLAUDE.md","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"<code>.claude/skills/</code> 裡的 skills","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"每個目錄都放 CLAUDE.md","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"帶 glob pattern（例如 <code>**/*.test.tsx</code>）的 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 能依檔案路徑自動套用慣例，最適合散落各處的測試檔。B 依賴模型自行推斷。C 是手動 / 按需。D 在相關檔案分散在多個目錄時效果不好。"},{"n":7,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"系統研究「AI 對創意產業的影響」，但報告只涵蓋視覺藝術。Coordinator 把主題分解成：「AI in digital art」、「AI in graphic design」、「AI in photography」。","stem":"原因是什麼？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"Synthesis agent 沒有偵測缺口","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"Coordinator 把任務分解得太窄","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"Web search agent 搜得不夠徹底","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"Document analysis agent 過濾掉了非視覺類的來源","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"Log 顯示 coordinator 只把「創意產業」分解成視覺子題，完全漏掉音樂、文學與電影。Subagents 都正確執行了，問題在於它們被指派了什麼。"},{"n":8,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"一個 web-search subagent 在研究複雜主題時 timeout。你要設計錯誤資訊如何回傳給 coordinator。","stem":"哪種錯誤傳播方式最能支援聰明的復原？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"回傳結構化的錯誤 context 給 coordinator：失敗類型、查詢、部分結果與替代方案","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"在 subagent 內做 exponential backoff 自動 retry，然後回傳籠統的「search unavailable」狀態","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在 subagent 內接住 timeout，回傳標記為成功的空結果集","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"把 timeout exception 傳到最上層的 handler，終止整個 workflow","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"結構化的錯誤 context 給了 coordinator 決定要用修改後的查詢 retry、換方法，還是帶部分結果繼續所需的一切。B 把 context 藏在籠統狀態後面。C 把失敗偽裝成成功。D 不必要地中止整個 workflow。"},{"n":9,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"Synthesis agent 在合併結果時常需要驗證特定主張。目前需要驗證時，synthesis agent 把控制權交回 coordinator，coordinator 呼叫 web-search agent，再帶著新結果重跑 synthesis。這讓每個任務多了 2–3 次往返、延遲增加 40%。你的評估顯示 85% 的檢查是簡單的事實查核（日期、名字、統計數字），15% 需要更深入的調查。","stem":"如何在維持可靠性的同時降低開銷？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"給 synthesis agent 一個範圍受限的 <code>verify_fact</code> tool 做簡單檢查，複雜的驗證繼續經過 coordinator","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"把所有驗證需求累積成一批，最後一起交回 coordinator","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"給 synthesis agent 所有 web-search tools 的完整存取權","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"主動在每個來源周圍快取額外的 context","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"這是最小權限原則的應用：synthesis agent 剛好拿到處理 85% 常見情況（簡單事實查核）所需的能力，同時保留經 coordinator 中介的路徑處理複雜調查。B 引入阻塞依賴（後面的 synthesis 步驟可能依賴先前已驗證的事實）。C 破壞職責分離。D 依賴無法可靠預測需求的推測性快取。"},{"n":10,"scenario":"Claude Code for CI","situation":"Pipeline 執行 <code>claude \"Analyze this pull request for security issues\"</code>，卻卡住等待互動輸入。","stem":"正確做法是什麼？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"用 <code>-p</code> 旗標：<code>claude -p \"Analyze this pull request for security issues\"</code>","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"設定 <code>CLAUDE_HEADLESS=true</code>","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"把 stdin 重導到 <code>/dev/null</code>","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"用 <code>--batch</code>","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"<code>-p</code>（或 <code>--print</code>）是文件記載的非互動模式執行方式。它處理 prompt、輸出到 stdout、然後結束。其他選項要不是不存在的功能，就是 Unix 層的變通法。"},{"n":11,"scenario":"Claude Code for CI","situation":"團隊想降低自動化分析的 API 成本。Claude 目前即時服務兩個 workflow：(1) 開發者 merge PR 前必須完成的阻塞式 pre-merge 檢查，(2) 隔夜產生、早上檢視的技術債報告。主管提議把兩者都移到 Message Batches API 以省 50%。","stem":"你該如何評估這個提案？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"只把技術債報告用批次處理；pre-merge 檢查維持即時呼叫","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"兩個 workflow 都移到批次處理並輪詢完成狀態","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"兩者都維持即時呼叫，避免批次結果的排序問題","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"兩者都移到批次處理，批次太久就 fallback 到即時","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"Message Batches API 省 50%，但處理時間最長 24 小時、沒有延遲 SLA 保證。這對開發者在等的阻塞式 pre-merge 檢查不合適，但對隔夜批次工作（如技術債報告）非常理想。"},{"n":12,"scenario":"Multi-file Code Review","situation":"一個 pull request 改了 inventory tracking 模組的 14 個檔案。一次看完所有檔案的單輪 review 結果不一致：某些檔案評論詳細、某些浮淺、漏掉明顯的 bug，還有互相矛盾的回饋（同一個模式在一個檔案被標記有問題，在另一個檔案的相同程式碼卻被放行）。","stem":"該如何重構這個 review？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"拆成聚焦的多輪：先逐檔分析局部問題，再獨立跑一輪整合檢查看跨檔資料流","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"要求開發者把大 PR 拆成 3–4 個檔案的提交","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"換成 context window 更大的高階模型，一輪看完 14 個檔案","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"獨立跑三次完整 PR review，只回報至少兩次都出現的問題","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"聚焦的多輪直接處理根本原因：一次處理太多檔案時的注意力稀釋。逐檔分析確保一致的深度，獨立的整合檢查抓跨檔問題。B 把負擔推給開發者而沒改善系統。C 是誤解：更大的 context 不會修正注意力品質。D 靠不一致偵測之間的共識，反而會壓掉真正的 bug。"}],"scenarios":["Customer Support Agent","Code Generation with Claude Code","Multi-agent Research System","Claude Code for CI","Multi-file Code Review"],"headings":[]},{"slug":"quiz-2","title":"模擬試題（76 題）","title_html":"模擬試題（76 題）","part":3,"kind":"quiz","read_minutes":91,"blocks":[{"type":"quote","html":"原文為 60 題、涵蓋 4 個情境，後續補充了 Conversational AI Architecture Patterns 情境的 16 題，共 76 題。題型與難度對應真實考試。可用上方的情境篩選，只練某一類。"}],"questions":[{"n":1,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"Document analysis agent 發現兩個可信來源對同一關鍵指標的統計數字直接矛盾：政府報告說成長 40%，產業分析說 12%。兩個來源看起來都可信，而這個差異可能實質影響研究結論。Document analysis agent 該如何最有效地處理？","stem":"哪個做法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"用可信度啟發式挑出最可能正確的數字，用該值完成分析，並加註腳提到差異。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"把兩個數字都放進分析輸出但不標記為矛盾，讓 synthesis agent 依更廣的 context 決定用哪個。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"停止分析並立即 escalate 給 coordinator，請它先決定哪個來源更權威再繼續。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"用兩個數字完成分析，明確標註衝突並附上來源歸屬，讓 coordinator 在交給 synthesis 前決定如何調解。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"這個做法保持了職責分離：analysis agent 不阻塞地完成核心工作、保留兩個有清楚歸屬的矛盾值，並正確地把調解交給擁有更廣 context 的 coordinator。"},{"n":2,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"Web-search 與 document-analysis agents 完成任務並把結果回傳給 coordinator。產出整合研究報告的下一步是什麼？","stem":"下一步最合適的是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"每個 agent 直接把結果送給 report-writing agent，跳過 coordinator。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"Document analysis agent 向 web-search 要結果並在內部合併。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"Coordinator 把兩組結果交給 synthesis agent 做統一整合。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"Coordinator 把兩個 agent 的原始輸出串接起來，當成最終結果回傳。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"在 coordinator–subagent 架構中，coordinator 把兩組結果轉交給 synthesis agent 做集中整合，保有控制權並確保高品質的合併。"},{"n":3,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"Document analysis subagent 處理 PDF 時常失敗：有些檔案有損壞區段觸發 parsing exception、有些有密碼保護、有時 parsing library 在大檔案上 hang 住。目前任何 exception 都會立即終止 subagent 並回傳錯誤給 coordinator，由它決定要 retry、跳過還是讓整個任務失敗。這讓 coordinator 過度介入例行的錯誤處理。哪個架構改善最有效？","stem":"哪個改善最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"建一個專門的 error-handling agent，透過共用 queue 監控所有失敗並決定復原動作，直接對 subagents 下重啟命令。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"設定 subagent 永遠回傳帶成功狀態的部分結果，把錯誤細節嵌在 metadata；coordinator 把所有回應都視為成功。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"讓 coordinator 在送給 subagent 前先驗證所有文件，拒絕可能造成失敗的文件。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 subagent 內對 transient 失敗實作本地復原，只把它解決不了的錯誤 escalate 給 coordinator，並附上已嘗試的步驟與部分結果。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"在有能力解決的最低層級處理錯誤。本地復原減少 coordinator 的負擔，同時仍把真正不可復原的問題帶著完整 context 與部分進度往上 escalate。"},{"n":4,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"在「AI 對創意產業的影響」跑完系統後，你觀察到每個 subagent 都成功完成：web-search agent 找到相關文章、document analysis agent 正確摘要、synthesis agent 產出連貫的文字。但最終報告只涵蓋視覺藝術，完全漏掉音樂、文學與電影。Coordinator log 顯示它把主題分解成三個子任務：「AI in digital art」、「AI in graphic design」、「AI in photography」。最可能的根本原因是？","stem":"最可能的根本原因是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"Synthesis agent 缺少偵測覆蓋缺口的指令。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"Document analysis agent 因為過嚴的相關性標準過濾掉了非視覺類來源。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"Coordinator 的任務分解太窄，指派給 subagents 的工作沒有涵蓋所有相關領域。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"Web-search agent 的查詢不夠，應該擴大以涵蓋更多產業。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"Coordinator 只把一個廣泛主題分解成視覺藝術子任務，完全漏掉音樂、文學與電影。既然 subagents 都正確執行了指派的工作，太窄的分解就是明顯的根本原因。"},{"n":5,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"Web-search subagent 只回傳了 5 個要求的來源類別中的 3 個（競品網站與產業報告成功，新聞檔案與社群 feed timeout）。Document analysis subagent 成功處理了所有提供的文件。Synthesis subagent 必須從品質不一的上游輸入產出摘要。哪個錯誤傳播策略最有效？","stem":"哪個錯誤傳播策略最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"只用成功的來源繼續 synthesis，輸出中不提哪些資料不可用。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"Synthesis subagent 回傳錯誤給 coordinator，因資料不完整觸發整體 retry 或任務失敗。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"Synthesis subagent 要求 coordinator 用更長的 timeout retry 失敗的來源，再開始 synthesis。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 synthesis 輸出中加上覆蓋範圍標註，指出哪些結論有充分支持、哪些因來源不可用而有缺口。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"覆蓋範圍標註實作了帶透明度的優雅降級（graceful degradation），保留已完成工作的價值，同時把不確定性往下傳，讓人能對信心做出有依據的判斷。"},{"n":6,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"Document analysis subagent 遇到一個無法解析的損壞 PDF。設計系統的錯誤處理時，處理這個失敗最有效的方式是？","stem":"哪個做法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"帶著 context 回傳錯誤給 coordinator agent，讓它決定如何繼續。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"靜默跳過損壞的文件並繼續處理其餘檔案，避免中斷 workflow。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"用 exponential backoff 自動重試解析三次，再回報失敗。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"丟出 exception 終止整個研究 workflow。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"帶著 context 回傳錯誤給 coordinator 最有效，因為它讓 coordinator 能做出有依據的決定：跳過檔案、嘗試其他解析方法，或通知使用者，同時保有對失敗的可見度。"},{"n":7,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"Production log 顯示一個持續的模式：像「analyze the uploaded quarterly report」這樣的請求有 45% 被路由到 web-search agent 而不是 document analysis agent。檢視 tool 定義後，你發現 web-search agent 有一個 <code>analyze_content</code> tool，描述是「analyzes content and extracts key information」，而 document analysis agent 有一個 <code>analyze_document</code> tool，描述是「analyzes documents and extracts key information」。該如何修正錯誤路由的問題？","stem":"該如何修正錯誤路由？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"加一個前置路由分類器，在 coordinator 決定委派前先偵測使用者指的是上傳檔案還是網頁內容。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"把 web-search 的 tool 改名為 <code>extract_web_results</code>，並把描述改成「processes and returns information retrieved from web search and URLs」。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"在 coordinator prompt 加 few-shot 範例展示正確路由：「使用者上傳季報 → document analysis agent」、「使用者問網頁 → web-search agent」。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"擴充 document analysis tool 的描述，加入「Use for uploaded PDFs, Word docs, and spreadsheets」等用法範例，web-search tool 不動。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"把 web-search tool 改名為 <code>extract_web_results</code> 並把描述改為明確指涉 web search 與 URL，直接消除兩個 tool 名稱與描述之間的語意重疊，移除了根本原因。這讓每個 tool 的用途毫無歧義，coordinator 能可靠地區分 document analysis 與 web search。"},{"n":8,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"同事提議 document analysis agent 應直接把結果送給 synthesis agent，跳過 coordinator。維持 coordinator 作為 subagents 之間所有溝通中樞的主要優點是什麼？","stem":"維持 coordinator 作為中樞的主要優點是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"Coordinator 可以觀察所有互動、統一處理錯誤，並決定每個 subagent 該收到什麼資訊。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"Coordinator 把多個請求批次送給 subagents，減少總 API 呼叫數與整體延遲。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"經過 coordinator 路由能啟用 agent 直接互相呼叫無法支援的自動 retry 邏輯。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"Subagents 使用隔離的記憶，直接溝通需要只有 coordinator 能做的複雜序列化。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"Coordinator 模式提供對所有互動的集中可見度、跨系統統一的錯誤處理，以及對每個 subagent 收到什麼資訊的精細控制，這些是星狀溝通拓樸的主要優勢。"},{"n":9,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"Web-search subagent 在研究複雜主題時 timeout。你需要設計這個失敗的資訊如何回傳給 coordinator。哪個錯誤傳播方式最能支援聰明的復原？","stem":"哪個錯誤傳播方式最能支援聰明的復原？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"回傳結構化的錯誤 context 給 coordinator，包含失敗類型、執行的查詢、任何部分結果，以及可能的替代做法。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"在 subagent 內接住 timeout，回傳標記為成功的空結果集。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在 subagent 內實作 exponential backoff 自動 retry，用完 retry 後只回傳籠統的「search unavailable」狀態。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"把 timeout exception 直接傳到最上層 handler，終止整個研究 workflow。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"回傳結構化的錯誤 context（失敗類型、執行的查詢、部分結果與替代做法）給了 coordinator 做聰明復原決策所需的一切（例如用修改後的查詢 retry，或帶部分結果繼續）。它為協調層級的決策保留了最多的 context。"},{"n":10,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"系統設計時，你給 document analysis agent 一個通用的 <code>fetch_url</code> tool，讓它能依 URL 下載文件。Production log 顯示這個 agent 現在常下載搜尋引擎結果頁來做臨時的 web search，這種行為本應經過 web-search agent，結果造成不一致。哪個修法最有效？","stem":"哪個修法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"把 <code>fetch_url</code> 換成會驗證 URL 指向文件格式的 <code>load_document</code> tool。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"從 document analysis agent 移除 <code>fetch_url</code>，所有 URL 抓取都經過 coordinator 路由到 web-search agent。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"實作過濾，阻擋對已知搜尋引擎網域的 <code>fetch_url</code> 呼叫，允許其他 URL。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 document analysis agent 的 prompt 加指令，<code>fetch_url</code> 只能用來下載文件 URL，不能用來搜尋。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"用會依文件格式驗證 URL 的文件專用 tool 取代通用 tool，在介面層級限制了能力，修正了根本原因。這遵循最小權限原則，讓不想要的搜尋行為變成不可能，而不只是被勸阻。"},{"n":11,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"研究一個廣泛主題時，你觀察到 web-search agent 與 document analysis agent 調查了相同的子題，導致輸出大量重複。Token 用量幾乎翻倍，研究的廣度或深度卻沒有相應增加。最有效的處理方式是？","stem":"最有效的處理方式是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"讓兩個 agent 平行完成，再由 coordinator 在交給 synthesis agent 前去除重疊的結果。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"Coordinator 在委派前明確劃分研究空間，指派每個 agent 不同的子題或來源類型。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"實作共用狀態機制，讓 agents 記錄目前的焦點區域，其他 agent 在執行中動態避免重複。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"改成順序執行：document analysis 在 web search 完成後才跑，用 web-search 結果作為 context 來避免重複。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"由 coordinator 在委派前明確劃分研究空間最有效，因為它在任何工作開始前就處理了根本原因：不清楚的任務邊界。它保留了平行性，同時避免重複的工作與浪費的 token。"},{"n":12,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"研究時，web-search subagent 查了三類來源，結果不同：學術資料庫回傳 15 篇相關論文、產業報告回傳「0 results」、專利資料庫回傳「Connection timeout」。設計對 coordinator 的錯誤傳播時，哪個做法能帶來最好的復原決策？","stem":"哪個做法能帶來最好的復原決策？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"把結果彙整成單一成功百分比指標（例如「67% source coverage」），詳細 log 可按需查看。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"把「timeout」與「0 results」都當成需要 coordinator 介入的失敗回報。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在內部 retry transient 失敗，只回報持續的錯誤。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"區分需要 retry 決策的存取失敗（timeout）與代表查詢成功的有效空結果（「0 results」）。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"Timeout（存取失敗）與「0 results」（有效的空結果）是語意不同的結果，需要不同的回應。區分它們讓 coordinator 能 retry 專利資料庫，同時把產業報告的「0 results」當成有效、有資訊量的發現接受。"},{"n":13,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"Production 監控顯示 synthesis 品質不一致。當彙整結果約 75K tokens 時，synthesis agent 能可靠引用前 15K tokens（web-search 標題 / 摘錄）與最後 10K tokens（document analysis 結論）的資訊，卻常漏掉中間 50K tokens 的關鍵發現，即使它們直接回答了研究問題。該如何重構彙整後的輸入？","stem":"該如何重構彙整後的輸入？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"在彙整前把所有 subagent 輸出摘要到 20K tokens 以下，讓內容落在模型可靠處理的範圍內。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"把 subagent 結果漸進式串流給 synthesis agent，先把 web-search 結果處理完，再加 document analysis 結果。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在彙整輸入的開頭放一份關鍵發現摘要，並用明確的章節標題組織詳細結果以利導覽。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"實作輪替，在不同研究任務中交替哪個 subagent 的結果排在前面，確保兩個來源長期下來都有均等的頂端位置。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"在開頭放關鍵發現摘要利用了 primacy 效應，讓關鍵資訊落在最可靠被處理的位置。加上明確的章節標題幫助模型導覽並關注中段內容，直接緩解「lost in the middle」現象。"},{"n":14,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"測試中，web-search agent（85K tokens，含網頁內容）與 document analysis agent（70K tokens，含思考鏈）的合併輸出共 155K tokens，但 synthesis agent 在輸入低於 50K tokens 時表現最好。哪個解法最有效？","stem":"哪個解法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"修改上游 agents，讓它們回傳結構化資料（關鍵事實、引文、相關性分數）而不是冗長的內容與推理。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"加一個中間的摘要 agent，在交給 synthesis 前濃縮發現。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"讓 synthesis agent 分批順序處理發現，在呼叫之間維持狀態。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"把發現存進 vector database，給 synthesis agent 搜尋 tools 在工作中查詢。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"修改上游 agents 回傳結構化資料，在來源端減少 token 量，同時保留關鍵資訊，修正了根本原因。它避免傳遞會膨脹 token、卻無助於 synthesis 步驟的大量網頁內容與推理軌跡。"},{"n":15,"scenario":"Multi-agent Research System","situation":"測試中，你觀察到 synthesis agent 在合併結果時常需要驗證特定主張。目前需要驗證時，synthesis agent 把控制權交回 coordinator，coordinator 呼叫 web-search agent，再帶結果重新呼叫 synthesis。這每個任務多了 2–3 次迴圈、延遲增加 40%。你的評估顯示 85% 的驗證是簡單事實查核（日期、名字、統計），15% 需要更深入的研究。哪個做法最能在維持系統可靠性的同時降低開銷？","stem":"哪個做法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"給 synthesis agent 所有 web-search tools 的存取權，讓它不經 coordinator 迴圈直接處理任何驗證需求。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"讓 synthesis agent 累積所有驗證需求，最後批次交回 coordinator，再一次全部送給 web-search agent。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"讓 web-search agent 在初始研究時主動快取每個來源周圍的額外 context，預期 synthesis 會需要驗證。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"給 synthesis agent 一個範圍受限的 <code>verify_fact</code> tool 做簡單檢查，複雜驗證則經 coordinator 路由到 web-search agent。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"範圍受限的事實驗證 tool 讓 synthesis agent 直接處理 85% 的簡單檢查，消除大多數迴圈，同時保留 coordinator 委派路徑處理 15% 的複雜驗證。這在大幅降低延遲的同時應用了最小權限原則。"},{"n":16,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"你的 CI pipeline 以 <code>--print</code> 模式執行 Claude Code CLI，用 CLAUDE.md 提供 code review 的專案 context，開發者普遍認為 review 有料。但他們回報把 findings 整合進工作流程很困難：Claude 輸出的是敘述性段落，得手動複製到 PR 留言。團隊想把每個 finding 自動貼成程式碼相關位置的獨立 inline PR comment，這需要含檔案路徑、行號、嚴重度與建議修法的結構化資料。哪個做法最有效？","stem":"哪個做法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"在 CLAUDE.md 加一節「Output Format for Review」，附結構化 finding 的範例，讓 Claude 從專案 context 學到預期格式。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"用 CLI 旗標 <code>--output-format json</code> 與 <code>--json-schema</code> 強制結構化 findings，再解析輸出透過 GitHub API 貼 inline comment。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"在 review prompt 中放明確的格式指令，要求每個 finding 遵循像 <code>[FILE:path] [LINE:n] [SEVERITY:level] ...</code> 的可解析模板。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"維持敘述性 review 格式，但加一個摘要步驟，用 Claude 產生 findings 的結構化 JSON 摘要。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"用 <code>--output-format json</code> 搭配 <code>--json-schema</code> 在 CLI 層級強制結構化輸出，保證含所需欄位（檔案路徑、行號、嚴重度、建議修法）的良構 JSON，可被可靠地解析並透過 GitHub API 貼成 inline PR comment。它利用了專為結構化輸出設計的內建 CLI 能力。"},{"n":17,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"團隊用 Claude Code 產生程式碼建議，但你注意到一個模式：非顯而易見的問題（會破壞邊界案例的效能優化、意外改變行為的清理）只有在另一位團隊成員 review PR 時才被抓到。Claude 在產生時的推理顯示它有考慮過這些案例，但結論是自己的做法正確。哪個做法直接處理了這個自我檢查限制的根本原因？","stem":"哪個做法直接處理了根本原因？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"用第二個獨立的 Claude Code instance review 變更，不讓它存取產生者的推理。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"在產生階段啟用 extended thinking 模式，讓它在產出建議前更徹底地思考。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在產生 prompt 加明確的自我 review 指令，要 Claude 在定稿前批評自己的建議。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 prompt context 中放完整的測試檔與文件，讓 Claude 在產生時更了解預期行為。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"第二個不能存取產生者推理的獨立 Claude Code instance 直接處理了根本原因：避免確認偏誤（confirmation bias）。這種「新鮮眼光」的觀點對應人類的 peer review，另一位 reviewer 會抓到作者自己合理化掉的問題。"},{"n":18,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"你的 code review 元件是迭代式的：Claude 分析變更的檔案，然後可能透過 tool 呼叫請求相關檔案（imports、base classes、tests）以理解 context，再給出最終回饋。你的應用定義了一個讓 Claude 請求檔案內容的 tool；Claude 呼叫 tool、拿到結果、繼續分析。你在評估用批次處理降低 API 成本。考慮批次處理這個 workflow 時，主要的技術限制是什麼？","stem":"主要的技術限制是什麼？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"批次處理沒有 correlation ID 可以把輸出對應回輸入請求。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"非同步模型無法在請求中途執行 tools 並回傳結果讓 Claude 繼續分析。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"Batch API 不支援在請求參數中放 tool 定義。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"批次處理最長 24 小時的延遲對 pull request 回饋太慢，但 workflow 其他部分可以運作。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"「射後不理（fire-and-forget）」的非同步 Batch API 模型沒有機制能在請求中攔截 tool 呼叫、執行 tool、再回傳結果讓 Claude 繼續分析。這與需要在單一邏輯互動中多回合 tool 請求 / 回應的迭代式 tool-calling workflow 根本上不相容。"},{"n":19,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"你的 CI/CD 系統跑三種 Claude 分析：(1) 每個 PR 都跑、完成前阻擋 merge 的快速風格檢查，(2) 每週對整個 codebase 的全面安全稽核，(3) 每晚對最近變更模組的測試案例產生。Message Batches API 省 50%，但處理最長 24 小時。你想在維持可接受的開發者體驗下優化 API 成本。哪個組合正確地把每個任務對應到 API 做法？","stem":"哪個組合正確？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"三個任務都用 Message Batches API 以最大化 50% 節省，設定 pipeline 輪詢批次完成。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"PR 風格檢查用同步呼叫；每週安全稽核與每晚測試產生用 Message Batches API。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"三個任務都用同步呼叫以維持一致的回應時間，依賴 prompt caching 降低各工作負載的成本。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"PR 風格檢查與每晚測試產生用同步呼叫；只有每週安全稽核用 Message Batches API。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"PR 風格檢查阻擋開發者，需要同步呼叫的即時回應；每週安全稽核與每晚測試產生是期限彈性的排程任務，可容忍最長 24 小時的批次窗口，兩者都能省 50%。"},{"n":20,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"你的自動化 review 找到真實問題，但開發者回報回饋不可執行。Findings 包含「complex ticket routing logic」或「potential null pointer」這類措辭，卻沒說到底該改什麼。當你加上「always include concrete fix suggestions」這類詳細指令時，模型仍產出不一致的輸出：有時詳細、有時模糊。哪個 prompting 技巧最能可靠地產出一致可執行的回饋？","stem":"哪個 prompting 技巧最可靠？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"進一步精煉指令，對回饋格式的每個部分（位置、問題、嚴重度、建議修法）給更明確的要求。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"擴大 context window 以納入更多周邊 codebase，讓模型有足夠資訊提出具體修法。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"實作兩階段做法：一個 prompt 找問題、第二個產生修法，讓各自專精。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"加 3–4 個 few-shot 範例展示確切要求的格式：找到的問題、程式碼位置、具體修法建議。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"當指令本身產生不穩定結果時，few-shot 範例是達成一致輸出格式最有效的技巧。提供 3–4 個展示確切結構（問題、位置、具體修法）的範例，給模型一個可遵循的具體模式，比抽象指令更可靠。"},{"n":21,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"你的 CI pipeline 有兩種 Claude code review 模式：一個 pre-merge-commit hook 在完成前阻擋 PR merge，另一個「deep analysis」在夜間執行、輪詢批次完成、再把詳細建議貼到 PR。你想用省 50% 但需要輪詢、最長 24 小時的 Message Batches API 降低 API 成本。哪個模式該用批次處理？","stem":"哪個模式該用批次處理？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"只有 pre-merge-commit hook。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"只有 deep analysis。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"兩個模式都用。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"兩個都不用。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"Deep analysis 是批次處理的理想候選，因為它本來就在夜間執行、能容忍延遲，而且在發布結果前用輪詢模型，正好對應 Message Batches API 非同步、輪詢式的架構，同時省下 50%。"},{"n":22,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"你的自動化 review 分析註解與 docstring。目前 prompt 指示 Claude「check that comments are accurate and up to date」。Findings 常標記可接受的模式（TODO 標記、簡單描述），卻漏掉描述程式碼已不再實作行為的註解。什麼改變能處理這種不一致分析的根本原因？","stem":"什麼改變能處理根本原因？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"提供 <code>git blame</code> 資料，讓 Claude 能辨識早於最近程式碼變更的註解。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"加誤導性註解的 few-shot 範例，幫模型辨識 codebase 中的類似模式。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在分析前過濾掉 TODO、FIXME 與描述性註解模式以減少雜訊。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"指定明確標準：只在註解宣稱的行為與程式碼實際行為矛盾時才標記。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"明確標準（只在宣稱行為與實際程式碼行為矛盾時標記）直接處理根本原因：用精確的問題定義取代模糊指令。這減少對可接受模式的誤報，也減少漏掉真正誤導性註解。"},{"n":23,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"你的自動化 code review 系統嚴重度評級不一致：類似的問題（如 null pointer 風險）在某些 PR 被評「critical」、在其他 PR 只有「medium」。開發者調查顯示不信任感增加：很多人開始不看就忽略 findings，因為「一半是錯的」。高誤報率的分類侵蝕了對準確分類的信任。哪個做法最能在改善系統的同時恢復開發者信任？","stem":"哪個做法最能恢復開發者信任？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"暫時停用高誤報率的分類（風格、命名、文件），只保留高精確度的分類，同時改善 prompt。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"保留所有分類，但在每個 finding 顯示信心分數，讓開發者決定要調查什麼。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"保留所有分類，並在接下來幾週加 few-shot 範例改善每個分類的準確率。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"對所有分類一致地降低嚴格度，把整體誤報率壓下來。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"暫時停用高誤報率的分類能立即停止信任的侵蝕，移除讓開發者忽略一切的雜訊 findings，同時保留安全與正確性等高精確度分類的價值。它也為在重新啟用前改善問題分類的 prompt 創造空間。"},{"n":24,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"你的自動化 review 為每個 PR 產生測試案例建議。Review 一個新增課程完成追蹤的 PR 時，Claude 建議了 10 個測試案例，但開發者回饋顯示其中 6 個重複了既有測試套件已涵蓋的情境。什麼改變最能有效減少重複建議？","stem":"什麼改變最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"把既有測試檔放進 context，讓 Claude 能判斷哪些情境已被涵蓋。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"把要求的建議數從 10 降到 5，假設 Claude 會優先提出最有價值的案例。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"加指令要 Claude 只專注於邊界案例與錯誤條件，而非成功路徑。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"實作後處理，用關鍵字重疊過濾掉描述與既有測試名稱相符的建議。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"放入既有測試檔修正了重複的根本原因：只有知道已有哪些測試，Claude 才能避免建議已涵蓋的情境。這給了 Claude 提出真正新穎、有價值測試所需的資訊。"},{"n":25,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"初始自動化 review 找出 12 個 findings 後，開發者推了新 commit 處理問題。重跑 review 產生 8 個 findings，但開發者回報其中 5 個重複了先前的評論，而那些程式碼已在新 commit 中修好。在維持徹底性的同時消除這種多餘回饋最有效的方式是？","stem":"消除多餘回饋最有效的方式是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"只在 PR 建立時與最終 pre-merge 狀態跑 review，跳過中間的 commit。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"加後處理過濾器，在貼留言前移除檔案路徑與問題描述與先前相符的 findings。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"把 review 範圍限制在最近一次 push 變更的檔案，排除較早 commit 的檔案。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"把先前的 review findings 放進 context，並指示 Claude 只回報新的或仍未解決的問題。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"把先前的 review findings 放進 context 讓 Claude 能區分新問題與已在最近 commit 處理的問題。這保留了 review 的徹底性，同時用 Claude 的推理避免對已修好的程式碼給多餘回饋。"},{"n":26,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"你的 pipeline 腳本執行 <code>claude \"Analyze this pull request for security issues\"</code>，但 job 無限期卡住。Log 顯示 Claude Code 在等待互動輸入。在自動化 pipeline 中執行 Claude Code 的正確做法是？","stem":"正確做法是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"加 <code>--batch</code> 旗標：<code>claude --batch \"Analyze this pull request for security issues\"</code>。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"加 <code>-p</code> 旗標：<code>claude -p \"Analyze this pull request for security issues\"</code>。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"把 stdin 重導到 <code>/dev/null</code>：<code>claude \"Analyze this pull request for security issues\" &lt; /dev/null</code>。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"執行命令前設定環境變數 <code>CLAUDE_HEADLESS=true</code>。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"<code>-p</code>（或 <code>--print</code>）旗標是文件記載的非互動執行方式。它處理 prompt、把結果印到 stdout，然後不等待使用者輸入就結束，最適合 CI/CD pipeline。"},{"n":27,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"一個 pull request 改了 inventory tracking 模組的 14 個檔案。一次分析所有檔案的單輪 review 結果不一致：某些檔案回饋詳細、某些浮淺、漏掉明顯 bug，還有矛盾的回饋（一個模式在某檔案被標記，同一 PR 另一檔案的相同程式碼卻被放行）。該如何重構 review？","stem":"該如何重構 review？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"獨立跑三次完整 PR review，只標記三次中至少兩次出現的問題。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"拆成聚焦的多輪：先逐檔 review 局部問題，再跑一輪獨立的整合導向檢查看跨檔資料流。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"要求開發者在跑自動化 review 前把大 PR 拆成 3–4 個檔案的小提交。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"換成 context window 更大的模型，讓它能在一輪中對 14 個檔案都投入足夠注意力。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"聚焦的逐檔 pass 處理了根本原因（注意力稀釋），確保一致的深度與可靠的局部問題偵測。獨立的整合導向 pass 再涵蓋跨檔的關注點，例如依賴與資料流的互動。"},{"n":28,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"你的自動化 code review 每個 pull request 平均 15 個 findings，開發者回報 40% 的誤報率。瓶頸在調查時間：開發者必須點進每個 finding 讀 Claude 的理由，才能決定要修還是忽略。你的 CLAUDE.md 已經有完整的可接受模式規則，而利害關係人拒絕任何在開發者看到前過濾 findings 的做法。什麼改變最能處理調查時間？","stem":"什麼改變最能處理調查時間？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"要求 Claude 在每個 finding 中直接附上理由與信心估計。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"加一個後處理器分析 finding 模式，自動壓掉符合歷史誤報特徵的 findings。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"把 findings 分成「blocking issues」與「suggestions」，各層級有不同的 review 要求。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"設定 Claude 只顯示高信心的 findings，在開發者看到前過濾掉不確定的標記。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"在每個 finding 直接附上理由與信心，讓開發者不必點開每個 finding 就能快速分流，減少調查時間。它滿足「不過濾」的限制，因為所有 findings 仍然可見，同時加速開發者的決策。"},{"n":29,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"分析你的自動化 code review 顯示不同 finding 分類的誤報率差異很大：安全 / 正確性 findings 8%、效能 findings 18%、風格 / 命名 findings 52%、文件 findings 48%。開發者調查顯示不信任感增加：很多人開始不看就忽略 findings，因為「一半是錯的」。高誤報率的分類侵蝕了對準確分類的信任。哪個做法最能在改善系統的同時恢復開發者信任？","stem":"哪個做法最能恢復開發者信任？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"暫時停用高誤報率的分類（風格、命名、文件），只保留高精確度的分類，同時改善 prompt。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"保留所有分類，但在每個 finding 顯示信心分數，讓開發者決定要調查什麼。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"保留所有分類，並在接下來幾週加 few-shot 範例改善每個分類的準確率。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"對所有分類一致地降低嚴格度，把整體誤報率壓下來。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"暫時停用高誤報率的分類能立即停止信任的侵蝕，移除讓開發者忽略一切的雜訊 findings，同時保留安全與正確性等高精確度分類的價值。它也為在重新啟用前改善問題分類的 prompt 創造空間。"},{"n":30,"scenario":"Claude Code for Continuous Integration","situation":"團隊想降低自動化分析的 API 成本。目前同步的 Claude 呼叫支撐兩個 workflow：(1) 開發者 merge 前必須完成的阻塞式 pre-merge 檢查，(2) 夜間產生、隔天早上檢視的技術債報告。主管提議把兩者都移到 Message Batches API 省 50%。你該如何評估這個提案？","stem":"你該如何評估這個提案？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"兩者都移到批次處理，批次太久就 fallback 到同步呼叫。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"兩個 workflow 都移到批次處理，用狀態輪詢確認完成。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"只把技術債報告用批次處理；pre-merge 檢查維持同步呼叫。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"兩個 workflow 都維持同步呼叫，避免批次結果排序的問題。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"Message Batches API 處理最長 24 小時、沒有延遲 SLA，這對夜間技術債報告可接受，但對開發者在等的阻塞式 pre-merge 檢查不可接受。這依延遲需求把每個 workflow 對應到正確的 API。"},{"n":31,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"你請 Claude Code 實作一個把 API 回應轉成內部正規化格式的函式。兩次迭代後，輸出結構仍不符預期：某些欄位巢狀方式不同、timestamp 格式錯誤。你用散文描述需求，但 Claude 每次解讀都不一樣。","stem":"下一次迭代哪個做法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"寫一份描述預期輸出結構的 JSON schema，每次迭代後用它驗證 Claude 的輸出。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"提供 2–3 個具體的輸入–輸出範例，展示代表性 API 回應的預期轉換。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"用更精確的技術語言重寫需求，明確指定欄位對應、巢狀規則與 timestamp 格式字串。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"請 Claude 解釋它目前對需求的理解，找出解讀分歧的地方。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"具體的輸入–輸出範例透過直接展示預期的轉換結果，消除了散文描述固有的歧義。這直接處理了根本原因（對文字需求的誤解），為欄位巢狀與 timestamp 格式提供毫無歧義的模式。"},{"n":32,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"你需要新增 Slack 作為通知管道。既有 codebase 對 email、SMS 與 push 管道有清楚、成熟的模式。但 Slack 的 API 提供根本不同的整合方式：incoming webhooks（簡單、單向）、bot tokens（支援送達確認與程式化控制）、Slack Apps（雙向事件、需要 workspace 核准）。你的任務只說「add Slack support」，沒指定整合方式，也沒要求送達追蹤等進階功能。","stem":"該如何處理這個任務？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"用 incoming webhooks 直接在執行模式開始，對應既有的單向通知模式。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"切到 planning mode 探索整合選項與架構影響，在實作前提出建議。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"直接在執行模式開始，用既有模式建 Slack channel class 的骨架，延後整合方式的決定。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"用 bot-token 做法直接在執行模式開始，確保送達確認可行。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"Slack 整合有多個合理做法，架構影響差異顯著，而需求模糊。Planning mode 讓你能評估 webhooks、bot tokens 與 Slack Apps 之間的取捨，在實作前先對齊做法。"},{"n":33,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"你的 CLAUDE.md 已長到 400+ 行，包含 coding standards、測試慣例、詳細的 PR review checklist、部署指令與資料庫 migration 程序。你希望 Claude 永遠遵守 coding standards 與測試慣例，但只在做那些任務時才套用 PR review、部署與 migration 的指引。","stem":"哪個重構做法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"把所有指引移到依 workflow 類型組織的獨立 Skills 檔案，CLAUDE.md 只留簡短的專案描述。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"全部留在 CLAUDE.md，但用 <code>@import</code> 語法組織成依類別分開維護的檔案。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"把 CLAUDE.md 拆成 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 下帶路徑綁定 glob pattern 的檔案，每條規則只為相關檔案類型載入。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"通用標準留在 CLAUDE.md，為 workflow 專屬的指引（PR review、部署、migration）建立帶觸發關鍵字的 Skills。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"CLAUDE.md 的內容在每個 session 都載入，確保 coding standards 與測試慣例永遠適用；Skills 則在 Claude 偵測到觸發關鍵字時按需呼叫，最適合 PR review、部署與 migration 等 workflow 專屬指引。"},{"n":34,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"你負責把團隊的 monolith 應用重構成 microservices。這會影響幾十個檔案的變更，需要對服務邊界與模組依賴做決策。","stem":"該選哪個做法？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"切到 planning mode 探索 codebase、理解依賴，並在修改前設計實作做法。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"直接在執行模式開始，實作中遇到意外複雜度才切到 planning。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"直接在執行模式開始做漸進式修改，讓實作揭露自然的服務邊界。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"直接執行，事先給指定每個服務結構的詳細指令。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"Planning mode 是拆 monolith 這類複雜架構重構的正確策略：它允許在對許多檔案做出可能很昂貴的變更前，安全探索並對邊界做出有依據的決策。"},{"n":35,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"團隊建了一個 <code>/analyze-codebase</code> skill 做深度程式碼分析：依賴掃描、測試覆蓋計數與程式碼品質指標。執行後，團隊成員回報 Claude 在該 session 變得比較不靈敏，還會忘記原本任務的 context。","stem":"如何在保留完整分析能力的同時最有效地修正？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"在 skill frontmatter 加 <code>context: fork</code>，在隔離的 subagent context 中執行分析。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"在 frontmatter 加 <code>model: haiku</code>，用更快更便宜的模型做分析。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"把 skill 拆成三個較小的 skills，各自產生較少輸出。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 skill 加指令，顯示前把所有結果壓成簡短摘要。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"<code>context: fork</code> 在隔離的 subagent context 中執行分析，大量輸出不會污染主 session 的 context window，Claude 也不會忘記原本任務。它保留完整分析能力，同時讓主 session 保持靈敏。"},{"n":36,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"團隊在 <code>.claude/skills/commit/SKILL.md</code> 用一個 <code>/commit</code> skill。一位開發者想為自己的個人工作流程客製它（不同的 commit message 格式、額外檢查），又不影響隊友。","stem":"你會建議什麼？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"在 <code>~/.claude/skills/</code> 下用不同名稱建立個人版本，例如 <code>/my-commit</code>。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"在專案 skill frontmatter 加依使用者名稱的條件邏輯。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在 <code>~/.claude/skills/commit/SKILL.md</code> 建立同名的個人版本。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在個人 skill frontmatter 設 <code>override: true</code>，讓它優先於專案版本。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"同名的個人 skill 會優先於專案 skill，所以沿用 <code>commit</code> 這個名字會讓這位開發者默默遮蔽（shadow）團隊的 skill：團隊改善 <code>/commit</code> 時他收不到更新，還得記住自己跑的是同名的不同 skill。把個人變體命名為 <code>/my-commit</code> 完全避開衝突：開發者繼續使用團隊維護的 <code>/commit</code>，同時有一個名稱清楚的個人 skill，不會混淆也不會漏掉團隊更新。"},{"n":37,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"團隊用 Claude Code 好幾個月了。最近三位開發者回報 Claude 遵守「always include comprehensive error handling」這條指引，但剛加入的第四位開發者說 Claude 不遵守。四人在同一個 repo 工作，程式碼都是最新的。","stem":"最可能的原因與修法是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"指引在原本三位開發者的 user-level <code>~/.claude/CLAUDE.md</code> 裡，不在專案的 <code>.claude/CLAUDE.md</code>。把指令移到 project-level 檔案，所有團隊成員都會收到。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"新開發者的 <code>~/.claude/CLAUDE.md</code> 有衝突的指令覆蓋了專案設定；他們應該刪掉衝突的段落。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"Claude Code 會隨時間學習每位使用者的偏好；新開發者必須重複這個要求直到 Claude「記住」。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"Claude Code 第一次讀取後會快取 CLAUDE.md；原本的開發者用的是快取版本。所有人都應該清除 Claude Code 快取。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"如果指引只加在原本開發者的 user-level 設定，而沒放進 project-level 的 <code>.claude/CLAUDE.md</code>，新成員就收不到。移到 project-level 設定確保現在與未來的所有團隊成員自動收到這條指引。"},{"n":38,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"你發現把 2–3 個完整的 endpoint 實作範例當 context，能顯著提升產生新 API endpoint 的一致性。但這個 context 只在建立新 endpoint 時有用，在 API 目錄裡除錯、review 程式碼或做其他工作時沒用。","stem":"哪個設定做法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"把 endpoint 範例與模式文件加進專案 CLAUDE.md，讓它們永遠可用。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"每次產生請求都手動引用 endpoint 範例，把程式碼複製進 prompt。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在 <code>.claude/rules/api/</code> 設定路徑專屬規則，包含 endpoint 範例，在 API 目錄工作時啟用。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"建一個引用 endpoint 範例、包含遵循模式指令的 skill，透過 slash command 按需呼叫。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"按需呼叫的 skill 只在產生新 endpoint 時載入範例 context，除錯或 review 等無關任務時不會。這讓主 context 保持乾淨，同時在需要時保留高品質的產生。"},{"n":39,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"團隊建了一個產生資料庫 migration 檔的 <code>/migration</code> skill。它透過 <code>$ARGUMENTS</code> 接收 migration 名稱。Production 中你觀察到三個問題：(1) 開發者常不帶參數執行 skill，導致檔名很差，(2) skill 有時會用到無關的先前對話中的資料庫 schema 細節，(3) 一位開發者在 skill 有廣泛 tool 存取權時意外執行了破壞性的測試清理。","stem":"哪個設定做法能修正全部三個問題？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"用位置參數 <code>$1</code> 與 <code>$2</code> 取代 <code>$ARGUMENTS</code> 以強制特定輸入，用 <code>@</code> 語法明確引用 schema 檔以控制 context，並在 frontmatter description 加破壞性操作的警告。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"在 frontmatter 加 <code>argument-hint</code> 要求必要參數，用 <code>context: fork</code> 隔離執行，並把 <code>allowed-tools</code> 限制在檔案寫入操作。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"拆成 <code>/migration-create</code> 與 <code>/migration-apply</code> 兩個 skills，加驗證指令在缺名稱時要求輸入，並為各自使用不同的 <code>allowed-tools</code> 範圍。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 skill 的 SKILL.md 加驗證指令確保 <code>$ARGUMENTS</code> 是有效名稱，加 prompt 要它忽略先前對話 context，並列出要避免的禁止操作。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"這用三個獨立的設定功能分別處理每個問題：<code>argument-hint</code> 改善參數輸入、減少缺參數的情況，<code>context: fork</code> 防止先前對話的 context 洩漏，<code>allowed-tools</code> 把 skill 限制在安全的檔案寫入操作，防止破壞性動作。"},{"n":40,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"你的 codebase 有不同 coding 慣例的區域：React components 用帶 hooks 的函式式風格、API handlers 用 async/await 搭配特定錯誤處理、資料庫 models 遵循 repository pattern。測試檔散布在 codebase 各處、與受測程式碼相鄰（例如 <code>Button.test.tsx</code> 在 <code>Button.tsx</code> 旁），你希望所有測試不論位置都遵循相同慣例。","stem":"確保 Claude 產生程式碼時自動套用正確慣例，最受支援的方式是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"把所有慣例放在根目錄 CLAUDE.md、各區域用標題分開，依賴 Claude 推斷哪一節適用。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"在 <code>.claude/skills/</code> 為每種程式碼類型建 skills，把慣例嵌在各 SKILL.md。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在每個子目錄放一份包含該區域慣例的獨立 CLAUDE.md。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 建立帶 YAML frontmatter 指定 glob pattern 的規則檔，依檔案路徑條件式套用慣例。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"帶 YAML frontmatter 與 glob pattern（例如 <code>**/*.test.tsx</code>、<code>src/api/**/*.ts</code>）的 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 檔案能不受目錄結構限制、依路徑確定性地套用慣例。這是散布各處的測試檔這類橫切模式最受支援的做法。"},{"n":41,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"你想建立一個自訂 slash command <code>/review</code>，執行團隊的標準 code review checklist。它應該在每位開發者 clone 或更新 repo 時就可用。","stem":"Command 檔案該建在哪裡？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"每位開發者 home 目錄的 <code>~/.claude/commands/</code>。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"專案 repo 的 <code>.claude/commands/</code>。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"<code>.claude/config.json</code> 裡的 commands 陣列。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"專案根目錄的 CLAUDE.md。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"把自訂 slash commands 放在專案 repo 的 <code>.claude/commands/</code>，確保它們受版本控制，並自動對每位 clone 或更新 repo 的開發者可用。這是 Claude Code 中 project-level 自訂 commands 的預定位置。"},{"n":42,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"團隊的 CLAUDE.md 長到超過 500 行，混雜 TypeScript 慣例、測試指引、API 模式與部署程序。開發者覺得很難找到並更新正確的段落。","stem":"Claude Code 支援用什麼做法把 project-level 指令組織成聚焦的主題模組？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"定義一個 <code>.claude/config.yaml</code> 對應檔，把檔案 pattern 對應到 CLAUDE.md 內的特定段落。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"在 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 建立獨立的 Markdown 檔，每個涵蓋一個主題（例如 <code>testing.md</code>、<code>api-conventions.md</code>）。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"把指令拆成相關子目錄的 README.md 檔，Claude 會自動載入為指令。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在目錄樹不同層級建立多個名為 CLAUDE.md 的檔案，各自覆蓋父層指令。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"Claude Code 支援 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 目錄，你可以為主題式指引建立獨立的 Markdown 檔（例如 <code>testing.md</code>、<code>api-conventions.md</code>），讓團隊把大型指令集組織成聚焦、可維護的模組。"},{"n":43,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"你建了一個自訂 skill <code>/explore-alternatives</code>，團隊用它在選定方案前腦力激盪並評估實作做法。開發者回報執行 skill 後，Claude 後續的回應會受替代方案討論影響：有時引用被否決的做法，或保留干擾實際實作的探索 context。","stem":"該如何最有效地設定這個 skill？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"在 skill 中用 <code>!</code> 前綴把探索邏輯當 bash 子程序執行。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"在 skill frontmatter 加 <code>context: fork</code>。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"拆成兩個 skills（<code>/explore-start</code> 與 <code>/explore-end</code>）標記探索 context 該被丟棄的邊界。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"把 skill 建在 <code>~/.claude/skills/</code> 而不是 <code>.claude/skills/</code>。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"<code>context: fork</code> 在隔離的 subagent context 中執行 skill，探索討論不會污染主對話歷史。這防止被否決的做法與腦力激盪 context 影響後續的實作工作。"},{"n":44,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"團隊想加一個 GitHub MCP server，透過 Claude Code 搜尋 PR 與查 CI 狀態。六位開發者各有自己的個人 GitHub access token。你想在不把憑證 commit 進版本控制的前提下，讓團隊有一致的工具。","stem":"哪個設定做法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"讓每位開發者用 <code>claude mcp add --scope user</code> 在 user scope 加 server。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"建一個 MCP server wrapper，從 <code>.env</code> 檔讀 token 並代理 GitHub API 呼叫，再把 wrapper 加進專案 <code>.mcp.json</code>。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"把 server 加進專案 <code>.mcp.json</code>，用環境變數替換（<code>${GITHUB_TOKEN}</code>）做認證，並在專案 README 記錄需要的環境變數。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"在 project scope 用佔位 token 設定 server，再告訴開發者在本機設定覆蓋它。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"帶環境變數替換的專案 <code>.mcp.json</code> 是慣用做法：它為 MCP 設定提供單一受版本控制的真實來源，同時讓每位開發者透過環境變數提供憑證。記錄該變數讓 onboarding 容易，又不會 commit 密鑰。"},{"n":45,"scenario":"Code Generation with Claude Code","situation":"你要在一個 120 個檔案的 codebase 中，為外部 API 呼叫加上錯誤處理 wrapper。工作分三階段：(1) 找出所有呼叫點與模式，(2) 協作設計錯誤處理做法，(3) 一致地實作 wrapper。在階段 1，Claude 產生大量輸出列出數百個帶 context 的呼叫點，在探索完成前就快速填滿 context window。","stem":"哪個做法最能在維持實作一致性的同時完成任務？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"階段 1 用 Explore subagent 隔離冗長的探索輸出並回傳摘要，然後在主對話繼續階段 2–3。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"所有階段都在主對話進行，處理檔案時定期用 <code>/compact</code> 降低 context 用量。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"切到 headless 模式搭配 <code>--continue</code>，在批次呼叫之間傳遞明確的 context 摘要以維持連續性。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 CLAUDE.md 定義錯誤處理模式，然後跨多個 session 分批處理檔案，依賴共用的記憶檔維持一致性。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"Explore subagent 把冗長的探索輸出隔離在獨立 context 中，只回傳簡潔摘要給主對話。這為協作設計與一致實作階段保留了主 context window，而那正是保留 context 最有價值的地方。"},{"n":46,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"測試時你注意到，使用者問訂單狀態時 agent 常呼叫 <code>get_customer</code>，儘管 <code>lookup_order</code> 更合適。要處理這個問題，你該先檢查什麼？","stem":"該先檢查什麼？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"實作前處理分類器偵測訂單相關請求，直接路由到 <code>lookup_order</code>。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"減少 agent 可用的 tools 數量以簡化選擇。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在 system prompt 加涵蓋所有可能訂單請求模式的 few-shot 範例以改善 tool 選擇。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"檢查 tool descriptions，確保它們清楚區分每個 tool 的用途。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"Tool descriptions 是模型決定呼叫哪個 tool 的主要輸入。當 agent 持續選錯 tool 時，第一個診斷步驟是確認 tool descriptions 清楚地區分了每個 tool 的用途與使用邊界。"},{"n":47,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"你的 agent 處理單一問題請求的準確率是 94%（例如「I need a refund for order #1234」）。但當客戶在一則訊息中包含多個問題時（例如「I need a refund for order #1234 and also want to update the shipping address for order #5678」），tool 選擇準確率掉到 58%。Agent 通常只解決一個問題，或把參數在請求之間搞混。哪個做法最能有效提升多問題請求的可靠性？","stem":"哪個做法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"實作一個前處理層，用獨立的模型呼叫把多問題訊息分解成獨立請求、各自獨立處理、再合併結果。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"把相關的 tools 合併成較少的通用 tools。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在 prompt 加 few-shot 範例，示範多問題請求的正確推理與 tool 順序。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"實作回應驗證偵測不完整的答案，自動重新 prompt agent 解決漏掉的問題。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"示範多問題請求正確推理與 tool 順序的 few-shot 範例最有效，因為 agent 在單一問題上已經表現良好，它需要的是分解與路由多個問題、並把參數分開的模式引導。"},{"n":48,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"Production log 顯示，像「refund for order #1234」的簡單請求，agent 用 3–4 次 tool 呼叫就解決、成功率 91%。但像「I was billed twice, my discount didn't apply, and I want to cancel」的複雜請求，agent 平均 12+ 次 tool 呼叫、成功率只有 54%，常常順序地調查問題、並為每個問題重複抓取客戶資料。什麼改變最能有效改善複雜請求的處理？","stem":"什麼改變最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"在階段之間加明確的驗證檢查點，要求 agent 每解決一個問題就記錄進度再進到下一個。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"把 <code>get_customer</code>、<code>lookup_order</code> 與帳單相關 tools 合併成單一 <code>investigate_issue</code> tool 以減少 tools 數量。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"把請求分解成獨立問題，然後用共享的客戶 context 平行調查每一個，再綜合成最終解決方案。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"在 system prompt 加 few-shot 範例，示範各種多面向帳單情境的理想 tool 呼叫順序。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"分解成獨立問題並用共享客戶 context 平行調查，同時修正了兩個關鍵問題：透過跨問題重用共享 context 消除重複的資料抓取，並在綜合單一解決方案前平行化調查，減少總 tool 呼叫迴圈。"},{"n":49,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"你的 agent 首次接觸解決率 55%，遠低於 80% 的目標。Log 顯示它會 escalate 簡單案件（有照片證明的損壞商品標準換貨），卻試圖自主處理需要政策例外的複雜情況。改善 escalation 校準最有效的方式是？","stem":"改善 escalation 校準最有效的方式是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"要求 agent 在每次回應前自評 1–10 的信心，信心低於門檻時自動轉給人工。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"部署一個用歷史工單訓練的獨立分類器模型，在主 agent 開始處理前預測哪些請求需要 escalation。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在 system prompt 加明確的 escalation 標準，附 few-shot 範例展示何時 escalate、何時自主解決。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"實作情緒分析判斷客戶的挫折程度，超過負面情緒門檻時自動 escalate。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"帶 few-shot 範例的明確 escalation 標準直接處理了根本原因：簡單與複雜案件之間不清楚的決策邊界。這是最相稱、最有效的第一步介入，教 agent 何時 escalate、何時自主解決，不需要額外的基礎設施。"},{"n":50,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"呼叫 <code>get_customer</code> 與 <code>lookup_order</code> 之後，agent 已擁有所有可用的系統資料，但仍面臨不確定性。哪個情況最有理由呼叫 <code>escalate_to_human</code>？","stem":"哪個情況最有理由 escalate？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"客戶想取消一個昨天出貨、明天送達的訂單。Agent 應該 escalate，因為客戶收到包裹後可能改變心意。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"客戶聲稱沒收到訂單，但追蹤顯示三天前已送達並在其住址簽收。Agent 應該 escalate，因為提出矛盾證據可能傷害客戶關係。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"客戶要求競品價格比對。你的政策允許自家網站 14 天內降價的價格調整，但完全沒提到競品價格。Agent 應該 escalate 以取得政策解釋。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"客戶訊息同時包含帳單問題與商品退貨。Agent 應該 escalate，讓人工在一次互動中協調兩個問題。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"這是真正的政策空缺：公司規則涵蓋自家網站的降價，但沒處理競品價格比對。Agent 不能自創政策，應該 escalate 讓人工判斷如何解釋或延伸既有規則。"},{"n":51,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"Production log 顯示 12% 的案例中，agent 跳過 <code>get_customer</code>，只用客戶提供的名字直接呼叫 <code>lookup_order</code>，有時導致帳號誤判與錯誤退款。什麼改變最能有效修正這個可靠性問題？","stem":"什麼改變最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"加 few-shot 範例展示 agent 永遠先呼叫 <code>get_customer</code>，即使客戶主動提供訂單細節。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"實作路由分類器分析每個請求，只啟用適合該請求類型的 tools 子集。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"加程式化的前置條件，在 <code>get_customer</code> 回傳已驗證的客戶識別碼前封鎖 <code>lookup_order</code> 與 <code>process_refund</code>。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"強化 system prompt，聲明任何訂單操作前透過 <code>get_customer</code> 驗證客戶是強制的。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"程式化的前置條件提供確定性保證，確保必要的順序被遵守。這是最有效的做法，因為不論 LLM 行為如何，它都消除了跳過驗證的可能性。"},{"n":52,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"Production 指標顯示，處理複雜帳單爭議或多訂單退貨時，即使解決方案技術上正確，客戶滿意度仍比簡單案件低 15%。根因分析顯示 agent 給出準確的解法，但解釋理由不一致：有時省略相關政策細節，有時漏掉時程資訊或下一步。具體的 context 缺口因案而異。你想在不增加人工監督的前提下改善解法品質。哪個做法最有效？","stem":"哪個做法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"加一個 self-critique 階段，agent 評估草稿回應的完整性：確保它解決了客戶的問題、包含相關 context、並預先回答後續問題。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"加一個確認階段，agent 在結案前問「Does this fully resolve your issue?」，讓客戶能要求更多資訊。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"複雜案件把模型從 Haiku 升級到 Sonnet，依定義的複雜度指標路由。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 system prompt 實作 few-shot 範例，展示五種常見複雜案件類型的完整解釋，示範如何包含政策 context、時程與下一步。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"Self-critique 階段（evaluator-optimizer 模式）直接處理解釋完整性不一致的問題，強迫 agent 在呈現前依具體標準（政策 context、時程、下一步）評估自己的草稿。這能在沒有人工監督下抓到因案而異的缺口。"},{"n":53,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"Production 指標顯示你的 agent 每次解決平均 4+ 次 API 迴圈。分析顯示 Claude 常在分開的順序回合請求 <code>get_customer</code> 與 <code>lookup_order</code>，即使一開始就兩者都需要。減少迴圈數最有效的方式是？","stem":"減少迴圈最有效的方式是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"實作推測性執行，與任何被請求的 tool 平行地自動呼叫可能需要的 tools，不論請求了什麼都回傳所有結果。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"提高 <code>max_tokens</code>，給 Claude 更多空間規劃並自然地合併 tool 請求。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"建立像 <code>get_customer_with_orders</code> 的複合 tools，把常見的查詢組合綑成單一呼叫。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 prompt 指示 Claude 把 tool 請求綑成一個回合，在下一次 API 呼叫前一起回傳所有結果。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"用 prompt 要 Claude 把相關 tool 請求綑成單一回合，利用了它一次請求多個 tools 的原生能力。這以最小的架構變動直接修正順序呼叫的模式。"},{"n":54,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"Production log 顯示一個模式：客戶引用特定金額（例如「the 15% discount I mentioned」），但 agent 回應了錯誤的值。調查顯示這些細節在 20+ 回合前提過，被濃縮成像「promotional pricing was discussed」的模糊摘要。哪個修法最有效？","stem":"哪個修法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"把摘要門檻從 70% 提高到 85%，讓對話在觸發摘要前有更多空間。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"把完整對話歷史存在外部儲存，agent 偵測到「as I mentioned」等引用時實作檢索。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"把交易事實（金額、日期、訂單編號）抽到一個持久的「case facts」區塊，放在摘要歷史之外、每個 prompt 都包含。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"修改摘要 prompt，明確要求逐字保留所有數字、百分比、日期與客戶陳述的期望。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"摘要本質上會丟失精確細節。把交易事實抽到摘要歷史之外的結構化「case facts」區塊，保留了關鍵資訊，讓它不論已摘要多少回合，都能在每個 prompt 中可靠取得。"},{"n":55,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"你的 <code>get_customer</code> tool 依名字搜尋時回傳所有符合的結果。目前有多筆結果時，Claude 會挑最近有訂單的客戶，但 production 資料顯示對於模糊的比對，這有 15% 選到錯的帳號。該如何處理？","stem":"該如何處理？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"實作信心評分系統，信心高於 85% 時自主行動、低於門檻時要求釐清。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"指示 Claude 在 <code>get_customer</code> 回傳多筆結果時，採取任何客戶專屬動作前先要求額外的識別資訊（email、電話或訂單編號）。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"修改 <code>get_customer</code>，依排名演算法只回傳單一最可能的結果，消除歧義。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 prompt 加 few-shot 範例，示範模糊比對的正確推理與 tool 順序。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"向使用者要額外的識別資訊是解決歧義最可靠的方式，因為使用者對自己的身分有確切的知識。多一個對話回合是很小的代價，卻能消除因選錯帳號造成的 15% 錯誤率。"},{"n":56,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"Production log 顯示一個一致的模式：當客戶訊息包含「account」這個詞（例如「I want to check my account for an order I made yesterday」），agent 有 78% 先呼叫 <code>get_customer</code>。當客戶用不含「account」的類似說法（例如「I want to check an order I made yesterday」），它有 93% 先呼叫 <code>lookup_order</code>。Tool descriptions 清楚且無歧義。這個差異最可能的根本原因是？","stem":"最可能的根本原因是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"System prompt 包含對「account」等詞敏感的關鍵字式指令，造成非預期的 tool 選擇模式。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"模型的基礎訓練在「account」術語與客戶相關操作之間建立了凌駕 tool descriptions 的關聯。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"模型需要更多多概念訊息的訓練資料，應該用同時含 account 與 order 術語的範例做 fine-tune。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"Tool descriptions 需要額外的負面範例，指定何時不該用每個 tool，以防止這種關鍵字引起的混淆。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"系統性的關鍵字驅動模式（78% vs 93%）強烈顯示 system prompt 中有對「account」反應、把 agent 導向客戶相關 tools 的明確路由邏輯。既然 tool descriptions 已經清楚，這個差異指向 prompt 層級的指令造成了非預期的行為引導。"},{"n":57,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"Production log 顯示，使用者問訂單時（例如「check my order #12345」），agent 常呼叫 <code>get_customer</code> 而不是 <code>lookup_order</code>。兩個 tools 的描述都很精簡（「Gets customer information」/「Gets order details」），且接受看起來相似的識別碼格式。改善 tool 選擇可靠性最有效的第一步是？","stem":"最有效的第一步是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"實作路由層，在每回合前分析使用者輸入，依偵測到的關鍵字與 ID 模式預選正確的 tool。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"把兩個 tools 合併成單一 <code>lookup_entity</code>，接受任何識別碼並在內部決定查哪個後端。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在 system prompt 加 few-shot 範例示範正確的 tool 選擇模式，用 5–8 個範例把訂單相關查詢路由到 <code>lookup_order</code>。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"擴充每個 tool 的描述，加入輸入格式、範例查詢、邊界案例，以及說明何時該用它而非相似 tools 的邊界。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"用輸入格式、範例查詢、邊界案例與清楚的邊界擴充 tool descriptions，直接修正了根本原因：精簡的描述沒給 LLM 足夠資訊區分相似的 tools。這是低成本、高影響的第一步，改善了 LLM 選擇 tool 的主要機制。"},{"n":58,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"你在為客服 agent 實作 agent loop。每次 Claude API 呼叫後，你必須決定是繼續迴圈（執行請求的 tools 並再呼叫 Claude）還是停止（把最終答案呈現給客戶）。什麼決定這個判斷？","stem":"什麼決定這個判斷？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"檢查 Claude 回應中的 <code>stop_reason</code> 欄位：是 <code>tool_use</code> 就繼續、是 <code>end_turn</code> 就停止。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"解析 Claude 的文字找像「I'm done」或「Can I help with anything else?」的句子，自然語言訊號代表任務完成。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"設定最大迭代數（例如 10 次呼叫），達到就停止，不論 Claude 是否表示還有工作。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"檢查回應是否含 assistant 文字內容，若 Claude 產生了說明文字，迴圈就該終止。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"<code>stop_reason</code> 是 Claude 用於迴圈控制的明確結構化訊號：<code>tool_use</code> 表示 Claude 想執行 tool 並取回結果，<code>end_turn</code> 表示 Claude 已完成回應、迴圈該結束。"},{"n":59,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"Production log 顯示 agent 誤解你的 MCP tools 的輸出：<code>get_customer</code> 的 Unix timestamp、<code>lookup_order</code> 的 ISO 8601 日期，以及數字狀態碼（1=pending、2=shipped）。有些 tools 是你無法修改的第三方 MCP servers。哪種資料格式正規化的做法最好維護？","stem":"哪種做法最好維護？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"用 PostToolUse hook 攔截 tool 輸出，在 agent 處理前套用格式轉換。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"修改你控制的 tools 回傳人類可讀的格式，並為第三方 tools 建 wrapper。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"建一個 <code>normalize_data</code> tool，agent 在每次取資料後呼叫它轉換值。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 system prompt 加詳細的格式文件，說明每個 tool 的資料慣例。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"PostToolUse hook 提供一個集中、確定性的攔截點，在 agent 處理前正規化所有 tool 輸出，包含第三方 MCP server 的資料。它更好維護，因為轉換寫在程式碼裡、一致地套用，而不是依賴 LLM 的解讀。"},{"n":60,"scenario":"Customer Support Agent","situation":"Production log 顯示 agent 有時在 <code>lookup_order</code> 更合適時選了 <code>get_customer</code>，特別是像「I need help with my recent purchase」這類模糊的查詢。你決定在 system prompt 加 few-shot 範例改善 tool 選擇。哪個做法最能有效處理這個問題？","stem":"哪個做法最有效？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"在每個 tool description 加涵蓋模糊案例的明確「use when」與「don't use when」指引。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"依 tool 分組加範例：所有 <code>get_customer</code> 情境放一起，再放所有 <code>lookup_order</code> 情境。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"加 4–6 個針對模糊情境的範例，每個附上為什麼選這個 tool 而非其他合理選項的理由。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"加 10–15 個清楚、無歧義請求的範例，示範每個 tool 典型情境的正確選擇。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"把 few-shot 範例瞄準錯誤發生的特定模糊情境，並明確說明為何一個 tool 比其他選項更合適，能教模型邊界案例所需的比較式決策過程。這比泛用的範例或宣告式規則更有效。"},{"n":61,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"你的 <code>remove_team_member</code> tool 用 <code>dry_run: boolean</code> 參數在執行前預覽影響。Production 監控顯示 agent 直接用 <code>dry_run=false</code> 呼叫，跳過預覽步驟。你需要確保每次移除前都有一次使用者明確確認的預覽。","stem":"最可靠的做法是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"加 server-side 驗證，只在過去 60 秒內有一次參數相同的 <code>dry_run=true</code> 呼叫時才允許 <code>dry_run=false</code>。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"把 tool 標註為需要確認，並設定 orchestration 層在轉送任何呼叫給已標註的 tools 前先提示使用者核准。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在 tool description 加詳細指令與 few-shot 範例，要求 agent 永遠先用 <code>dry_run=true</code> 呼叫、等使用者確認後再呼叫一次。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"換成兩個 tools：<code>preview_remove_member</code> 回傳影響細節與一次性的確認 token；<code>execute_remove_member</code> 需要該 token，把執行綁定到預覽。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"兩個 tool 加 token 綁定的做法讓「沒有先預覽就執行」在架構上不可能：execute tool 確實需要一個只有 preview tool 能產生的 token。這是唯一在程式碼層級強制限制的做法，而不是依賴 LLM 遵守指令（C）、時間啟發式（A）或 orchestration 基礎設施（B）。"},{"n":62,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"Production 監控顯示你的 <code>search_catalog</code> tool 有 12% 的失敗率：8% 是重試就會成功的網路 timeout，4% 是不論重試多少次都不會成功的查詢語法錯誤。目前兩種錯誤以相同方式回傳，造成浪費的重試。","stem":"該如何修改 tool 的錯誤處理？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"在 system prompt 加 few-shot 範例，示範如何區分網路錯誤與語法錯誤。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"對所有錯誤一致地套用 exponential backoff 重試邏輯。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在 tool 內部對網路 timeout 實作帶 backoff 的自動重試；語法錯誤立即回傳並附參數驗證細節。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"所有錯誤都回傳帶 <code>retryable</code> boolean 旗標與錯誤類型細節。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"在 tool 層級處理 transient 錯誤的重試是正確的抽象邊界：tool 對錯誤類型有確切的知識，能實作確定性的重試邏輯，不必依賴 agent 解讀旗標（D）或遵守 prompt 層級的指令（A）。一致的 backoff（B）在永遠不會成功的語法錯誤上浪費時間。"},{"n":63,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"討論投資策略的幾個回合中，使用者說過「I have a very low risk tolerance」，後來又說「I want to maximize my returns」。現在他們問：「What should I invest in?」","stem":"哪個做法最能確保建議符合使用者的真正優先順序？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"點出矛盾，請使用者釐清哪個更重要。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"為兩種情境分別提供建議。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"依最近陳述的偏好進行。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"建議平衡型投資組合，不處理衝突。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"當使用者的偏好直接矛盾時，點出衝突並請求釐清是唯一能保證建議符合使用者真實意圖的方式。任何其他做法都涉及可能錯誤的假設：最大化報酬與低風險承受度是根本上不相容的目標，需要人類做決定。"},{"n":64,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"使用者在多個對話回合中精煉播放清單偏好。使用者說「I love jazz」的兩則訊息之後，Claude 問「What genres do you enjoy?」","stem":"最可能的原因是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"Claude 需要連接 vector database 才能維持對話記憶。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"模型的 context window 已被超過。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"Claude API 需要 <code>session_id</code> 參數。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"你的應用沒有把先前的訊息放進 <code>messages</code> 陣列。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"Claude 沒有 server-side 記憶，每次 API 呼叫都是無狀態的。若沒在每次請求的 <code>messages</code> 陣列中放入完整對話歷史，Claude 就不知道先前的回合。Vector database（A）與 <code>session_id</code>（C）都不是 Claude 架構的一部分；兩則訊息的交換不可能溢出 context window（B）。"},{"n":65,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"一段 40 分鐘的烹飪 session 後，對話達到 78,000 tokens。歷史包含過敏資訊、食譜換算、釐清過的烹飪術語與一般討論。你必須在保留重要資訊的同時減少 tokens。","stem":"哪個做法最能平衡保留與 token 減量？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"摘要整段對話歷史。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"只保留最近的 20,000 tokens。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"抽出關鍵的結構化資料（過敏、份量、偏好），摘要一般討論，並逐字保留最近的交流。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"把完整對話存在外部，透過語意搜尋檢索相關部分。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"混合做法以最低成本保留最高價值的資訊。過敏與食譜份量等關鍵事實被抽到緊湊的結構化區塊（避免摘要時的精度流失），一般討論被摘要，最近的交流則逐字保留以維持對話連貫性。A 與 B 有丟失關鍵飲食資訊的風險；D 對單一烹飪 session 來說是架構上的過度設計。"},{"n":66,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"使用者回報在長對話中，助理會忘記較早的話題與偏好。你目前的實作只保留最近 25 組訊息。","stem":"最有效的解法是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"混合做法：摘要較舊的訊息，同時逐字保留最近的訊息。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"對完整對話歷史做 vector 相似度搜尋。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"把 window 增加到 50 組訊息。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"每回合都摘要被丟棄的訊息，並把累積的摘要放在最前面。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"混合做法處理了問題的兩個面向：保留精確的最近 context（對話連貫性的關鍵），同時維持較早偏好的壓縮表示（防止訊息組被丟棄時完全流失）。增加 window（C）只是延後同樣的問題。Vector 搜尋（B）可能漏掉與當前查詢語意不相似的重要 context。每回合完整摘要（D）增加開銷並累積摘要錯誤。"},{"n":67,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"使用者回報對話超過 50 回合後延遲增加、成本上升。","stem":"主要原因是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"每次 API 請求都包含整段對話歷史。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"模型產生的回應越來越長。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"歷史增長時資料庫操作變慢。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"模型在建立需要更多處理的內部使用者檔案。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"Claude 的 API 完全無狀態，每次請求都必須在 <code>messages</code> 陣列中包含完整的對話歷史。對話增長時，每次請求攜帶更多 tokens，直接增加處理延遲與成本。模型在呼叫之間不維持任何內部狀態（D 錯誤），回應長度本質上也不與對話長度綁定（B）。"},{"n":68,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"三個月的每週 session 後，對話歷史增長到 85,000 tokens。當使用者問「What did we conclude about the theme of isolation?」時，助理給出泛泛的答案，而不是引用先前的討論。","stem":"最有效的做法是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"Rolling window 截斷。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"捕捉關鍵結論的漸進式摘要。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"語意 embeddings 搭配相關交流的檢索。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"加結構化 XML 標籤標記討論結論。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"對對話歷史做語意搜尋是唯一能擴展到三個月討論、又能按需浮現特定相關交流的做法。Rolling window（A）會丟棄大部分歷史。漸進式摘要（B）把討論壓成抽象概念，失去使用者詢問的具體結論。XML 標籤（D）需要重構所有過去內容，且無法在這個規模解決檢索問題。"},{"n":69,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"QA 測試中，Claude 在前 10–15 回合遵守 system prompt 的指引，但之後的回應開始偏離。對話仍在 token 限制內。","stem":"最好的解法是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"把行為指引移到第一則使用者訊息。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"20 回合後開始新對話。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"在對話的斷點插入 user 角色的訊息，重申指引。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"用回應後驗證重新產生不合規的回應。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"定期注入行為提醒，透過在對話歷史累積時定期重新確立限制，直接對抗指令飄移（instruction drift）。把指引移到第一則使用者訊息（A）降低了它們的權威性。開始新對話（B）摧毀 context。回應後驗證（D）是矯正而非預防，且增加顯著延遲。"},{"n":70,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"你的 AI 家教有一段 2,800 tokens 的 system prompt，定義教學方法與適應規則。12 回合後，助理開始忽略程度等級。","stem":"最有效的修法是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"每 4–5 回合注入提醒。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"用示範程度等級適應的 few-shot 範例取代冗長的規則。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"把關鍵規則放在 system prompt 的結尾。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"評估回應，難度等級不符就重新產生。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"一段 2,800 tokens、由宣告式規則組成的 system prompt 容易飄移，因為抽象規則要求模型每回合都對它們推理。用示範正確程度等級適應的具體 few-shot 範例取代冗長規則，給模型清楚的行為模式可比對，這在多回合中比抽象指令更能被可靠遵守。注入提醒（A）有幫助但處理的是症狀；放在結尾（C）一開始有幫助但無法應對回合層級的飄移；重新產生（D）昂貴且是矯正性的。"},{"n":71,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"你的助理必須維持熱情的語氣、解釋它的推理，並提出釐清問題。這些行為指引該定義在哪裡？","stem":"這些行為指引該定義在哪裡？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"放在每則使用者訊息的前面。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"放在 system prompt。","correct":true},{"letter":"C","html":"放在第一則 assistant 訊息。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"放在環境變數。","correct":false}],"answer":"B","why":"System prompt 就是專為適用於整段對話的持續行為限制與指引設計的。放在每則使用者訊息前面（A）是多餘的開銷。第一則 assistant 訊息（C）不可靠，因為模型可能偏離自己先前的陳述。環境變數（D）對模型行為沒有影響。"},{"n":72,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"使用者回報回應開頭重複出現像「Certainly!」與「I'd be happy to help!」的句子。","stem":"最有效的做法是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"附加一則以直接回答開頭的部分 assistant 訊息（prefill）。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"降低 temperature 設定。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"後處理回應以移除問候語。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"在 system prompt 加指令避免那些句子。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"用直接答案的開頭預填（prefill）assistant 的回應，在生成層級防止了問候模式：模型會從 prefill 接續，而不是產生新的開場句。System prompt 指令（D）有幫助但較不可靠，因為模型仍可能產生變體。後處理（C）是脆弱的變通法。Temperature（B）控制隨機性，不是特定的句子模式。"},{"n":73,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"使用者正在聊天時，一個 webhook 通知你的系統該使用者的包裹已出貨。你希望助理在下一次回應中自然地帶入這個資訊。","stem":"最好的做法是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"把出貨狀態加進 system prompt。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"立即送一則合成的使用者訊息。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"強制助理每回合呼叫狀態 tool。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"把狀態更新當前綴附加到下一則使用者訊息。","correct":true}],"answer":"D","why":"把狀態更新前綴到下一則使用者訊息，在自然的對話邊界注入即時 context，不打斷流程。修改 system prompt（A）需要重建 session，或在架構上很笨重。合成的使用者訊息（B）可能打斷自然對話流並混淆歸屬。每回合強制 tool 呼叫（C）在事件罕見時很浪費。"},{"n":74,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"使用者常送出像「Book a venue for the party」的請求。助理會問 4 個以上的釐清問題，造成 35% 的放棄率。","stem":"哪個做法最能改善這個取捨？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"用隱藏的預設值直接進行。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"在一則複合訊息中問所有釐清問題。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"明確陳述假設並進行，同時邀請修正。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"使用結構化的填表流程。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"明確陳述假設並進行，給使用者立即、有用的回應，同時保留他們修正錯誤假設的能力。隱藏的預設值（A）讓使用者不知道假設了什麼。複合問題清單（B）仍要求使用者先付出努力。結構化表單（D）增加而非減少摩擦，與降低放棄率的目標相悖。"},{"n":75,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"你的助理使用一個承包商人設（persona）的 system prompt。早期回合遵守規則，但到第 7 回合助理開始給泛泛的建議。對話長度只有 2,500 tokens。","stem":"最可能的原因是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"System prompt 只建立初始行為。","correct":false},{"letter":"B","html":"模型注意力隨回合累積而減弱。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"累積的 assistant 回應稀釋了 system prompt 的影響力。","correct":true},{"letter":"D","html":"System prompt 只送一次。","correct":false}],"answer":"C","why":"隨著 assistant 回應在對話歷史中累積，反映 system prompt 行為限制的文字比例，相對於越來越多的 assistant 產生內容而下降。模型越來越比對自己先前的輸出而非 system prompt，即使在很短的 token 長度也會加劇飄移。System prompt 在每次 API 呼叫都包含（D 作為單獨解釋是錯的），模型注意力退化（B）在 2,500 tokens 時不會發生。"},{"n":76,"scenario":"Conversational AI Architecture Patterns","situation":"使用者提出像「Can you help with the report?」的模糊請求。助理回應多個問題（哪份報告？什麼幫助？期限？），造成 40% 的放棄率。","stem":"最好的解法是？","options":[{"letter":"A","html":"做出合理假設、明確陳述它們，並表示可以調整。","correct":true},{"letter":"B","html":"回應前用較小的模型分類模糊性。","correct":false},{"letter":"C","html":"使用預定義的解讀而不陳述假設。","correct":false},{"letter":"D","html":"限制助理每回合只問一個釐清問題。","correct":false}],"answer":"A","why":"用陳述過的合理假設進行，完全消除了來回往返，同時讓使用者知情並掌控。預定義的靜默解讀（C）在回應不符意圖時讓使用者困惑。單一問題限制（D）仍需要多回合往返。較小的分類模型（B）增加延遲與基礎設施複雜度，卻沒解決核心的 UX 問題。"}],"scenarios":["Multi-agent Research System","Claude Code for Continuous Integration","Code Generation with Claude Code","Customer Support Agent","Conversational AI Architecture Patterns"],"headings":[]},{"slug":"part4-1","title":"實作練習","title_html":"實作練習","part":4,"kind":"text","read_minutes":3,"blocks":[{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"練習 1：帶 Escalation 邏輯的多 Tool Agent","slug":"練習-1-帶-escalation-邏輯的多-tool-agent"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>目標：</strong> 設計一個有 tool 整合、結構化錯誤處理與 escalation 的 agent loop。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>步驟：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"定義 3–4 個帶詳細描述的 MCP tools（放兩個相似的 tools 來測試 tool 選擇）","callout":false},{"html":"實作檢查 <code>stop_reason</code>（<code>\"tool_use\"</code> / <code>\"end_turn\"</code>）的 agent loop","callout":false},{"html":"加結構化錯誤回應：<code>errorCategory</code>、<code>isRetryable</code>、描述","callout":false},{"html":"實作攔截 hook，阻擋超過門檻的操作並轉向 escalation","callout":false},{"html":"用多面向的請求測試","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>涵蓋 Domain：</strong> 1（Agent 架構）、2（Tools 與 MCP）、5（Context 與可靠性）","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"練習 2：為團隊開發設定 Claude Code","slug":"練習-2-為團隊開發設定-claude-code"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>目標：</strong> 設定 CLAUDE.md、自訂 commands、路徑專屬規則與 MCP servers。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>步驟：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"建立含通用標準的 project-level CLAUDE.md","callout":false},{"html":"為不同程式碼區域建立帶 YAML frontmatter 的 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 檔案（<code>paths: [\"src/api/**/*\"]</code>、<code>paths: [\"**/*.test.*\"]</code>）","callout":false},{"html":"在 <code>.claude/skills/</code> 建一個帶 <code>context: fork</code> 與 <code>allowed-tools</code> 的專案 skill","callout":false},{"html":"在 <code>.mcp.json</code> 用環境變數設定一個 MCP server，加一個 <code>~/.claude.json</code> 的個人覆蓋","callout":false},{"html":"在不同複雜度的任務上測試 planning mode 與直接執行","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>涵蓋 Domain：</strong> 3（Claude Code 設定）、2（Tools 與 MCP）","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"練習 3：結構化資料抽取 Pipeline","slug":"練習-3-結構化資料抽取-pipeline"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>目標：</strong> JSON schema、用 <code>tool_use</code> 做結構化輸出、驗證 / retry 迴圈、批次處理。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>步驟：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"用 JSON schema 定義一個抽取 tool（required/optional 欄位、帶「other」的 enum、nullable 欄位）","callout":false},{"html":"建立驗證迴圈：出錯時帶著文件、錯誤的抽取結果與具體驗證錯誤 retry","callout":false},{"html":"為不同結構的文件加 few-shot 範例","callout":false},{"html":"用 Message Batches API 做批次處理：100 份文件，用 <code>custom_id</code> 處理失敗","callout":false},{"html":"路由給人工：欄位層級的信心分數、依文件類型分析","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>涵蓋 Domain：</strong> 4（Prompt engineering）、5（Context 與可靠性）","callout":false},{"type":"h","level":2,"html":"練習 4：設計並除錯多 Agent 研究 Pipeline","slug":"練習-4-設計並除錯多-agent-研究-pipeline"},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>目標：</strong> Subagent 編排、context 傳遞、錯誤傳播、帶來源追蹤的 synthesis。","callout":false},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>步驟：</strong>","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"一個 coordinator 加 2+ 個 subagents（<code>allowedTools</code> 包含 <code>\"Task\"</code>，context 在 prompt 中明確傳遞）","callout":false},{"html":"在單一回應中用多個 <code>Task</code> 呼叫平行執行 subagents","callout":false},{"html":"要求結構化的 subagent 輸出：主張、引文、來源 URL、發表日期","callout":false},{"html":"模擬 subagent timeout：回傳結構化錯誤 context 給 coordinator，帶部分結果繼續","callout":false},{"html":"用矛盾資料測試：保留兩個值並附歸屬；區分已確認與有爭議的發現","callout":false}]},{"type":"p","html":"<strong>涵蓋 Domain：</strong> 1（Agent 架構）、2（Tools 與 MCP）、5（Context 與可靠性）","callout":false}],"headings":[{"slug":"練習-1-帶-escalation-邏輯的多-tool-agent","title":"練習 1：帶 Escalation 邏輯的多 Tool Agent"},{"slug":"練習-2-為團隊開發設定-claude-code","title":"練習 2：為團隊開發設定 Claude Code"},{"slug":"練習-3-結構化資料抽取-pipeline","title":"練習 3：結構化資料抽取 Pipeline"},{"slug":"練習-4-設計並除錯多-agent-研究-pipeline","title":"練習 4：設計並除錯多 Agent 研究 Pipeline"}]},{"slug":"part4-2","title":"附錄：技術與概念速查","title_html":"附錄：技術與概念速查","part":4,"kind":"text","read_minutes":2,"blocks":[{"type":"table","headers":["技術","關鍵面向"],"rows":[["<strong>Claude Agent SDK</strong>","AgentDefinition、agent loops、<code>stop_reason</code>、hooks（PostToolUse）、透過 Task 產生 subagents、<code>allowedTools</code>"],["<strong>Model Context Protocol（MCP）</strong>","MCP servers、tools、resources、<code>isError</code>、tool descriptions、<code>.mcp.json</code>、環境變數"],["<strong>Claude Code</strong>","CLAUDE.md 層級、帶 glob pattern 的 <code>.claude/rules/</code>、<code>.claude/commands/</code>、帶 SKILL.md 的 <code>.claude/skills/</code>、planning mode、<code>/compact</code>、<code>--resume</code>、<code>fork_session</code>"],["<strong>Claude Code CLI</strong>","非互動模式的 <code>-p</code> / <code>--print</code>、<code>--output-format json</code>、<code>--json-schema</code>"],["<strong>Claude API</strong>","帶 JSON schema 的 <code>tool_use</code>、<code>tool_choice</code>（\"auto\"/\"any\"/強制）、<code>stop_reason</code>、<code>max_tokens</code>、system prompts"],["<strong>Message Batches API</strong>","省 50%、最長 24 小時窗口、<code>custom_id</code>、不支援多回合 tool calling"],["<strong>JSON Schema</strong>","Required vs optional、nullable 欄位、enum 型別、「other」+ detail、strict mode"],["<strong>Pydantic</strong>","Schema 驗證、語意錯誤、驗證 / retry 迴圈"],["<strong>內建 tools</strong>","Read、Write、Edit、Bash、Grep、Glob：用途與選擇標準"],["<strong>Few-shot prompting</strong>","針對模糊情境的範例、泛化到新模式"],["<strong>Prompt chaining</strong>","順序分解成聚焦的多輪"],["<strong>Context window</strong>","Token 預算、漸進式摘要、「lost in the middle」、scratchpad 檔案"],["<strong>Session 管理</strong>","Resume、<code>fork_session</code>、具名 sessions、context 隔離"],["<strong>信心校準</strong>","欄位層級評分、用標註集校準、分層抽樣"]]}],"headings":[]},{"slug":"part4-3","title":"不考的範圍","title_html":"不考的範圍","part":4,"kind":"text","read_minutes":1,"blocks":[{"type":"p","html":"以下相鄰主題<strong>不會</strong>出現在考試中：","callout":false},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"html":"Fine-tuning Claude 模型或訓練自訂模型","callout":false},{"html":"Claude API 的認證、計費或帳號管理","callout":false},{"html":"特定程式語言或框架的細節實作（超出 tool / schema 設定所需的部分）","callout":false},{"html":"部署或託管 MCP servers（基礎設施、網路、容器編排）","callout":false},{"html":"Claude 的內部架構、訓練過程或模型權重","callout":false},{"html":"Constitutional AI、RLHF 或安全訓練方法","callout":false},{"html":"Embedding 模型或 vector database 的實作細節","callout":false},{"html":"Computer use（瀏覽器自動化、桌面互動）","callout":false},{"html":"影像分析能力（Vision）","callout":false},{"html":"Streaming API 或 server-sent events","callout":false},{"html":"Rate limiting、配額或詳細的 API 成本計算","callout":false},{"html":"OAuth、API key 輪替或認證協定細節","callout":false},{"html":"雲端供應商專屬設定（AWS、GCP、Azure）","callout":false},{"html":"效能 benchmark 或模型比較指標","callout":false},{"html":"Prompt caching 的實作細節（知道它存在即可）","callout":false},{"html":"Token 計數演算法或 tokenization 細節","callout":false}]}],"headings":[]},{"slug":"part4-4","title":"準備建議","title_html":"準備建議","part":4,"kind":"text","read_minutes":2,"blocks":[{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"html":"<strong>用 Claude Agent SDK 建一個 agent</strong>：實作完整的 agent loop，包含 tool calling、錯誤處理與 session 管理。練習 subagents 與明確的 context 傳遞。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>為真實專案設定 Claude Code</strong>：使用 CLAUDE.md 層級、<code>.claude/rules/</code> 的路徑專屬規則、帶 <code>context: fork</code> 與 <code>allowed-tools</code> 的 skills，以及 MCP server 整合。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>設計並測試 MCP tools</strong>：撰寫能區分相似 tools 的描述、回傳帶類別與 retry 旗標的結構化錯誤，並用模糊的使用者請求測試。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>建一個資料抽取 pipeline</strong>：使用帶 JSON schema 的 <code>tool_use</code>、驗證 / retry 迴圈、optional/nullable 欄位，以及透過 Message Batches API 的批次處理。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>練習 prompt engineering</strong>：為模糊情境加 few-shot 範例、明確的 review 標準，以及大型 code review 的多輪架構。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>研讀 context 管理模式</strong>：從冗長輸出抽取事實、使用 scratchpad 檔案，並把探索委派給 subagents 以應對 context 限制。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>理解 escalation 與 human-in-the-loop</strong>：何時 escalate（政策空缺、使用者明確要求、無法取得進展）以及基於信心的路由 workflow。","callout":false},{"html":"<strong>正式考試前做一次模擬考</strong>。它使用相同的情境與形式。","callout":false}]},{"type":"hr"},{"type":"p","html":"本頁翻譯整理自 <a href=\"https://github.com/paullarionov/claude-certified-architect/blob/main/guide_en.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">paullarionov/claude-certified-architect — guide_en.md</a>，感謝原作者的整理與分享。","callout":false}],"headings":[]}],"question_count":88,"read_minutes":208};
